rulings: ["[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Although Grinning Ignus’s ability has a timing restriction, it’s still a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and it can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you cast Grinning Ignus during your main phase, it will enter the battlefield and you’ll receive priority. If no abilities trigger because of this, you can activate its ability immediately, before any other player has a chance to remove it from the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast this as normal during your main phase, it will enter the battlefield and you’ll receive priority. If no abilities trigger because of this, you can activate its ability immediately, before any other player has a chance to remove it from the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Accomplished Alchemist\'s second ability counts the total amount of life gained without taking into account any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you lost 3 life and gained 3 life earlier in the turn, you\'ll add three mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Dina\'s first ability triggers only once for each life gain event, no matter how much life was gained."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life gain event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, a “whenever you gain life” ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "When Dina\'s first ability resolves, each opponent loses only 1 life, no matter how much life was gained."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'X is the power the creature had when it was on the battlefield, not the power it has in the graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If all of Prismari Command\'s targets are illegal as it tries to resolve, it will do nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If at least one target is still legal as Prismari Command tries to resolve, it will resolve and do as much as it can.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is greater than 3 as Access Tunnel\'s second ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. However, if instead the creature\'s power is raised above 3 after the ability resolves, it still can\'t be blocked that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or less has been blocked, Access Tunnel\'s second ability won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Use the characteristics of each permanent as it returns to the battlefield to determine if it should enter with an additional +1/+1 counter, an additional loyalty counter, or in very unusual cases, both. Notably, if you exile a creature that was only a creature because of a type-changing effect, it will enter as a noncreature permanent and won\'t get any additional +1/+1 counters from the effect of Semester\'s End."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to add either {B} or {G} for each permanent destroyed. You aren\'t limited to one color."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus\'s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If a land card with an appropriate subtype is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as one of these lands, you may reveal the other land to have the "Snarl" enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect instructs you to put one of these lands onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' The "Snarl" itself doesn\\\'t have any land subtypes. You can\\\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect increases or decreases the cost of spells you cast, that cost increase or decrease is applied to the alternative cost you chose to pay. In that case, the cost was still paid for the purposes of the effect, even if you paid more or less for it when it was cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If you choose to pay one alternative cost, you can\\\'t pay any other alternative costs. For example, if an effect lets you cast a "Mastery" spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t also choose to pay its given alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If you copy a "Mastery" spell and the alternative cost was paid, the copy will resolve as though the cost was paid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' In a multiplayer game, you choose which opponent takes the prescribed action as the spell resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' The mana value of a spell on the stack is determined by its mana cost, not any alternative costs you used to pay for it.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': ''}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Explore the Vastlands has received an update to its Oracle text. The official text is listed above. Specifically, revealing either a land card or an instant or sorcery card is optional. Any player who can’t reveal a card or chooses not to simply puts all cards they looked at on the bottom of their library in a random order. Each player gains 3 life whether they revealed a card or not.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For Wandering Archaic’s triggered ability, the opponent chooses whether to pay {2} before their spell resolves. If they don’t pay {2}, your copy will resolve before the original spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'While resolving Explore the Vastlands, first the active player reveals the cards they are going to put into their hand. Then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing choices made before they choose.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'A permanent spell is an artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker spell. You may still play lands and cast instant and sorcery spells. Other effects can still put permanents onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Codie’s activated ability is a mana ability. It can’t be countered or responded to, and you can activate it while casting a spell. If you do, that spell is “the next spell” you cast this turn.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you exile your entire library without exiling an instant or sorcery card with a lesser mana value, you will randomize the exiled cards and they again become your library, ending the effect. You will not continue to exile and shuffle your library forever.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The delayed triggered ability created by Codie’s second ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger. That ability will resolve even if the spell is countered or otherwise doesn’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The last card exiled is not cast immediately. You may cast it until the end of the current turn. If you do not cast it, that card will remain in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The mana value of the spell that caused the ability to trigger is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The types and mana value of a double-faced card in exile are determined by the characteristics of its front face. The mana value of a split card is the total mana value of both halves of the split card added together.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'While you control Codie (as much as anyone can really “control” Codie), you may cast any face of a modal double-faced card that’s an instant or sorcery face, even if the other face is a permanent face.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Abilities that trigger when something else causes an ability to trigger will always go on the stack after the ability that caused them to trigger. For example, Strict Proctor’s ability will always resolve before the triggered ability that caused it to trigger does. This is a change from previous rules.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Effects that modify how a creature enters the battlefield are not triggered abilities and are not affected by Strict Proctor’s ability. These include (but aren’t limited to) effects that have a permanent enter the battlefield as a copy of another permanent, effects that have a permanent enter with counters, and effects that have a permanent enter tapped.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They’re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].”'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Academic Probation is a sorcery, but in some unusual cases it may be cast in response to other spells. Spells with the chosen name that somehow happen to already be on the stack when Academic Probation resolves will not be affected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have a colon in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with "when," "whenever," or "at") are unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Although spells with the chosen name can\'t be cast, a card with that name can still be put onto the battlefield by another effect (if it\'s a permanent card)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Although you may want to include Lessons in your sideboard if you\'re playing with cards that instruct you to learn, Lesson cards can be included in your main deck like other instant or sorcery cards."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "For the first mode, no one can cast spells between the time a card is named and the time that Academic Probation\'s effect starts to apply."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you target a noncreature permanent with the second mode and it later becomes a creature, that creature still won\'t be able to attack or block until your next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Lesson is a spell subtype found on some instant and sorcery cards in the Strixhaven set. The Lesson subtype has no special rules associated with it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You can name either face of a modal double-faced card, but not both, and you can name either half of a split card, but not both. Opponents may still cast the face or half you didn\'t name."}]', "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon and appear in the form “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts. Loyalty abilities of planeswalkers are also activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'An activated ability that costs mana to activate is not a “mana ability” unless it could also produce mana and has no targets.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Casting Revel in Silence in response to a spell or ability won’t affect that spell or ability. That is, it’s not countermagic.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'After removing the last hone counter, casting the spell is optional. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored. If an effect prohibits you from casting the card or you choose not to cast it, it remains exiled with no hone counters on it, and you won’t be able to cast it later.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Any cards exiled with Nassari’s ability that you don’t cast will remain exiled. You won’t be able to cast those cards on future turns, although Nassari’s ability will give you another group of cards to choose from each time it resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Nassari’s last ability triggers when you cast any spell from exile, not just the cards that were exiled with its first ability.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The cost reduction given by Uvilda, Dean of Perfection won’t reduce any colored mana requirements in the spell’s cost.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Uvilda, Dean of Perfection). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You exile cards with Nassari, Dean of Expression face up. Casting those spells is subject to the normal timing restrictions for spells.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Although you may want to include Lessons in your sideboard if you’re playing with cards that instruct you to learn, Lesson cards can be included in your main deck like other instant or sorcery cards.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Containment Breach resolves, and the target artifact has a mana value of 2 or less, but it wasn’t destroyed (perhaps because it has indestructible), you will still create a Pest.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the artifact or enchantment is an illegal target as Containment Breach tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t create a Pest.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Lesson is a spell subtype found on some instant and sorcery cards in the Strixhaven set. The Lesson subtype has no special rules associated with it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Although you may want to include Lessons in your sideboard if you’re playing with cards that instruct you to learn, Lesson cards can be included in your main deck like other instant or sorcery cards.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Illuminate History will stay on the stack until it is finished resolving, so it will not count itself as one of the cards in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Lesson is a spell subtype found on some instant and sorcery cards in the Strixhaven set. The Lesson subtype has no special rules associated with it.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may choose not to discard any cards as Illuminate History resolves. In that case, you will not draw any cards, but you might still create a Spirit.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Although you may want to include Lessons in your sideboard if you’re playing with cards that instruct you to learn, Lesson cards can be included in your main deck like other instant or sorcery cards.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Lesson is a spell subtype found on some instant and sorcery cards in the Strixhaven set. The Lesson subtype has no special rules associated with it.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The number of cards in each player’s hand is determined as Teachings of the Archaics resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Although you may want to include Lessons in your sideboard if you’re playing with cards that instruct you to learn, Lesson cards can be included in your main deck like other instant or sorcery cards.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Lesson is a spell subtype found on some instant and sorcery cards in the Strixhaven set. The Lesson subtype has no special rules associated with it.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You choose Frog or Octopus as Mercurial Transformation resolves, not when you cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Although you may want to include Lessons in your sideboard if you’re playing with cards that instruct you to learn, Lesson cards can be included in your main deck like other instant or sorcery cards.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Lesson is a spell subtype found on some instant and sorcery cards in the Strixhaven set. The Lesson subtype has no special rules associated with it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Although you must have exactly zero or seven cards in your hand to activate the last ability, it doesn’t matter how many cards you have in your hand as that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you don’t choose to either reveal the card or put it into your graveyard, the card stays on top of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you gain life” triggers just once for each life gain event, no matter how much life you gain.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life gain event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, a “whenever you gain life” ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you gain life at the same time Blood Researcher is dealt lethal damage, it dies before its ability can put a +1/+1 counter on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you gain life” triggers just once for each life-gaining event, no matter how much life you gain.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, a “whenever you gain life” ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a nontoken creature an opponent controls would die, and both Valentin and another effect are trying to exile it instead, that opponent chooses which effect to apply. If Valentin’s effect ends up not applying because of this choice, the triggered ability that allows you to pay {2} won’t trigger, even if the creature card ends up in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you gain life at the same time a creature you control is dealt lethal damage, that creature dies before Lisette’s ability can put a +1/+1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may only pay {1} once for each life gain event.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Any cards exiled with Ardent Dustspeaker that you don’t play remain exiled. You will not be able to play them on later turns, even if Ardent Dustspeaker’s ability triggers again.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Playing the cards exiled with Ardent Dustspeaker follows the normal rules for playing those cards. You must pay their costs, if any, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if one of the cards is a creature card, you can cast that card by paying its mana cost only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The cards exiled by Ardent Dustspeaker’s ability are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Unless an effect allows you to play additional lands that turn, you can play land cards exiled with Ardent Dustspeaker only if you haven’t played a land yet that turn. In most cases, if you exile two land cards, you won’t be able to play both.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may play those cards that turn even if Ardent Dustspeaker leaves the battlefield or another player gains control of it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Any effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness without setting them to a specific value (i.e. ones that don’t affect base power and/or toughness) will apply after its base power and toughness are set, regardless of the order those effects were created. The same is true for counters that modify its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'As the last ability resolves, the base power and toughness of other creatures you control are set to Tanazir Quandrix’s actual power and toughness, not just its base power and toughness. If Tanazir Quandrix’s power or toughness changes later in the turn, the other creatures you control aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Tanazir Quandrix’s last ability overwrites all previous effects that set a creature’s power and toughness to specific values. Other effects that set its power or toughness to specific values that start to apply after the ability resolves will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To double the number of +1/+1 counters on a permanent, put a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number it already has. Other cards that interact with putting counters on it will interact with this effect accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Any effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness without setting them to a specific value (i.e. ones that don’t affect base power and/or toughness) will apply after its base power and toughness are set, regardless of the order those effects were created. The same is true for counters that modify its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Square Up overwrites all previous effects that set the target creature’s power and toughness to specific values. Other effects that set its power or toughness to specific values that start to apply after Square Up resolves will overwrite this effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Any effects that modify a creature’s power without setting it to a specific value (i.e. ones that don’t affect base power) will apply after its base power is set, regardless of the order those effects were created. The same is true for counters that modify its power.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Symmetry Sage’s triggered ability overwrites all previous effects that set the target creature’s power to a specific value. Other effects that set its power to specific values that start to apply after this ability resolves will overwrite this effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “As [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[This creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each Spirit token you create refers only to the card you exile during the resolution of the ability that created that token. When it leaves the battlefield, you return only that card to your graveyard, not any other card exiled by Hofri.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Hofri Ghostforge’s last ability is linked to the ability it grants the Spirit token. If a replacement effect causes you to create more than one Spirit token with this effect, they will all have that ability, and the exiled card will be returned to the graveyard if any of them leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If another creature enters the battlefield as a copy of the Spirit token or another effect creates a copy of the Spirit token, it will have the triggered ability granted by Hofri, but will not be linked to Hofri’s ability and will not return the card to the graveyard when it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the copied creature was copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you can’t exile the card, perhaps because another effect moved the card before the triggered ability started resolving, you won’t create a token.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The copy uses the copiable values of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield before it died, not as it existed in the graveyard before it was exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless the creature was copying something else; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature was tapped or untapped, whether it had any counters on it or Auras or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'As Awaken the Blood Avatar resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, the opponent whose turn it is) chooses a creature they control, then each other opponent in turn order does the same knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Awaken the Blood Avatar’s first ability can’t reduce its cost below {B}{R}. However, you can sacrifice any number of creatures, even if they won’t reduce its cost any further.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Include any additional costs to cast Awaken the Blood Avatar before applying its own cost reduction. For example, if Extus is your commander, and an additional cost of {6} applies from the “commander tax,” you may cast Awaken the Blood Avatar by sacrificing four creatures and paying {4}{B}{R}.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Returning a nonlegendary creature card is not optional. If there is at least one in your graveyard, you must target it with the magecraft ability.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The Blood Avatar will be awakened even if no player has creatures to sacrifice when it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'As Deadly Vanity resolves, you choose which creature or planeswalker you are saving. Once the choice is made, there is no window for players to respond before the rest of the creatures and planeswalkers are destroyed.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Because Deadly Vanity does not target the permanent you choose to save, you may choose creatures with hexproof or protection from black.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may activate Selfless Glyphweaver’s ability only if Selfless Glyphweaver is on the battlefield. Only creatures you control as that ability resolves will gain indestructible. Creatures that come under your control later in the turn will not.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may choose any creature or planeswalker, even one controlled by an opponent.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You must choose a creature or planeswalker if there is one on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'As Practical Research resolves, you can discard either one instant or sorcery card or discard two cards, each of which may or may not be an instant or sorcery card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'As Quandrix Command tries to resolve, if the fourth mode is chosen and all of the target cards are illegal, but the target player is still legal, that player will still shuffle their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If all of Quandrix Command\'s targets are illegal as it tries to resolve, it will do nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If at least one target is still legal as Quandrix Command tries to resolve, it will resolve and do as much as it can.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Augusta’s last ability triggers whenever you attack with any creatures, even if you didn’t attack with Augusta.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Augusta’s last ability untaps all creatures you control, not just the ones that attacked this turn. Then you choose which creatures to tap, if any.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Despite the term “other tapped creatures,” Augusta’s first ability doesn’t care whether Augusta is tapped or untapped. The same is true for the second ability. Both abilities apply as long as Augusta is on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Plargg, Dean of Chaos’s second ability allows you to cast the spell during that ability’s resolution, ignoring its normal timing restrictions.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat. It’s still attacking normally.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on creatures until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Augmenter Pugilist may become lethal if the number of lands you control falls below eight.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Echoing Equation affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures that come under your control later in the turn won’t be copies of the chosen creature.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Echoing Equation copies the printed values of the target creature. It won’t copy any counters on that creature or any effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on, and a creature becoming a copy doesn’t remove any such counters or effects that are already applying to it. Notably, Echoing Equation won’t copy any type-changing effects that are currently making the target a creature. For example, if you choose a land that’s become a creature, all your other creatures will become noncreature lands until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else, other creatures you control become copies of whatever the chosen creature is copying.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the target creature is a token, other creatures you control will copy the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Any of those creatures that aren’t tokens won’t become tokens in this case. Similarly, if the target creature is a nontoken creature, creature tokens you control won’t stop being tokens.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on creatures until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Scurrid Colony may become lethal if the number of lands you control falls below eight.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the number of lands you control falls below eight, Scurrid Colony loses the +2/+2 bonus. This may cause it to die to damage that is already marked on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Because the magecraft ability supplies an alternative cost of {1} for the spell, you cannot pay any other alternative costs that may apply. However, you may pay additional costs and must pay any additional costs that are required.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost using Jadzi’s magecraft ability, you must choose 0 as the value of X.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you reveal a modal double-faced card with Jadzi’s triggered ability, and both faces are nonland, you may cast either face by paying {1} rather than its mana cost. If only the back face is a land, you may cast the front face. If both faces are lands, you will put onto the battlefield front face up.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you’re casting the card you reveal with Jadzi’s ability, you ignore normal timing restrictions.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Putting a land onto the battlefield does not count as playing a land for the turn and doesn’t use the normal timing restrictions.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may activate Jadzi’s activated ability only while Jadzi is on the battlefield. If Jadzi is no longer on the battlefield as the ability resolves, it won’t return her to your hand from any other zone.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may choose not to cast a nonland card revealed by Jadzi’s triggered ability. If you don’t cast it, it stays on top of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Blood Age General’s activated ability affects only Spirits that are attacking as it resolves. If you activate it while no Spirits are attacking, it will have no effect, even if you attack with one or more Spirits later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Once the activated ability resolves, Spirits that get the +1/+0 bonus will retain it until end of turn, even after they stop attacking or if they stop being Spirits.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Cards are exiled face up unless an effect states otherwise.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Exiled cards with study counters on them retain their study counters even if Kianne or Imbraham leave the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The second abilities of both Kianne and Imbraham look at all cards you own in exile with study counters, even if they were exiled by a different permanent, such as another Kianne or Imbraham.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may choose 0 as the value of X as you activate Imbraham’s last ability. If you do, you will not exile any cards from your library. However, you may still put a card previously exiled with a study counter on it into your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled are always exiled face up unless specified otherwise by the effect that exiled it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you choose to play the exiled card this turn, you must still pay all costs and follow all timing restrictions required by that card. If it\'s a land, you can\'t play it unless you have a land play available."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play the exiled card, it remains exiled. It won\'t be available to be played on future turns."}]', "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Cards put into your graveyard this way are not discarded. Any ability that triggers when you discard a card will not trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If either your graveyard or your hand has no cards in it, the exchange still happens. If one of those zones has any cards in it, you will move them to the other zone.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you have more cards in hand than your maximum hand size (usually seven) during the cleanup step of your turn, you will need to discard cards down to your maximum hand size.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Check the creatures you control as the triggered ability resolves to determine which abilities Thunderous Orator gains. Once Thunderous Orator gains an ability, it doesn’t matter what happens to other creatures you control with that ability.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you control a creature with one of the abilities listed in the last sentence, Thunderous Orator will gain the that ability, not flying.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Copies of Tend the Pests will use the power of the creature sacrificed for the original spell to determine the number of Pests each copy creates. Because the copies aren’t cast, you won’t sacrifice additional creatures for them.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Countering a spell normally puts that card into the graveyard, so that card will be there to find and exile.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the back face of a modal double-faced card is countered, you will not be able to exile any cards, including the one that you countered, because those cards have only their front-face characteristics (including name) in the graveyard, hand, and library.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Creatures have different power if their powers are not equal. For example, if you have a creature with 2 power, two creatures with 1 power, and a creature with -1 power, you will draw three cards as Golden Ratio resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Daemogoth Woe-Eater’s second ability will trigger if you sacrifice it as its first ability resolves. It will also trigger if you sacrifice it for any other reason.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Devouring Tendrils creates a delayed triggered ability that triggers whenever the target creature or planeswalker you don’t control dies this turn, even if it didn’t die because of the damage dealt as Devouring Tendrils resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Elemental Expressionist has received an update to its Oracle text. The official text is listed above. Specifically, the second ability granted to the target creature doesn’t care that the creature’s controller is the one exiling it. If the creature is put into exile for any reason, that ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the magecraft ability triggers and resolves more than once with the same creature as the target, that creature will have multiple instances of each of the two triggered abilities the magecraft ability grants it. Each instance of the second ability will trigger separately, and you’ll create an Elemental token for each of them. (Multiple instances of the first granted ability are redundant.)'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you target a creature token with Elemental Expressionist’s ability, and that token would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled (very briefly) before it ceases to exist, and you will still create an Elemental token.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For Professor Onyx’s last loyalty ability, “this process” is the following: First, the next opponent in turn order may choose a card in hand without revealing it, then each other opponent in turn order does the same. Then all the chosen cards are revealed and discarded at the same time and each opponent who didn’t discard a card (whether they chose not to or had an empty hand) loses 3 life. This all will happen seven times, for a maximum loss of 21 life per opponent.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For Professor Onyx’s second loyalty ability, if an opponent has multiple creatures with the greatest power, that player choose which one to sacrifice. The next opponent in turn order chooses which creature they are sacrificing, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Professor Onyx seems familiar, it’s probably because you’ve seen this type of planeswalker before.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn’t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Lorehold Apprentice’s ability can give your Spirit creatures multiple instances of “{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to each opponent.” However, each Spirit can only activate one of these abilities at a time, and each ability will still only deal 1 damage.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To double the number of +1/+1 counters on a permanent, put a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number it already has. Other cards that interact with putting counters on it will interact with this effect accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each other planeswalker you control gains Kasmina’s loyalty abilities in addition to their own. For each planeswalker you control, you may still activate only one of that planeswalker’s loyalty abilities per turn.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'When you activate Kasmina’s last loyalty ability on another planeswalker, you search your library for a card that shares a color with that planeswalker, not with Kasmina. You can’t search for a colorless card, even if the planeswalker is colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Effects that increase or decrease costs are applied after you choose the value of X, and will not impact the results of the spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast Multiple Choice without paying its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X. Cheating on tests is frowned upon.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Multiple Choice doesn’t have any targets.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You can choose 0 as the value of X as you cast Multiple Choice, but it will have no effect when it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Efreet Flamepainter’s triggered ability lets you cast the spell immediately, ignoring timing restrictions. It doesn’t let you choose to cast it at a later time.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Excess damage caused by a spell or ability is similar to how combat damage from a creature with trample is handled. Start with the amount of damage being dealt to the creature and determine what is “lethal.” This is the creature’s toughness minus the amount of damage that it already has marked on it, but ignoring any replacement or prevention effects that will modify this damage. Also ignore whether the creature has an ability such as indestructible that will result in it not being destroyed by this damage.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Pigment Storm tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. It won’t deal damage to any player.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Once you’ve determined how much damage is excess, Pigment Storm simultaneously deals damage to the creature and to its controller. This damage may be modified by replacement or prevention effects.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Pigment Storm’s replacement effect is a self-replacement effect. It is applied before any other replacement effects that would change the amount of damage dealt to the target creature and its controller.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Exponential Growth doubles a creature’s power sequentially, not all at the same time. For example, if X is 3 and you target a 2/2 creature, you will double its power once to 4, again to 8, and a third time to 16, making it a 16/2 creature until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a creature’s power is less than 0 when it’s doubled, instead that creature gets -X/-0, where X is how much less than 0 its power is. For example, if an effect has given a 5/5 creature -7/-0 so that it’s a -2/5 creature, doubling its power makes it a -4/5 creature.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to “double” a creature’s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply. (This is not the value of X you chose when you cast the spell)'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'First the active player chooses which creature or planeswalker they’ll sacrifice, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing choices made before their choice. Then all those permanents are sacrificed simultaneously.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast Deadly Brew and control any creatures or planeswalkers as it resolves, you must sacrifice one of them.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You cannot return the same permanent card that you sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You choose which permanent card you’re returning to your hand, if any, as Deadly Brew resolves, after permanents are sacrificed.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Flamethrower Sonata goes on the stack without a target. While it is resolving, you discard a card, then draw a card. When you discard an instant or sorcery card this way, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and you pick a target to be dealt damage. This is different from effects that say “If you do . . .” in that players can respond to the triggered ability knowing how much damage will be dealt.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn’t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you have no cards in hand as Flamethrower Sonata resolves, you won’t be able to discard a card, but you will draw a card. No damage will be dealt.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You choose which instant or sorcery card to exile as Torrent Sculptor’s enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. You must exile one if able.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For Rowan’s emblem, you can pay {2} only once. You can’t pay more to copy the spell more than once.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For Will’s first loyalty ability, any effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness without setting them to a specific value (i.e. ones that don’t affect base power and/or toughness) will apply after its base power and toughness are set, regardless of the order those effects were created. The same is true for counters that modify its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Neither face’s first ability can reduce colored mana requirements of spells you cast.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Rowan or Will’s first ability). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Fortifying Draught counts the total amount of life gained without considering any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you lost 2 life and gained 3 life earlier in the turn, you will gain 2 more life from Fortifying Draught and the target creature will get +5/+5.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Frost Trickster’s ability can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Blade Historian leaves the battlefield after first-strike combat damage has been dealt but before regular combat damage (perhaps because it attacked and was destroyed by first-strike combat damage), attacking creatures you control will lose double strike. A creature without double strike won’t deal regular combat damage if it already dealt first-strike damage that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Bookwurm is removed from your graveyard in response to its last ability, it won’t be put into your library.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you have zero or one card left in your library when Bookwurm’s last ability resolves, it is put on the bottom of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Dream Strix becomes the target of a spell, it will be sacrificed before that spell tries to resolve. If it is the only target of that spell, it will be removed from the stack rather than resolving, and no part of its instructions will be performed.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a card is brought into the game from outside the game, it will stay in the game until it ends or until its owner leaves the game, whichever comes first.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If instructed to learn, you may do nothing. Discarding a card and putting a Lesson card into your hand are both optional.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you bring a card into the game from outside the game in a Constructed tournament (or a Constructed game played under tournament conditions), you may select only a card from your sideboard. In casual Constructed games, the card comes from your collection.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you bring a card into the game from outside the game in a Sealed Deck or Booster Draft event, you may select only a card that is in the card pool that you built your deck from.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Heated Debate’s target is illegal (perhaps because it gained protection from red in response) when it tries to resolve, it will be removed from the stack and no damage will be dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Retriever Phoenix somehow dies with its triggered ability on the stack, you may return it to the battlefield with that triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a card is brought into the game from outside the game, it will stay in the game until it ends or until its owner leaves the game, whichever comes first.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If instructed to learn, you may do nothing. Discarding a card and putting a Lesson card into your hand are both optional.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you bring a card into the game from outside the game in a Constructed tournament (or a Constructed game played under tournament conditions), you may select only a card from your sideboard. In casual Constructed games, the card comes from your collection.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you bring a card into the game from outside the game in a Sealed Deck or Booster Draft event, you may select only a card that is in the card pool that you built your deck from.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Retriever Phoenix must be in your graveyard at the moment you’re instructed to learn if you want to use the last ability to return it to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Spiteful Squad has -1/-1 counters on it when it dies, the last ability will include those as well. This may result in the recipient also dying. Spiteful indeed.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'In some unusual cases, you may end up putting the appropriate counters on more than one permanent. For example, if you control The Ozolith when Spiteful Squad dies, you will put the appropriate number of each kind of counter onto both The Ozolith and the target creature.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Spiteful Squad’s ability doesn’t cause you to move counters from itself to the target creature. Rather, you put the same number of each kind of counter Spiteful Squad had when it died onto that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Star Pupil has -1/-1 counters on it when it dies, the last ability will include those as well. This may result in the recipient also dying.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'In some unusual cases, you may end up putting the appropriate counters on more than one permanent. For example, if you control The Ozolith when Star Pupil dies, you will put the appropriate number of each kind of counter onto both The Ozolith and the target creature.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Star Pupil puts all of its counters onto the target creature, not just its +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Star Pupil’s ability doesn’t cause you to move counters from itself to the target creature. Rather, you put the same number of each kind of counter Star Pupil had when it died onto that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a card is brought into the game from outside the game, it will stay in the game until it ends or until its owner leaves the game, whichever comes first.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect returns a copy of a spell to its owner’s hand, the copy ceases to exist.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If instructed to learn, you may do nothing. Discarding a card and putting a Lesson card into your hand are both optional.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you bring a card into the game from outside the game in a Constructed tournament (or a Constructed game played under tournament conditions), you may select only a card from your sideboard. In casual Constructed games, the card comes from your collection.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you bring a card into the game from outside the game in a Sealed Deck or Booster Draft event, you may select only a card that is in the card pool that you built your deck from.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If a card is brought into the game from outside the game, it will stay in the game until it ends or until its owner leaves the game, whichever comes first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If instructed to learn, you may do nothing. Discarding a card and putting a Lesson card into your hand are both optional.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you bring a card into the game from outside the game in a Constructed tournament (or a Constructed game played under tournament conditions), you may select only a card from your sideboard. In casual Constructed games, the card comes from your collection.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you bring a card into the game from outside the game in a Sealed Deck or Booster Draft event, you may select only a card that is in the card pool that you built your deck from.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'The controller of the creature chooses which attacking creature that creature blocks.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "The creature blocks only if it\'s able to do so as the declare blockers step begins. If, at that time, the creature is tapped, it\'s affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t block, or no creatures are attacking its controller or a planeswalker controlled by that player, then it doesn\'t block. If there\'s a cost associated with having the creature block, the player isn\'t forced to pay that cost. If that cost isn\'t paid, the creature won\'t block."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'You choose whether you want the creature to gain reach until end of turn as Academic Dispute resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a card is brought into the game from outside the game, it will stay in the game until it ends or until its owner leaves the game, whichever comes first.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If instructed to learn, you may do nothing. Discarding a card and putting a Lesson card into your hand are both optional.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you bring a card into the game from outside the game in a Constructed tournament (or a Constructed game played under tournament conditions), you may select only a card from your sideboard. In casual Constructed games, the card comes from your collection.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you bring a card into the game from outside the game in a Sealed Deck or Booster Draft event, you may select only a card that is in the card pool that you built your deck from.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a creature entered the battlefield under your control this turn but is controlled by a different player when Shaile’s activated ability resolves, it will still get a +1/+1 counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a creature is more than one of the creature types Blex cares about, it may haunt your dreams, but it will get the +1/+1 bonus only once.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'While resolving Search for Blex, you may put any number of the cards into your hand, even if you don’t have enough life to cover it. We’ll assume you have a plan that’s better than “and then I’ll lose the game.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a creature spell is copied, it’s put onto the battlefield as a token as the spell resolves rather than putting the copy of the spell onto the battlefield. The rules that apply to a permanent spell becoming a permanent apply to a copy of a spell becoming a token.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The token that a resolving copy of a spell becomes isn’t said to have been “created.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a creature’s power is less than 0 when it’s doubled, instead that creature gets -X/-0, where X is how much less than 0 its power is. For example, if an effect has given Reckless Amplimancer -4/-0 so that it’s a -2/2 creature, doubling its power and toughness gives it -2/+2, and it becomes a -4/4 creature.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to “double” a creature’s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply. The same is true for toughness.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If a land card with an appropriate subtype is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as one of these lands, you may reveal the other land to have the "Snarl" enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put one of these lands onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'The "Snarl" itself doesn\\\'t have any land subtypes. You can\\\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land card."}]', "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn’t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a spell has additional costs, apply those increases before applying cost reductions.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Killian can reduce alternative costs. For example, if you choose to pay the {1}{B} alternative cost for Baleful Mastery while targeting a creature, that cost would be reduced to {B}.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Killian, Ink Duelist can’t reduce the colored mana requirement of a spell’s mana cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If all of Silverquill Command’s targets are illegal as it tries to resolve, it will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If at least one target is still legal as Silverquill Command tries to resolve, it will resolve and do as much as it can.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If all of Witherbloom Command’s targets are illegal as it tries to resolve, it will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If at least one target is still legal as Witherbloom Command tries to resolve, it will resolve and do as much as it can.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you target yourself with the first mode, you may return any land card to your hand, including one you just milled or one that was already there.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect increases or decreases the cost of spells you cast, that cost increase or decrease is applied to the alternative cost you chose to pay. In that case, the cost was still paid for the purposes of the effect, even if you paid more or less for it when it was cast.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the {2}{R}{R} cost was paid, the opponent chooses how many and which cards to discard as Fervent Mastery resolves. They may choose to discard no cards.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you choose to pay one alternative cost, you can’t pay any other alternative costs. For example, if an effect lets you cast a “Mastery” spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t also choose to pay its given alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you copy a “Mastery” spell and the alternative cost was paid, the copy will resolve as though the cost was paid.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, you choose which opponent takes the prescribed action as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell on the stack is determined by its mana cost, not any alternative costs you used to pay for it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect increases or decreases the cost of spells you cast, that cost increase or decrease is applied to the alternative cost you chose to pay. In that case, the cost was still paid for the purposes of the effect, even if you paid more or less for it when it was cast.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you choose to pay one alternative cost, you can’t pay any other alternative costs. For example, if an effect lets you cast a “Mastery” spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t also choose to pay its given alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you copy a “Mastery” spell and the alternative cost was paid, the copy will resolve as though the cost was paid.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, you choose which opponent takes the prescribed action as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell on the stack is determined by its mana cost, not any alternative costs you used to pay for it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an exiled card is both blue and red, Culmination of Studies deals 1 damage to each opponent and you draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If multiple red cards are exiled, all of the damage is dealt as a single event.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You will exile all X cards from the top of your library before taking any of the listed actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell you control with lifelink deals damage to you, you gain and lose that much life simultaneously. In this case, your life total doesn’t change. (You may gain life if the spell also deals damage to other permanents and/or players, however.)'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some instant and sorcery spells instruct other things to deal damage rather than deal damage themselves. In these cases, you won’t gain life for that damage (unless the other things also have lifelink). Notably, a spell that instructs a creature you control to fight won’t cause you to gain life.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You still pay the mana cost when casting the exiled card, and you must follow all timing rules for it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If multiple cards leave your graveyard as part of the same event, Stonebound Mentor’s ability will trigger only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If multiple cards leave your graveyard at the same time, this ability triggers only once, and will deal only 1 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If multiple creatures deal combat damage to you or an opponent at the same time, the appropriate ability of Strixhaven Stadium will trigger that many times. You can put these abilities on the stack in any order. The last ability put on the stack will be the first to resolve.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if creatures you control deal combat damage to multiple opponents at the same time, the last ability will trigger multiple times. However, because the counters are removed, it is difficult (but not impossible) to make multiple players lose the game from this ability in the same combat phase.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The check for ten or more point counters happens only as the last ability is resolving. Notably, if you add the tenth point counter some other way, no one will lose the game . . . yet.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': '“That player” refers to the opponent who was dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If only one target is still legal as Aether Helix tries to resolve, it will still resolve and perform the appropriate action on the remaining target.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You must choose two legal targets in order to cast Aether Helix. If there are either no permanent cards in your graveyard or no permanents on the battlefield, you cannot begin to cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If somehow all of Magma Opus’s targets are illegal as it tries to resolve, none of its effects happen. You will not create an Elemental token or draw two cards.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The same permanent can be chosen as a target for each of the two instances of “target.” That is, you can have Magma Opus both deal damage to a creature or planeswalker and then tap it. (We’re having a hard time imagining why you would, but you’re the brilliant student.)'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You also choose how the 4 damage will be divided among the first group of targets as you cast Magma Opus. You must have at least 1 damage dealt to each of those targets.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You choose all targets for Magma Opus as you cast the spell. This includes up to four targets for the first effect and two target permanents for the second effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You must choose two different target permanents for the second effect. You may choose permanents that are already tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the creature you control is an illegal target as Mage Duel tries to resolve, that creature won’t get +1/+2. If that creature is a legal target, but the one you don’t control isn’t, your creature will still get +1/+2. In both cases, no fight will happen and no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Mage Duel). Mage Duel’s mana value is always 3, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You can’t cast Mage Duel unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don’t control as targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the exiled card is a modal double-faced card and its back face is a land, its owner may play it as a land. (Note that if the front face is also a land, you couldn’t have exiled it to begin with.)'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Playing the exiled card follows all normal timing restrictions.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the opponent is an illegal target as Secret Rendezvous tries to resolve, neither player will draw cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the target becomes illegal before Charge Through resolves (perhaps because an opponent destroyed it), you won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the target creature’s controller has seven or more cards in hand when Flunk resolves, the creature gets -0/-0. This effect will never increase the creature’s power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The value of X is determined as Flunk resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the target creature’s controller has zero cards left in their library when Bury in Books resolves, that creature becomes the top card of their library.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the target of the original Show of Confidence has become an illegal target when that spell is copied, the copies will initially still target the same creature. If you don’t choose new targets for the copies, they each will fail to resolve. Notably, you don’t have to change targets, especially not to opposing creatures, just because the current target of Show of Confidence is illegal.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created as Show of Confidence’s triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The triggered ability counts all instants and sorceries that were cast before it resolves. If you cast instant spells in response to the ability, those spells will count.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the target player has one card in hand as Go Blank resolves, they’ll discard it and the cards in their graveyard will be exiled. If their hand is empty, you’ll just exile the cards in their graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the third mode is chosen and somehow both of its targets are illegal as Lorehold Command tries to resolve, the entire spell does nothing.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Spell instructions are followed in order. If you choose the first and second modes, the Spirit token Lorehold Command creates will have +1/+0, indestructible, and haste. If you choose the first and fourth modes, you can sacrifice the Spirit token it creates.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If there is an {X} in the spell’s mana cost, use the chosen value for X to determine its mana value. For example, if you cast a sorcery with mana cost {X}{U} and choose 4 for X, its mana value is 5.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Spectacle Mage’s second ability can’t reduce the colored mana requirements in spells you cast.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Spectacle Mage’s second ability only looks at the mana value of a spell, not the cost you’re paying for it. For example, if you control two Spectacle Mages and cast a sorcery with mana cost {4}{U}, the cost will be reduced to {2}{U}.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If two or more cards leave your graveyard as a single event, Quintorius’s last ability will trigger once. If they leave your graveyard as separate events, it will trigger once for each event.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you choose 1 for the value of X, Crackle with Power will cost {3}{R}{R} to cast and deal five damage to a single target. If you choose 2 for the value of X, it will cost {6}{R}{R} to cast and deal ten damage to each of up to two targets, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you choose a creature or search for a creature card with {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you choose not to cast a spell this way, all of the cards will be put on the bottom of the library in a random order.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you’re casting a spell with {X} in its cost without paying its mana cost, you must choose 0 for the value of X.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'When Velomachus Lorehold’s triggered ability resolves, it lets you cast a spell immediately, ignoring timing restrictions. It does not let you cast that spell later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you chose targets for Snow Day as you cast it, and none of those targets are legal as it tries to resolve, it will be removed from the stack and do nothing. You will not draw or discard.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may choose tapped creatures as targets. Those creatures won’t untap during their controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you copy Plumb the Forbidden multiple times, each magecraft ability of a creature you control will trigger that many times.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you sacrifice a creature with a magecraft ability to cast Plumb the Forbidden, that creature’s ability will not trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you find and reveal three cards, two of them will still be shuffled into your library. If you find and reveal one or two cards, no creatures will be put onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you own face-down cards in exile, they won’t count toward the value of X, even if you’re allowed to look at them and you know they are instant or sorcery cards.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Serpentine Curve itself is not yet in your graveyard when you determine the value of X.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, any opponent may activate Detention Vortex’s last ability, not just an opponent who controls the permanent that it is enchanting.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Maelstrom Muse’s cost reduction can reduce only generic mana in a spell’s total cost. It can’t reduce colored mana requirements.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Maelstrom Muse’s triggered ability). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Mage Hunter’s triggered ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Master Symmetrist’s triggered ability only looks at the power and toughness of a creature when it attacks. Once the ability has triggered, changing the creature’s power or toughness will not stop it from gaining trample or remove trample from it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Mila’s first ability triggers only once no matter how many creatures are attacking or how many planeswalkers are being attacked.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Mila’s second ability will resolve before the spell or ability that caused it to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'When Mila’s first ability resolves, you will put a loyalty counter on all planeswalkers you control, even ones that aren’t being attacked.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Pestilent Cauldron’s second ability counts the total amount of life gained without considering any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you lost 2 life and gained 2 life earlier in the turn, your opponents will mill two cards.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may cast Restorative Burst with no targets. If you do, each player will gain 4 life and you’ll exile Restorative Burst. However, if you choose one or two target cards, and each of those cards is an illegal target as Restorative Burst tries to resolve (usually because something else moved them in response), Restorative Burst won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No one will gain life, and Restorative Burst won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You must be able to target four cards in a single graveyard in order to activate Pestilent Cauldron’s last ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Players can respond to Bayou Groff only after it’s been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to stop you from casting this spell or to make it cost more mana.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature or pay an extra {3} to cast this spell; you can’t cast it without paying one of those costs, and you can’t pay either multiple times.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Putting a land card from your hand onto the battlefield is not the same as playing a land. You may do it even if you have already played a land on your turn, or if you’re casting Eureka Moment on your opponent’s turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Rootha, Mercurial Artist’s ability must have a target to be activated. You can’t activate it without a target in order to return Rootha to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Silverquill Silencer’s second triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Tempted by the Oriq’s control-changing effect lasts indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Unless it has haste, you will not able to attack with a creature or activate its abilities that have {T} in the cost on the turn you gain control of it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The card exiled by the second ability is exiled face up. Casting it follows the normal rules for casting that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if it’s a creature card, you can cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty. In most cases, if you exile a non-instant card during an opponent’s turn, you won’t be able to cast it that turn.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'While resolving Conspiracy Theorist’s ability, you can’t pay {1} and discard a card multiple times to draw more cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The land won’t be a creature as it enters the battlefield unless some other effect is making it one. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The last sentence of Emergent Sequence’s ability counts the land it put onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The number of lands you control is counted as Leyline Invocation resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Mascot Interception). Mascot Interception’s mana value is always 4, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Mortality Spear). Mortality Spear’s mana value is always 4, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'X is number of cards in your hand as Manifestation Sage’s triggered ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You can target a player with the third mode even if they control no creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may choose exactly zero modes or two modes. You can’t choose only one mode. If you choose two modes, you choose which two and the target players as you put the triggered ability on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You choose whether or not to pay 2 life as the ability resolves. Once you make that choice, no one can respond before Arrogant Poet gains flying.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You choose which creature to put the +1/+1 counter on as Humiliate is resolving, after their hand has been revealed.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may cast Humiliate even if you control no creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Zimone’s first ability isn’t the same as playing a land. As it resolves, you may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped even if you have no available land plays or it’s another player’s turn.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Zimone’s last ability counts the number of lands you control as it resolves, not as you activate it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abweisen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Kreaturen- oder Planeswalkerzauber deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {3}. Falls der Zauberspruch auf diese Weise neutralisiert wird, schicke ihn ins Exil, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Zum letzten Mal, Grux: Es reicht nicht, vor den Administratoren einfach ,Bewerbung!\\\' zu brüllen."\\n—Pavil, Zulassungsbeamter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513818&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a54eb053-04d8-41a8-a7eb-792344761015\', \'multiverseId\': 513818}, \'multiverseid\': 513818}, {\'name\': \'Descartar\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo de criatura o de planeswalker objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {3}. Si ese hechizo es contrarrestado de esta manera, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Grux, por última vez: ¡no basta con gritar \\\'matricúlame\\\' a los encargados!".\\n—Pávil, encargado de las admisiones\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9557709e-6a66-4163-8010-ca17d1dc439a\', \'multiverseId\': 514109}, \'multiverseid\': 514109}, {\'name\': \'Élimination\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort de créature ou de planeswalker ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {3}. Si ce sort est contrecarré de cette manière, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Grux, pour la dernière fois, il ne suffit pas de hurler "Inscription !" aux administrateurs. »\\n—Pavil, responsable des admissions\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514400&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e40bbc6f-f19d-4683-b7af-29866e6a30e7\', \'multiverseId\': 514400}, \'multiverseid\': 514400}, {\'name\': \'Bocciare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia creatura o planeswalker bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {3}. Se quella magia è neutralizzata in questo modo, esiliala invece di metterla nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Grux, per l\\\'ultima volta, non basta urlare \\\'Iscrivere!\\\' agli amministratori."\\n—Pavil, funzionario delle ammissioni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a17f7e0-f7f9-4848-a617-6ecf9b14d6d1\', \'multiverseId\': 514691}, \'multiverseid\': 514691}, {\'name\': \'却下\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーかプレインズウォーカーである呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。これによりその呪文が打ち消されたなら、それをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「グラックス君、もう一度だけ言うよ。受付でただ『受験する！』と叫ぶだけではだめなんだ。」\\n――事務局員、パヴィル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a23052b-d7bb-4b49-9b74-ccaf290831c6\', \'multiverseId\': 514982}, \'multiverseid\': 514982}, {\'name\': \'불합격\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 플레인즈워커 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문의 조종자가 {3}을 지불하지 않는 한 그 주문을 무효화한다. 그 주문이 이런 식으로 무효화되면, 그 주문을 소유자의 무덤에 넣는 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그럭스, 또 말하지만, 접수처에 그냥 \\\'지원할게요!\\\' 하고 소리치는 것보단 좀 더 많은 일을 해야 해."\\n—입학 사정관, 파빌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a78602e-f769-428b-a6f6-83fc4616b9dc\', \'multiverseId\': 515273}, \'multiverseid\': 515273}, {\'name\': \'Rejeitar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica de criatura ou de planeswalker alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague {3}. Se aquela mágica for anulada dessa maneira, exile-a em vez de colocá-la no cemitério de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Grux, pela última vez, você precisa fazer mais do que simplesmente gritar \\\'Inscrever!\\\' para os administradores."\\n— Pavil, agente de admissões\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92693771-ae84-46d9-adac-20f4224ea567\', \'multiverseId\': 515564}, \'multiverseid\': 515564}, {\'name\': \'Отклонить\', \'text\': "Отмените целевое заклинание существа или planeswalker\'а, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {3}. Если то заклинание отменяется таким образом, изгоните его вместо того, чтобы положить его на кладбище его владельца.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«В последний раз тебе объясняю, Грукс. Нельзя просто орать „Поступаю!" на администраторов».\\n— Павил, член приемной комиссии\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'542e9497-f624-4307-813f-1a2bdae5f5ac\', \'multiverseId\': 515855}, \'multiverseid\': 515855}, {\'name\': \'驳回\', \'text\': \'除非目标生物或鹏洛客咒语的操控者支付{3}，否则反击之。如果以此法反击该咒语，则改为将它放逐，而非置入其拥有者的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「葛兹，我最后一次告诉你：光对招生老师大叫『我要报名！』我们是绝对不会录取你的。」\\n～招生委员帕威\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'218db714-bc2e-4cdf-8c1a-6cebbe291bb3\', \'multiverseId\': 516146}, \'multiverseid\': 516146}, {\'name\': \'駁回\', \'text\': \'除非目標生物或鵬洛客咒語的操控者支付{3}，否則反擊之。如果以此法反擊該咒語，則改為將它放逐，而非置入其擁有者的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「葛茲，我最後一次告訴你：光對招生老師大叫『我要報名！』我們是絕對不會錄取你的。」\\n～招生委員帕威\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c78c82d-7817-4763-8bbe-f75625a2c62d\', \'multiverseId\': 516437}, \'multiverseid\': 516437}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aha-Erlebnis\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten. Du kannst eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Am Anfang waren die Gleichungen einfach nur Zahlen. Aber ich sah in diesen Zahlen eine Geschichte und in der Geschichte ein Muster, und plötzlich passte alles zusammen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbc2436b-73d8-4225-b98a-8644f80c586d\', \'multiverseId\': 513967}, \'multiverseid\': 513967}, {\'name\': \'Momento de eureka\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Al principio, las ecuaciones solo eran números. Pero en esos números vi una historia y en esa historia, un patrón. ¡De repente todo encajaba!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8485af-3ec9-45cc-83c7-0cf1a69b4c15\', \'multiverseId\': 514258}, \'multiverseid\': 514258}, {\'name\': \'Éclair de lucidité\', \'text\': \'Piochez deux cartes. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Au début, les équations n\'étaient que de simples nombres. Mais j\'y ai décelé une histoire, dans laquelle j\'ai vu un tracé, et d\'un seul coup tout s\'est intégré ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514549&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a0eb3c-db04-44ff-9cae-76fee928419e\', \'multiverseId\': 514549}, \'multiverseid\': 514549}, {\'name\': \'Intuizione Geniale\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"All\\\'inizio, le equazioni erano semplici numeri. Ma in quei numeri ho visto una storia, in quella storia uno schema e improvvisamente tutto tornava!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ff8c387-6521-4775-b61a-e406bb24c0cf\', \'multiverseId\': 514840}, \'multiverseid\': 514840}, {\'name\': \'ひらめきの瞬間\', \'text\': \'カード２枚を引く。あなたは、あなたの手札から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「最初は、この方程式はただの数字の羅列だったわ。でもその数字の中に物語が見えて、物語の中にパターンが見えたの。そうしたら突然、すべてがぴったりはまったのよ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78bcb70e-46bc-4302-906a-6e38d9a5cc1e\', \'multiverseId\': 515131}, \'multiverseid\': 515131}, {\'name\': \'유레카의 순간\', \'text\': \'카드 두 장을 뽑는다. 당신은 당신의 손에서 대지 카드 한 장을 전장에 놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"처음에는 방정식이 단순한 숫자였어. 하지만 그 숫자들 속에서 이야기를 봤고, 이야기 속에서는 패턴을 봤어, 그러다가 갑자기 모든 게 들어맞더라고!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78ac972b-6b95-4d61-96a9-456a5b001416\', \'multiverseId\': 515422}, \'multiverseid\': 515422}, {\'name\': \'Momento de Eureca\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards. Você pode colocar um card de terreno de sua mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"No começo, as equações eram apenas números. Mas naqueles números eu vi uma história, naquela história eu vi um padrão e, subitamente, tudo se encaixou!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3a6a62-c8ec-48a3-a2b4-678f1e288468\', \'multiverseId\': 515713}, \'multiverseid\': 515713}, {\'name\': \'Момент Озарения\', \'text\': \'Возьмите две карты. Вы можете положить карту земли из вашей руки на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Сначала уравнения были просто числами. Но в этих числах я увидела историю, а в истории я увидела закономерность — и вдруг все сложилось!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67c90c48-3672-404f-b007-05a20699c07f\', \'multiverseId\': 516004}, \'multiverseid\': 516004}, {\'name\': \'灵感时刻\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌。你可以将一张地牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「一开始，这些算式就只是数字。但我先从连串数字中读出故事，而又在故事之间发现规律，一切突然就对上了！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'867cfe9a-14f3-443b-acef-3b69c2f53df3\', \'multiverseId\': 516295}, \'multiverseid\': 516295}, {\'name\': \'靈感時刻\', \'text\': \'抽兩張牌。你可以將一張地牌從你手上放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「一開始，這些算式就只是數字。但我先從連串數字中讀出故事，而又在故事之間發現規律，一切突然就對上了！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd795db6-6dc4-4898-8ad1-0ec8e642516c\', \'multiverseId\': 516586}, \'multiverseid\': 516586}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akademische Bewährungsprobe\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Bestimme einen Nichtland-Kartennamen. Gegner können bis zu deinem nächsten Zug keine Zaubersprüche mit dem bestimmten Namen wirken.\\n• Bestimme eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist. Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug kann sie nicht angreifen oder blocken, und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei — Lektion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513775&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6011bdbe-c53a-426f-88cd-f3fc97adbd71\', \'multiverseId\': 513775}, \'multiverseid\': 513775}, {\'name\': \'Suspensión académica\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Elige un nombre de carta que no sea tierra. Los oponentes no pueden lanzar hechizos con el nombre elegido hasta tu próximo turno.\\n• Elige el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Hasta tu próximo turno, no puede atacar ni bloquear y sus habilidades activadas no pueden activarse.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro — Lección\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d90517d3-8b60-4795-bbcf-c93392769932\', \'multiverseId\': 514066}, \'multiverseid\': 514066}, {\'name\': "Période d\'essai universitaire", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Choisissez un nom de carte non-terrain. Les adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts du nom choisi jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.\\n• Choisissez un permanent non-terrain ciblé. Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, il ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.", \'type\': \'Rituel : leçon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514357&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ae2fd8f-547d-41ed-94cb-20ce410db710\', \'multiverseId\': 514357}, \'multiverseid\': 514357}, {\'name\': \'Punizione Accademica\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Scegli il nome di una carta non terra. Gli avversari non possono lanciare magie con il nome scelto fino al tuo prossimo turno.\\n• Scegli un permanente non terra bersaglio. Fino al tuo prossimo turno, non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria — Lezione\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eb709c9-792a-4df2-afe5-f2d6064e3cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 514648}, \'multiverseid\': 514648}, {\'name\': \'謹慎補講\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 土地でないカード名１つを選ぶ。次のあなたのターンまで、対戦相手はその選ばれた名前を持つ呪文を唱えられない。\\n• 土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。次のあなたのターンまで、それでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー — 講義\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5986c951-5166-45ea-99f4-e5a4bef3510c\', \'multiverseId\': 514939}, \'multiverseid\': 514939}, {\'name\': \'학문적 보호 관찰\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 대지가 아닌 카드 이름 하나를 선택한다. 상대들은 당신의 다음 턴까지 선택된 이름을 가진 주문을 발동할 수 없다.\\n• 대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 선택한다. 당신의 다음 턴까지, 그 지속물은 공격하거나 방어할 수 없고, 그 지속물의 활성화능력은 활성화될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법 — 수업\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed3d491b-cd6f-4580-b9e5-45c9940187ed\', \'multiverseId\': 515230}, \'multiverseid\': 515230}, {\'name\': \'Suspensão Acadêmica\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Escolha um nome de card não de terreno. Os oponentes não podem conjurar mágicas com o nome escolhido até seu próximo turno.\\n• Escolha a permanente alvo não de terreno. Até seu próximo turno, ela não pode atacar nem bloquear e as habilidades ativadas dela não podem ser ativadas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço — Lição\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2363e8f0-0a2b-4410-806d-1f6c725c84e6\', \'multiverseId\': 515521}, \'multiverseid\': 515521}, {\'name\': \'Условное Отчисление\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Выберите имя не являющейся землей карты. До вашего следующего хода оппоненты не могут разыгрывать заклинания с выбранным именем.\\n• Выберите целевой не являющийся землей перманент. До вашего следующего хода он не может атаковать или блокировать, а его активируемые способности не могут быть активированы.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство — Урок\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bd55b30-748f-4876-8902-bbb7ad2369f7\', \'multiverseId\': 515812}, \'multiverseid\': 515812}, {\'name\': \'留校察看\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•选择一个非地牌的名称。直到你的下一个回合，所有对手都不能施放具该名称的咒语。\\n•选择目标非地永久物。直到你的下一个回合，它不能进行攻击或阻挡，其起动式异能也不能起动。\', \'type\': \'法术 ～课程\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'339c7f4b-e06c-4782-a16b-53aec05ab1a5\', \'multiverseId\': 516103}, \'multiverseid\': 516103}, {\'name\': \'留校察看\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•選擇一個非地牌的名稱。直到你的下一個回合，所有對手都不能施放具該名稱的咒語。\\n•選擇目標非地永久物。直到你的下一個回合，它不能進行攻擊或阻擋，其起動式異能也不能起動。\', \'type\': \'巫術 ～課程\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b0784b4-24fc-4879-8f0f-7b666cbd0bbd\', \'multiverseId\': 516394}, \'multiverseid\': 516394}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akademische Bewährungsprobe\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Bestimme einen Nichtland-Kartennamen. Gegner können bis zu deinem nächsten Zug keine Zaubersprüche mit dem bestimmten Namen wirken.\\n• Bestimme eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist. Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug kann sie nicht angreifen oder blocken, und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei — Lektion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'060728d6-0c32-45b2-8bd5-207be46f5d14\', \'multiverseId\': 516969}, \'multiverseid\': 516969}, {\'name\': \'Suspensión académica\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Elige un nombre de carta que no sea tierra. Los oponentes no pueden lanzar hechizos con el nombre elegido hasta tu próximo turno.\\n• Elige el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Hasta tu próximo turno, no puede atacar ni bloquear y sus habilidades activadas no pueden activarse.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro — Lección\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0321709e-28ab-468c-b725-50638e622a38\', \'multiverseId\': 517064}, \'multiverseid\': 517064}, {\'name\': "Période d\'essai universitaire", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Choisissez un nom de carte non-terrain. Les adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts du nom choisi jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.\\n• Choisissez un permanent non-terrain ciblé. Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, il ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.", \'type\': \'Rituel : leçon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517159&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8263cac-e4f5-4772-a4d4-5e8c2f935209\', \'multiverseId\': 517159}, \'multiverseid\': 517159}, {\'name\': \'Punizione Accademica\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Scegli il nome di una carta non terra. Gli avversari non possono lanciare magie con il nome scelto fino al tuo prossimo turno.\\n• Scegli un permanente non terra bersaglio. Fino al tuo prossimo turno, non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria — Lezione\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5423cbf-199c-4b98-9ef2-406d1a215d1c\', \'multiverseId\': 517254}, \'multiverseid\': 517254}, {\'name\': \'謹慎補講\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 土地でないカード名１つを選ぶ。次のあなたのターンまで、対戦相手はその選ばれた名前を持つ呪文を唱えられない。\\n• 土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。次のあなたのターンまで、それでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー — 講義\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1baefe9b-f9ae-471c-b6a1-ae020c349d6c\', \'multiverseId\': 517349}, \'multiverseid\': 517349}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akademischer Disput\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl blockt in diesem Zug, falls möglich. Du kannst sie bis zum Ende des Zuges Reichweite erhalten lassen.\\nLerne eine Lektion. (Du kannst entweder eine Lektion-Karte von außerhalb der Partie, die du besitzt, offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen oder eine Karte abwerfen, um eine Karte zu ziehen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde dir zeigen, was eigenständige Forschung ist, du Pfuscher!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513859&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f116caca-81d6-46cf-b69c-f95c221b647b\', \'multiverseId\': 513859}, \'multiverseid\': 513859}, {\'name\': \'Conflicto académico\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo bloquea este turno si puede. Puedes hacer que gane la habilidad de alcance hasta el final del turno.\\nAprende. (Puedes mostrar una carta de Lección de la cual eres propietario de fuera del juego y ponerla en tu mano o descartar una carta para robar una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Te voy a enseñar lo que es una investigación original, novato!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62b17656-df76-47e9-a043-1a2561c5edb2\', \'multiverseId\': 514150}, \'multiverseid\': 514150}, {\'name\': \'Débat universitaire\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée bloque ce tour-ci si possible. Vous pouvez faire qu\'elle acquière la portée jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nApprenez. (Vous pouvez révéler une carte de leçon que vous possédez en dehors de la partie et la mettre dans votre main, ou vous défausser d\'une carte pour piocher une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Espèce de charlatan, je vais te les faire bouffer mes recherches originales ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27efd1af-c4a4-4f75-9691-b3726d3fbdce\', \'multiverseId\': 514441}, \'multiverseid\': 514441}, {\'name\': \'Disputa Accademica\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio blocca in questo turno, se può farlo. Puoi farle avere raggiungere fino alla fine del turno.\\nApprendi. (Puoi rivelare una carta Lezione che possiedi al di fuori della partita e aggiungerla alla tua mano o scartare una carta per pescare una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ti faccio vedere io cos\\\'è una ricerca originale, dilettante!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d77cea8-079b-49e5-9042-06c1bbc7213c\', \'multiverseId\': 514732}, \'multiverseid\': 514732}, {\'name\': \'学術論争\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それは可能ならブロックする。あなたは「ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは到達を得る。」を選んでもよい。\\n履修を行う。（あなたは、ゲームの外部からあなたがオーナーである講義・カード１枚を公開しあなたの手札に加えるか、カード１枚を捨てカード１枚を引くか、どちらかを行ってもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「オリジナルの研究を見せてやるよ、この凡人！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb15498b-4b56-4048-9e3e-01ccc3a76267\', \'multiverseId\': 515023}, \'multiverseid\': 515023}, {\'name\': \'학문적 논쟁\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 가능하면 이 턴에 방어한다. 당신은 그 생물이 턴종료까지 대공을 가지게 할 수 있다.\\n학습한다. (당신은 게임 밖에서 당신이 소유한 수업 카드 한 장을 공개하고 그 카드를 당신의 손에 넣거나, 카드 한 장을 버린 후 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"원래 연구 내용을 보여 주마, 이 저질 글쟁이 같으니!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4acebb4-1303-4242-adea-35906491e71d\', \'multiverseId\': 515314}, \'multiverseid\': 515314}, {\'name\': \'Disputa Acadêmica\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo bloqueia neste turno se estiver apta. Você pode fazer com que ela ganhe alcance até o final do turno.\\nAprender. (Você pode revelar um card de Lição seu de fora do jogo e colocá-lo em sua mão, ou descartar um card para comprar um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Vou lhe mostrar uma pesquisa original, seu farsante!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1960750-bcb6-4efa-b55a-2ea6fd8824d0\', \'multiverseId\': 515605}, \'multiverseid\': 515605}, {\'name\': \'Ученый Диспут\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо блокирует в этом ходу, если может. Вы можете заставить его получить Захват до конца хода.\\nВыучите урок. (Вы можете показать принадлежащую вам карту Урока вне игры и положить ее в вашу руку, или вы можете сбросить карту, чтобы взять карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я тебе покажу „оригинальное исследование", халтурщик!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'017c5e6b-d2e3-4bb0-9729-92b375ce36e8\', \'multiverseId\': 515896}, \'multiverseid\': 515896}, {\'name\': \'学术争执\', \'text\': \'目标生物本回合若能进行阻挡，则必须阻挡。你可以使其获得延势异能直到回合结束。\\n温习。（你可以从游戏外展示一张由你拥有的课程牌并置于你手上，或弃一张牌来抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「让我给你瞧瞧真正的原创研究，你个代写枪手！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c12744a-b76f-4915-9764-c0b42fbf7843\', \'multiverseId\': 516187}, \'multiverseid\': 516187}, {\'name\': \'學術爭執\', \'text\': \'目標生物本回合若能進行阻擋，則必須阻擋。你可以使其獲得延勢異能直到回合結束。\\n溫習。（你可以從遊戲外展示一張由你擁有的課程牌並置於你手上，或棄一張牌來抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「讓我給你瞧瞧真正的原創研究，你個代寫槍手！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744330b4-7671-462e-839c-f9b4aa31457a\', \'multiverseId\': 516478}, \'multiverseid\': 516478}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anregende Vortragskunst\', \'text\': \'Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Worte strömten auf Wellen aus güldenem Licht hervor und spülten alle Furcht aus den Herzen und Köpfen seines Publikums.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'503c4a66-17e7-4b5e-8037-00b235273dcd\', \'multiverseId\': 513968}, \'multiverseid\': 513968}, {\'name\': \'Elocución estimulante\', \'text\': \'Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas. Las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'De sus palabras manaron unas ondas de luz dorada que eliminaron todo miedo de la mente y el corazón de su audiencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ccc80f3-c78b-42ea-97a5-3deedbf9352a\', \'multiverseId\': 514259}, \'multiverseid\': 514259}, {\'name\': \'Élocution exaltante\', \'text\': "Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Ses paroles se déversèrent sur des ondes de lumière dorée, effaçant toute peur dans le cœur et l\'esprit du public.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514550&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf8d7cee-7ecd-4411-aea1-a017ec4dbd8e\', \'multiverseId\': 514550}, \'multiverseid\': 514550}, {\'name\': \'Elocuzione Esaltante\', \'text\': \'Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Le altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Le sue parole sgorgavano come ondate di luce dorata, scacciando ogni timore dal cuore e dalla mente di chi lo ascoltava.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'981e1b09-7ee7-44a3-a4c8-bdde7bc6cec1\', \'multiverseId\': 514841}, \'multiverseid\': 514841}, {\'name\': \'元気づける雄弁術\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。ターン終了時まで、それ以外であなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'その言葉は金色の光の波となって広がり、聴衆の感情となって、思考が持つ一切の恐れを洗い流した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d5c978-173e-4904-8831-45c00d02f609\', \'multiverseId\': 515132}, \'multiverseid\': 515132}, {\'name\': \'신나는 웅변\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'그의 말은 황금색 빛의 물결로 쏟아져 나와 청중들의 마음과 정신으로부터 모든 공포를 샅샅이 씻어 주었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef0bc9a8-1373-4796-afa3-57e7259364d2\', \'multiverseId\': 515423}, \'multiverseid\': 515423}, {\'name\': \'Elocução Estimulante\', \'text\': \'Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla. As outras criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Suas palavras se derramaram em ondas de luz dourada, limpando todos os medos dos corações e das mentes do público.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'841fc7bd-afd1-4947-829d-452d68498c39\', \'multiverseId\': 515714}, \'multiverseid\': 515714}, {\'name\': \'Бодрящее Красноречие\', \'text\': \'Положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем. Другие существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Его слова изливались потоками золотого света, прогоняя прочь страх из сердец и умов слушателей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94eb914b-b00a-4dfe-9f4c-84ceec3c69aa\', \'multiverseId\': 516005}, \'multiverseid\': 516005}, {\'name\': \'振奋演说\', \'text\': \'在目标由你操控的生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'他的言辞化作道道金光照耀众人，将听众心灵之间所有恐惧打消一空。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4640dec0-2e01-49f2-a533-657c1795ea38\', \'multiverseId\': 516296}, \'multiverseid\': 516296}, {\'name\': \'振奮演說\', \'text\': \'在目標由你操控的生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'他的言辭化作道道金光照耀眾人，將聽眾心靈之間所有恐懼打消一空。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22768274-d48a-4e1c-a81a-a7ccc79cf712\', \'multiverseId\': 516587}, \'multiverseid\': 516587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anrufung der Ley-Linien\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Ländern ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Glaubst du immer noch, meine Arbeit besteht aus nichts als trockenen, langweiligen Gleichungen?"\\n—Cairu, Quandrix-Magiestudentin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55b1133c-6098-47f4-8d86-8eec3e23c177\', \'multiverseId\': 513904}, \'multiverseid\': 513904}, {\'name\': \'Invocación de líneas místicas\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, donde X es la cantidad de tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Sigues pensando que mi trabajo solo consiste en ecuaciones aburridas?".\\n—Cairu, estudiante de magia de Quándrix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c60d158-cfff-45f1-a4b9-96af779b6a22\', \'multiverseId\': 514195}, \'multiverseid\': 514195}, {\'name\': \'Invocation de ligne ley\', \'text\': \'Créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant le nombre de terrains que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous pensez toujours que mon travail se limite à des équations ennuyeuses ? »\\n—Caïru, mage-étudiante de Quandrix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514486&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37a152b6-20bf-4adf-9fae-3b1b650d4717\', \'multiverseId\': 514486}, \'multiverseid\': 514486}, {\'name\': \'Invocazione della Leyline\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa, dove X è il numero di terre che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Credi ancora che il mio lavoro non sia altro che aride, noiose equazioni?"\\n—Cairu, studentessa-maga di Quandrix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'119eb764-cb43-42c2-9913-21c292f875ec\', \'multiverseId\': 514777}, \'multiverseid\': 514777}, {\'name\': \'力線の発動\', \'text\': \'緑青の０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしている土地の数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「今でも私の作品が無味乾燥な方程式だと思ってる？」\\n――クアンドリクスの魔道生徒、カイル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2743f19b-dca1-4c83-8119-b07b11de42f4\', \'multiverseId\': 515068}, \'multiverseid\': 515068}, {\'name\': \'수맥 기원술\', \'text\': \'0/0 녹색 및 청색 프랙탈 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 X개를 올려놓는다. X는 당신이 조종하는 대지의 수이다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"아직도 내 작품이 건성건성하고 지루한 방정식에 불과하다고 믿어?"\\n—콴드릭스 마도사 학생, 카이루\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ec884f7-e96f-47e7-bbcb-a75192e921e1\', \'multiverseId\': 515359}, \'multiverseid\': 515359}, {\'name\': \'Invocação da Linha de Força\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura Fractal verde e azul 0/0. Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela, sendo X o número de terrenos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Você ainda acha que meu trabalho não passa de equações áridas e tediosas?"\\n— Cairu, aluno-mago de Quandrix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41afc422-54d9-4ac0-bd99-264a3574c6a2\', \'multiverseId\': 515650}, \'multiverseid\': 515650}, {\'name\': \'Призыв Невидимых Лучей\', \'text\': \'Создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 зеленый и синий Фрактал. Положите на нее X жетонов +1/+1, где X — количество земель под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты все еще думаешь, что моя работа — это только сухие и скучные уравнения?»\\n— Кайру, студентка магии с Квандрикса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08d9fad3-df7f-4fee-ab14-d3d62b7b6a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 515941}, \'multiverseid\': 515941}, {\'name\': \'地脉祝愿\', \'text\': \'派出一个0/0，绿蓝双色的分灵衍生生物。在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为由你操控的地数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你还觉得我的成果就只是枯燥无聊的算式吗？」\\n～量析修习法师凯依璐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'854ed985-5bd9-4443-b62a-f2de3afd6854\', \'multiverseId\': 516232}, \'multiverseid\': 516232}, {\'name\': \'地脈祝願\', \'text\': \'派出一個0/0，綠藍雙色的分靈衍生生物。在其上放置X個+1/+1指示物，X為由你操控的地數量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「你還覺得我的成果就只是枯燥無聊的算式嗎？」\\n～量析修習法師凱依璐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3cbbff0-e6b3-48ee-a51c-91d91157c337\', \'multiverseId\': 516523}, \'multiverseid\': 516523}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ansturm der Magierjäger\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl.\\nImmer wenn in diesem Zug eine Kreatur blockt, verliert ihr Beherrscher 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Extus stand einen Augenblick lang vor seiner Alma Mater und erinnerte sich erst an sein Studium, dann an seine Rache. Auf seinen Befehl hin stürmten die Magierjäger los.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513845&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2bc1a0c-451c-4d7b-b1f6-5f02aa05c246\', \'multiverseId\': 513845}, \'multiverseid\': 513845}, {\'name\': \'Ataque de los cazamagos\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\nSiempre que una criatura bloquee este turno, su controlador pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Extus se detuvo delante de su alma mater un momento; primero recordó sus estudios, después su venganza. En cuanto dio la orden, los cazamagos atacaron.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de8886a0-29e7-43b5-a6da-329e89589d36\', \'multiverseId\': 514136}, \'multiverseid\': 514136}, {\'name\': \'Carnage des chasseurs de mages\', \'text\': "Détruisez une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature bloque ce tour-ci, son contrôleur perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Extus se tint un instant immobile devant son alma mater, se souvenant d\'abord de ses études, puis de sa vengeance. À son ordre, les chasseurs de mages chargèrent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbcf1d91-7f7d-479c-a741-14e6aed9a10d\', \'multiverseId\': 514427}, \'multiverseid\': 514427}, {\'name\': \'Assalto dei Cacciamaghi\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura blocca in questo turno, il suo controllore perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Extus si soffermò di fronte a quella che era stata la sua scuola, ricordando prima i suoi studi, poi la sua vendetta. A un suo cenno, i cacciamaghi attaccarono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76066f5c-2d51-4e5f-b96d-e507a6941731\', \'multiverseId\': 514718}, \'multiverseid\': 514718}, {\'name\': \'魔道士狩りの猛攻\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\nこのターン、クリーチャー１体がブロックするたび、それのコントローラーは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'エクスタスはしばらく母校の前で思い出していた。学びのこと、そして復讐のことを。彼が命じると、魔道士狩りが解き放たれた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef8a5c6a-1818-4ae1-8993-4841f5711d40\', \'multiverseId\': 515009}, \'multiverseid\': 515009}, {\'name\': \'마도사 사냥꾼들의 공습\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\\n이 턴에 생물이 방어할 때마다, 그 생물의 조종자는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'엑스투스는 잠시 모교 앞에 서서, 처음에는 그의 연구들을, 그 다음에는 복수를 기억해냈다. 그가 명령을 내리자, 마도사 사냥꾼들이 풀려났다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9aae506-6528-45a4-adf0-ce036e723898\', \'multiverseId\': 515300}, \'multiverseid\': 515300}, {\'name\': \'Investida dos Caça-magos\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura ou o planeswalker alvo.\\nToda vez que uma criatura bloqueia neste turno, seu controlador perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Extus parou diante de sua alma mater por um instante, lembrando-se primeiro de seus estudos e depois de sua vingança. Ao seu comando, os caça-magos atacaram.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'912e2843-e4ea-4ee0-9763-3f94c315a605\', \'multiverseId\': 515591}, \'multiverseid\': 515591}, {\'name\': \'Нападение Охотников на Магов\', \'text\': "Уничтожьте целевое существо или planeswalker\'а.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо блокирует в этом ходу, контролирующий его игрок теряет 1 жизнь.", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Несколько мгновений Экстус стоял перед своей альма-матер, вспоминая сначала о своей учебе, а потом о мести. По его команде охотники на магов двинулись вперед.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b20ff4b7-29ee-49b9-be21-4b9b865e7da5\', \'multiverseId\': 515882}, \'multiverseid\': 515882}, {\'name\': \'猎法妖猛攻\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物或鹏洛客。\\n本回合中，每当一个生物进行阻挡时，其操控者失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'埃陀斯驻足母校门前，心中澎湃的先是校园回忆，然后很快变成复仇恨意。随着他一声令下，猎法妖蜂拥而出。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73ddaba-4d6f-4565-b8d4-529d699417e6\', \'multiverseId\': 516173}, \'multiverseid\': 516173}, {\'name\': \'獵法妖猛攻\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物或鵬洛客。\\n本回合中，每當一個生物進行阻擋時，其操控者失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'埃陀斯駐足母校門前，心中澎湃的先是校園回憶，然後很快變成復仇恨意。隨著他一聲令下，獵法妖蜂擁而出。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38b2fd18-c67a-421a-af2a-e5cf7d8aadd0\', \'multiverseId\': 516464}, \'multiverseid\': 516464}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkane Subtraktion\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -4/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nLerne eine Lektion. (Du kannst eine Lektion-Karte von außerhalb der Partie, die du besitzt, offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen, oder eine Karte abwerfen und dann eine Karte ziehen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'An diesem Tag lernten sie weniger.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513804&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6224b3cd-ed0d-4624-8654-7e35e35ad53a\', \'multiverseId\': 513804}, \'multiverseid\': 513804}, {\'name\': \'Sustracción arcana\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -4/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\nAprende. (Puedes mostrar una carta de Lección de la cual eres propietario de fuera del juego y ponerla en tu mano o descartar una carta para robar una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La lección del día fue pequeña.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd791b57-9185-4930-9cbf-a74249517c56\', \'multiverseId\': 514095}, \'multiverseid\': 514095}, {\'name\': \'Soustraction ésotérique\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -4/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nApprenez. (Vous pouvez révéler une carte de leçon que vous possédez en dehors de la partie et la mettre dans votre main, ou vous défausser d\'une carte pour piocher une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La classe n\'a pas appris grand-chose ce jour-là.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514386&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a04c0349-8879-40b5-861b-36506876484a\', \'multiverseId\': 514386}, \'multiverseid\': 514386}, {\'name\': \'Sottrazione Arcana\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -4/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nApprendi. (Puoi rivelare una carta Lezione che possiedi al di fuori della partita e aggiungerla alla tua mano o scartare una carta per pescare una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La classe imparò poco quel giorno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'971277bf-a5a1-4c8f-a0d3-145ba05373c1\', \'multiverseId\': 514677}, \'multiverseid\': 514677}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の引き去り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－４/－０の修整を受ける。\\n履修を行う。（あなたは、ゲームの外部からあなたがオーナーである講義・カード１枚を公開しあなたの手札に加えるか、カード１枚を捨てカード１枚を引くか、どちらかを行ってもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'その日学んだのは小さなことだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30cab247-0004-4252-80ab-a92769824076\', \'multiverseId\': 514968}, \'multiverseid\': 514968}, {\'name\': \'비전 감산\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -4/-0을 받는다.\\n학습한다. (당신은 게임 밖에서 당신이 소유한 수업 카드 한 장을 공개하고 그 카드를 당신의 손에 넣거나, 카드 한 장을 버린 후 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'그날 수업은 거의 배운 게 없었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b42f388f-9dbb-411f-982e-b99076816b37\', \'multiverseId\': 515259}, \'multiverseid\': 515259}, {\'name\': \'Subtração Arcana\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -4/-0 até o final do turno.\\nAprender. (Você pode revelar um card de Lição seu de fora do jogo e colocá-lo em sua mão, ou descartar um card para comprar um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O aprendizado foi bem pequeno naquele dia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f374d7c0-4546-461e-84d5-86b34f050105\', \'multiverseId\': 515550}, \'multiverseid\': 515550}, {\'name\': \'Волшебное Вычитание\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -4/-0 до конца хода.\\nВыучите урок. (Вы можете показать принадлежащую вам карту Урока вне игры и положить ее в вашу руку, или вы можете сбросить карту, чтобы взять карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'В тот день класс научился немногому.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e095f6f-fe31-4a16-97e7-b83297c569f8\', \'multiverseId\': 515841}, \'multiverseid\': 515841}, {\'name\': \'秘法消减\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-4/-0直到回合结束。\\n温习。（你可以从游戏外展示一张由你拥有的课程牌并置于你手上，或弃一张牌来抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'那天全班学到了很小的东西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19519967-e85f-4fff-b6b3-6ae2903bbe7f\', \'multiverseId\': 516132}, \'multiverseid\': 516132}, {\'name\': \'秘法消減\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-4/-0直到回合結束。\\n溫習。（你可以從遊戲外展示一張由你擁有的課程牌並置於你手上，或棄一張牌來抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'那天全班學到了很小的東西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'846677a4-1d9c-41bd-be61-a485a7ea9e2d\', \'multiverseId\': 516423}, \'multiverseid\': 516423}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arrestblase\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine bleibende Karte, die kein Land ist\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.\\n{3}: Zerstöre die Arrestblase. Nur deine Gegner können diese Fähigkeit aktivieren, und nur wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513781&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96561fef-d59c-4750-b632-ad12ad2b728f\', \'multiverseId\': 513781}, \'multiverseid\': 513781}, {\'name\': \'Vórtice de detención\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente que no sea tierra.\\nEl permanente encantado no puede atacar ni bloquear y no pueden activarse sus habilidades activadas.\\n{3}: Destruye el Vórtice de detención. Solo tus oponentes pueden activar esta habilidad y solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8a3c57c-6784-4926-a7a7-b0f1f9120d66\', \'multiverseId\': 514072}, \'multiverseid\': 514072}, {\'name\': \'Vortex de retenue\', \'text\': "Enchanter : permanent non-terrain\\nLe permanent enchanté ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.\\n{3} : Détruisez le Vortex de retenue. Seuls vos adversaires peuvent activer cette capacité et uniquement lorsqu\'ils pourraient lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514363&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad8106dc-fa9b-4bc2-8ccc-04e835b5cf52\', \'multiverseId\': 514363}, \'multiverseid\': 514363}, {\'name\': \'Vortice di Detenzione\', \'text\': \'Incanta permanente non terra\\nIl permanente incantato non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.\\n{3}: Distruggi il Vortice di Detenzione. Solo i tuoi avversari possono attivare questa abilità e solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dea15bc-8dac-4254-b382-5ec05e2f4e6b\', \'multiverseId\': 514654}, \'multiverseid\': 514654}, {\'name\': \'居残りの渦\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地でないパーマネント）\\nエンチャントしているパーマネントでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。\\n{3}：居残りの渦を破壊する。この能力は、対戦相手のみが、ソーサリーとしてのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f51cc97-2a9b-4343-94bd-9ddd2169008b\', \'multiverseId\': 514945}, \'multiverseid\': 514945}, {\'name\': \'억류의 소용돌이\', \'text\': \'대지가 아닌 지속물에 부여\\n부여된 지속물은 공격하거나 방어할 수 없으며, 그 지속물의 활성화능력은 활성화될 수 없다.\\n{3}: 억류의 소용돌이를 파괴한다. 당신의 상대들만이 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있고 집중마법 시기에만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99aabf82-7efd-44b8-96ca-06b8138721e1\', \'multiverseId\': 515236}, \'multiverseid\': 515236}, {\'name\': \'Vórtice de Detenção\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente não de terreno\\nA permanente encantada não pode atacar nem bloquear e suas habilidades ativadas não podem ser ativadas.\\n{3}: Destrua Vórtice de Detenção. Apenas seus oponentes podem ativar esta habilidade e somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa248815-9c93-49ea-a4d6-fb9160a54121\', \'multiverseId\': 515527}, \'multiverseid\': 515527}, {\'name\': \'Вихрь Задержания\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать не являющийся землей перманент\\nЗачарованный перманент не может атаковать или блокировать, и его активируемые способности не могут быть активированы.\\n{3}: уничтожьте Вихрь Задержания. Эту способность могут активировать только ваши оппоненты и только как волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe54c738-0d8d-410a-8e4e-6d97cb343ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 515818}, \'multiverseid\': 515818}, {\'name\': \'拘禁漩涡\', \'text\': \'结附于非地永久物\\n所结附的永久物不能进行攻击或阻挡，其起动式异能也不能起动。\\n{3}：消灭拘禁漩涡。只有对手可以起动此异能，且仅限法术时机。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb07d018-a7e3-4c5f-aa2f-ddd29e2737ed\', \'multiverseId\': 516109}, \'multiverseid\': 516109}, {\'name\': \'拘禁漩渦\', \'text\': \'結附於非地永久物\\n所結附的永久物不能進行攻擊或阻擋，其起動式異能也不能起動。\\n{3}：消滅拘禁漩渦。只有對手可以起動此異能，且僅限巫術時機。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'517ae239-0cf9-43bb-987a-8c03505e9745\', \'multiverseId\': 516400}, \'multiverseid\': 516400}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arroganter Poet\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Arrogante Poet angreift, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erhält er Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich wäre ja freundlicher zu Ebenbürtigen, Professor, aber ich habe einfach keine."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513831&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bfa222c-5a88-4270-8f9b-b1bb194283b5\', \'multiverseId\': 513831}, \'multiverseid\': 513831}, {\'name\': \'Poeta creído\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Poeta creído ataque, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si lo haces, gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Podría ser más amable con mis iguales, profesor, pero es que no tengo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0df59b55-4718-45ac-bd48-772d26a9d706\', \'multiverseId\': 514122}, \'multiverseid\': 514122}, {\'name\': \'Poète arrogant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Poète arrogant attaque, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous faites ainsi, il acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': "« J\'aimerais bien me montrer plus gentil envers mes pairs, professeur, mais je n\'en ai aucun. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514413&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e84b49a9-c520-4277-9fa3-d4441916c940\', \'multiverseId\': 514413}, \'multiverseid\': 514413}, {\'name\': \'Poeta Arrogante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Poeta Arrogante attacca, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se lo fai, ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sarei più gentile con i miei pari, professore, se solo ne avessi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d891cfe-f0df-4995-9f15-9db53288734b\', \'multiverseId\': 514704}, \'multiverseid\': 514704}, {\'name\': \'尊大な詩人\', \'text\': \'尊大な詩人が攻撃するたび、あなたは「２点のライフを支払う。ターン終了時まで、これは飛行を得る。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「私に釣り合う相手には優しくしますよ、教授。でもそんな奴は一人もいませんから。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6f08af7-0611-418d-9eec-8691d6a9b531\', \'multiverseId\': 514995}, \'multiverseid\': 514995}, {\'name\': \'거만한 시인\', \'text\': \'거만한 시인이 공격할 때마다, 당신은 생명 2점을 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 거만한 시인은 턴종료까지 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 흑마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"전 동급생들을 더 친절하게 대할 수 있지만, 그저 제 주변에 아무도 없을 뿐입니다, 교수님."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4df6b0c-7e86-40ff-b00f-d3d16beeb23b\', \'multiverseId\': 515286}, \'multiverseid\': 515286}, {\'name\': \'Poeta Arrogante\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Poeta Arrogante ataca, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se fizer isso, ele ganhará voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Bruxo\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu poderia ser mais gentil com meus semelhantes, professor, mas simplesmente não há nenhum."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'705238a9-1f20-46d4-9d21-df94378af934\', \'multiverseId\': 515577}, \'multiverseid\': 515577}, {\'name\': \'Высокомерный Поэт\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Высокомерный Поэт атакует, вы можете заплатить 2 жизни. Если вы это делаете, он получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Колдун\', \'flavor\': \'«Я был бы добрее к тем, кто равен мне своим талантом, профессор, но таких просто-напросто нет».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdeb3ef7-e1e8-4e02-a7fe-8c59f5c8f013\', \'multiverseId\': 515868}, \'multiverseid\': 515868}, {\'name\': \'傲慢诗人\', \'text\': \'每当傲慢诗人攻击时，你可以支付2点生命。若你如此作，则它获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'「教授，我也想对功力相若的人客气些，但就是遇不上。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bebd384-c0b1-4e43-8fdd-5d42cb9c86ea\', \'multiverseId\': 516159}, \'multiverseid\': 516159}, {\'name\': \'傲慢詩人\', \'text\': \'每當傲慢詩人攻擊時，你可以支付2點生命。若你如此作，則它獲得飛行異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「教授，我也想對功力相若的人客氣些，但就是遇不上。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4053a1-500f-4da6-afe9-5b382250891a\', \'multiverseId\': 516450}, \'multiverseid\': 516450}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufnahmeschreiben\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere das Aufnahmeschreiben: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Der Brief entfaltete sich und lud die Zwillinge nach Strixhaven ein. Will sah eine Chance auf arkane Studien. Rowan sah eine Chance auf Macht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514039&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f8b0d38-26bf-4367-9501-6a7c06720683\', \'multiverseId\': 514039}, \'multiverseid\': 514039}, {\'name\': \'Carta de admisión\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Carta de admisión: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Al abrirse la carta, los gemelos encontraron una invitación proveniente de Strixhaven. Will lo vio como una oportunidad para tantear el estudio arcano; Rowan, como una oportunidad para tantear el poder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb7b6e58-1e3f-4ce9-8ebe-b18ab5956208\', \'multiverseId\': 514330}, \'multiverseid\': 514330}, {\'name\': "Lettre d\'admission", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Lettre d\'admission : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "La lettre s\'ouvrit, invitant les jumeaux à Strixhaven. Will y vit une occasion d\'étudier la magie. Rowan y vit une occasion d\'engranger du pouvoir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514621&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01360d50-ba12-428b-8592-9df8aa5dd431\', \'multiverseId\': 514621}, \'multiverseid\': 514621}, {\'name\': \'Lettera di Accettazione\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica la Lettera di Accettazione: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La lettera si aprì, invitando i gemelli a Strixhaven. Will pensò allo studio delle arti arcane. Rowan pensò al potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95de4cbb-194f-4af5-81db-2619455f10ee\', \'multiverseId\': 514912}, \'multiverseid\': 514912}, {\'name\': \'合格通知\', \'text\': \'{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 合格通知を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'手紙が開き、双子をストリクスヘイヴンへと招いた。ウィルは秘儀を研究する機会を期待し、ローアンは力を得る機会を期待した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'294d4051-2655-47ca-8bd5-a90981d6b9c0\', \'multiverseId\': 515203}, \'multiverseid\': 515203}, {\'name\': \'합격 통지서\', \'text\': \'{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다.\\n{2}, {T}, 합격 통지서를 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'편지가 펼쳐지며, 쌍둥이를 스트릭스헤이븐으로 초청했다. 윌은 비전 연구를 할 수 있는 기회를 보았다. 로완은 힘을 얻을 수 있는 기회를 보았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9176a75-1c85-4af2-8bbc-8258ac0562d7\', \'multiverseId\': 515494}, \'multiverseid\': 515494}, {\'name\': \'Carta de Aceitação\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Carta de Aceitação: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a carta se desdobrou, os gêmeos se depararam com um convite para Strixhaven. Will viu uma chance de estudar o arcano. Rowam viu uma chance de obter poder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91762d0c-bbb9-49a9-af36-99fb58b253f3\', \'multiverseId\': 515785}, \'multiverseid\': 515785}, {\'name\': \'Письмо о Поступлении\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Письмо о Поступлении: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Письмо развернулось, приглашая близнецов в Стриксхейвен. Уилл увидел возможность лучше изучить магию. Рован увидела возможность обрести могущество.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c7c33e0-93bb-4f41-a448-2cf68fb430eb\', \'multiverseId\': 516076}, \'multiverseid\': 516076}, {\'name\': \'入学通知书\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲入学通知书：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'信封自动打开，邀请冰火双子就读斯翠海文。威尔将其视为研习秘法的良机。萝婉将其视作增强力量的际遇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efa58d81-fa57-4a11-b20f-735e36f6f313\', \'multiverseId\': 516367}, \'multiverseid\': 516367}, {\'name\': \'入學通知書\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\\n{2}，{T}，犧牲入學通知書：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'信封自動打開，邀請冰火雙子就讀斯翠海文。威爾將其視為研習秘法的良機。而蘿婉則將其視作增強力量的際遇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8c0784e-b4e9-4aec-a7fb-acec769f215e\', \'multiverseId\': 516658}, \'multiverseid\': 516658}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufregende Entdeckung\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu. Dann kannst du zwei Karten abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das muss die verlorene Stadt Zantafar sein, in der mein Volk lebte, bevor sie Nomaden wurden. Denk nur, wie viel Geschichte wir hier lernen können!"\\n—Quintorius, Kundhort-Magiestudent\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514026&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aea0ac4-2e38-4075-95ab-7f43f4c9e1a3\', \'multiverseId\': 514026}, \'multiverseid\': 514026}, {\'name\': \'Descubrimiento emocionante\', \'text\': \'Ganas 2 vidas. Luego, puedes descartar dos cartas. Si lo haces, roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta debe de ser la ciudad perdida de Zantafar, donde vivía mi pueblo antes de convertirse en nómada. ¡Cuánta historia debe albergar este lugar!".\\n—Quintorius, estudiante de magia de Sapiéntium\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4db4f5c3-9a3c-421f-a830-073af20cd6f8\', \'multiverseId\': 514317}, \'multiverseid\': 514317}, {\'name\': \'Découverte fascinante\', \'text\': \'Vous gagnez 2 points de vie. Vous pouvez ensuite vous défausser de deux cartes. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ce doit être la cité perdue de Zantafar, où vivait mon peuple avant qu\'il ne devienne nomade. Imagine l\'histoire qu\'on va pouvoir apprendre ici ! »\\n—Quintorius, mage-étudiant de Forsapience", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514608&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76d6e448-916b-4493-9f79-574b058383e7\', \'multiverseId\': 514608}, \'multiverseid\': 514608}, {\'name\': \'Scoperta Emozionante\', \'text\': \'Guadagni 2 punti vita. Poi puoi scartare due carte. Se lo fai, pesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa deve essere la città perduta di Zantafar, dove la mia gente viveva prima di diventare nomade. Pensate ai segreti che questo posto può celare!"\\n—Quintorius, studente-mago di Archeorocca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'918b3532-6e95-4848-909d-296b257e446d\', \'multiverseId\': 514899}, \'multiverseid\': 514899}, {\'name\': \'身震いする発見\', \'text\': \'あなたは２点のライフを得る。その後、あなたは「カード２枚を捨て、カード３枚を引く。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「これこそがザンタファーの失われた都市に違いない。私の祖先が放浪を始める以前に住んでいた場所だ。ここでどんな歴史を学べるのだろうか！」\\n――ロアホールドの魔道生徒、クイントリウス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da783afe-87fd-456b-93d5-811cac7c1926\', \'multiverseId\': 515190}, \'multiverseid\': 515190}, {\'name\': \'스릴 넘치는 발견\', \'text\': \'당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다. 그 후 당신은 카드 두 장을 버릴 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 세 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이곳은 우리 민족이 유목민이 되기 전에 살았던, 잃어버린 도시 잔타파르가 틀림없어. 이 곳에서 배우게 될 역사를 생각해 봐!"\\n—로어홀드 마도사 학생, 퀸토리우스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb2f894b-f724-4998-8e56-b33a512bf267\', \'multiverseId\': 515481}, \'multiverseid\': 515481}, {\'name\': \'Descoberta Emocionante\', \'text\': \'Você ganha 2 pontos de vida. Em seguida, você pode descartar dois cards. Se fizer isso, compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta deve ser a cidade perdida de Zantafar, onde meu povo viveu antes de se tornarem nômades. Pense em quanto aprenderemos sobre história aqui!"\\n— Quintorius, aluno-mago de Sapioforte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d58991a4-58b0-4fa0-8154-81df83dadff7\', \'multiverseId\': 515772}, \'multiverseid\': 515772}, {\'name\': \'Захватывающее Открытие\', \'text\': \'Вы получаете 2 жизни. Затем вы можете сбросить две карты. Если вы это делаете, возьмите три карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Должно быть, это тот самый затерянный город Зантафар, где мой народ жил до того, как стать кочевниками. Только подумай, сколько мы узнаем здесь об истории!»\\n— Квинториус, студент магии с Лорхолда\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2d06eb1-6653-460a-823a-e10092ec5d08\', \'multiverseId\': 516063}, \'multiverseid\': 516063}, {\'name\': \'快意发现\', \'text\': \'你获得2点生命。然后你可以弃两张牌。如果你如此作，则抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这里就是失落之城赞塔法。在成为游牧民之前，我的族人便是住在这边。想想我们能在这里学到多少历史！」\\n～衡鉴修习法师昆托力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00b9b3f1-ed5e-46a3-8f65-c4142f6bd8d3\', \'multiverseId\': 516354}, \'multiverseid\': 516354}, {\'name\': \'快意發現\', \'text\': \'你獲得2點生命。然後你可以棄兩張牌。如果你如此作，則抽三張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「這裡就是失落之城贊塔法。在成為遊牧民之前，我的族人便是住在這邊。想想我們能在這裡學到多少歷史！」\\n～衡鑑修習法師昆托力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6625647c-6060-4b7a-9cac-37270253360d\', \'multiverseId\': 516645}, \'multiverseid\': 516645}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg des Extus\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Schicke bis zu eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil.\\nLerne eine Lektion. (Du kannst entweder eine Lektion-Karte von außerhalb der Partie, die du besitzt, offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen oder eine Karte abwerfen, um eine Karte zu ziehen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Mit einem tödlichen Schlag übernahm Extus die Kontrolle über die Oriq und machte seinen ersten Schritt in Richtung Rache.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514009&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f089902c-ad5a-4e7d-91fd-d06e7955b31a\', \'multiverseId\': 514009}, \'multiverseid\': 514009}, {\'name\': \'Auge de Extus\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Exilia hasta una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de un cementerio.\\nAprende. (Puedes mostrar una carta de Lección de la cual eres propietario de fuera del juego y ponerla en tu mano o descartar una carta para robar una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Con un golpe letal, Extus se hizo con el control de los Oriq y dio su primer paso hacia la venganza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6ba925-c20b-4780-8f11-cc93d801497f\', \'multiverseId\': 514300}, \'multiverseid\': 514300}, {\'name\': "Ascension d\'Extus", \'text\': "Exilez une créature ciblée. Exilez jusqu\'à une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée d\'un cimetière.\\nApprenez. (Vous pouvez révéler une carte de leçon que vous possédez en dehors de la partie et la mettre dans votre main, ou vous défausser d\'une carte pour piocher une carte.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Dans un assaut mortel, Extus prit le contrôle de l\'Oriq et fit son premier pas vers la vengeance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514591&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fef8a6c-2c25-4785-9f47-ae63a11443d0\', \'multiverseId\': 514591}, \'multiverseid\': 514591}, {\'name\': \'Ascesa di Extus\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Esilia fino a una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio da un cimitero.\\nApprendi. (Puoi rivelare una carta Lezione che possiedi al di fuori della partita e aggiungerla alla tua mano o scartare una carta per pescare una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Con una mossa letale, Extus prese il controllo degli Oriq e mosse il primo passo verso la sua vendetta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cae970c-ab9b-4987-a22b-b26e7140d649\', \'multiverseId\': 514882}, \'multiverseid\': 514882}, {\'name\': \'エクスタスの隆盛\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体と、墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード最大１枚を対象とする。その前者を追放する。その後者を追放する。\\n履修を行う。（あなたは、ゲームの外部からあなたがオーナーである講義・カード１枚を公開しあなたの手札に加えるか、カード１枚を捨てカード１枚を引くか、どちらかを行ってもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'決定的な一撃でエクスタスはオリークを手に入れ、復讐への第一歩を踏み出した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d07644f6-188a-45a0-9aa6-bd8e168077b7\', \'multiverseId\': 515173}, \'multiverseid\': 515173}, {\'name\': \'엑스투스의 부활\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다. 무덤에 있는 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드를 최대 한 장까지 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다.\\n학습한다. (당신은 게임 밖에서 당신이 소유한 수업 카드 한 장을 공개하고 그 카드를 당신의 손에 넣거나, 카드 한 장을 버린 후 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'치명적인 일격 한 번으로, 엑스투스는 오리크를 장악하고 그의 복수를 향한 첫발을 내디뎠다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5dba87f-c996-4d7f-8ec9-0b08c7190fe3\', \'multiverseId\': 515464}, \'multiverseid\': 515464}, {\'name\': \'Ascensão de Extus\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. Exile até um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo de um cemitério.\\nAprender. (Você pode revelar um card de Lição seu de fora do jogo e colocá-lo em sua mão, ou descartar um card para comprar um card.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Com um golpe letal, Extus tomou o controle dos Oriq e deu seu primeiro passo rumo à vingança.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c4f3236-0cc4-4f10-b637-14934fe5a78d\', \'multiverseId\': 515755}, \'multiverseid\': 515755}, {\'name\': \'Восхождение Экстуса\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое существо. Изгоните не более одной целевой карты мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из кладбища.\\nВыучите урок. (Вы можете показать принадлежащую вам карту Урока вне игры и положить ее в вашу руку, или вы можете сбросить карту, чтобы взять карту.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Одним смертельным ударом Экстус взял под контроль Орик и сделал свой первый шаг к отмщению.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93cbf578-d766-41a8-bcdf-c1e1f9137db6\', \'multiverseId\': 516046}, \'multiverseid\': 516046}, {\'name\': \'埃陀斯崛起\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物。将至多一张目标瞬间或法术牌从坟墓场放逐。\\n温习。（你可以从游戏外展示一张由你拥有的课程牌并置于你手上，或弃一张牌来抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'只消致命一击，埃陀斯就将欧理可众的掌控权收入囊中，展开复仇的第一步。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e238e64-0769-4210-8244-077caefd872d\', \'multiverseId\': 516337}, \'multiverseid\': 516337}, {\'name\': \'埃陀斯崛起\', \'text\': \'放逐目標生物。將至多一張目標瞬間或巫術牌從墳墓場放逐。\\n溫習。（你可以從遊戲外展示一張由你擁有的課程牌並置於你手上，或棄一張牌來抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'只消致命一擊，埃陀斯就將歐理可眾的掌控權收入囊中，展開復仇的第一步。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c70a8b5-b8ea-4418-a52f-9d6827af23c2\', \'multiverseId\': 516628}, \'multiverseid\': 516628}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augenkreischer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Augenkreischer stirbt, lerne eine Lektion. (Du kannst eine Lektion-Karte von außerhalb der Partie, die du besitzt, offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen, oder eine Karte abwerfen und dann eine Karte ziehen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Auge, Fledermaus\', \'flavor\': \'Okulomagier sehen darin die ideale Zutat für Tränke. Die Fledermäuse sehen das anders.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513838&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3287928-085e-4c71-98a8-46cdd7e77323\', \'multiverseId\': 513838}, \'multiverseid\': 513838}, {\'name\': \'Murciélojo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Murciélojo muera, aprende. (Puedes mostrar una carta de Lección de la cual eres propietario de fuera del juego y ponerla en tu mano o descartar una carta para robar una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Murciélago ojo\', \'flavor\': \'Los oculomantes los ven como el ingrediente ideal para las pociones. Los murciélagos no lo ven de la misma manera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8844a8ef-d939-4889-88e2-a46f2a7a9f1a\', \'multiverseId\': 514129}, \'multiverseid\': 514129}, {\'name\': \'Spasmœil\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Spasmœil meurt, apprenez. (Vous pouvez révéler une carte de leçon que vous possédez en dehors de la partie et la mettre dans votre main, ou vous défausser d\'une carte pour piocher une carte.)", \'type\': \'Créature : œil et chauve-souris\', \'flavor\': "Les oculomanciens voient l\'ingrédient de potion idéal. Les chauves-souris ne sont pas du même avis.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514420&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c8843b5-d435-4b5e-8f8a-4d3e7929fe9d\', \'multiverseId\': 514420}, \'multiverseid\': 514420}, {\'name\': \'Pipistrocchio\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Pipistrocchio muore, apprendi. (Puoi rivelare una carta Lezione che possiedi al di fuori della partita e aggiungerla alla tua mano o scartare una carta per pescare una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pipistrello Occhio\', \'flavor\': \'Gli oculusmanti li vedono come ingredienti perfetti per le loro pozioni. I pipistrelli non la vedono allo stesso modo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e37d5fbd-28a7-4e3e-93d7-bf05f62d9151\', \'multiverseId\': 514711}, \'multiverseid\': 514711}, {\'name\': \'ひきつり目\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nひきつり目が死亡したとき、履修を行う。（あなたは、ゲームの外部からあなたがオーナーである講義・カード１枚を公開しあなたの手札に加えるか、カード１枚を捨てカード１枚を引くか、どちらかを行ってもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 眼・コウモリ\', \'flavor\': \'眼術師にとっては薬品の理想的な材料。コウモリにとってはそうではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42cc8f7f-07dc-4d29-bf99-7ad083049280\', \'multiverseId\': 515002}, \'multiverseid\': 515002}, {\'name\': \'씰룩눈\', \'text\': \'비행\\n씰룩눈이 죽을 때, 학습한다. (당신은 게임 밖에서 당신이 소유한 수업 카드 한 장을 공개하고 그 카드를 당신의 손에 넣거나, 카드 한 장을 버린 후 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 눈알 박쥐\', \'flavor\': \'시각술사는 이상적인 물약 재료라고 본다. 박쥐들은 그렇게 생각하지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac18a7eb-cd08-4ebc-87c7-ccce9f6ff866\', \'multiverseId\': 515293}, \'multiverseid\': 515293}, {\'name\': \'Virolho\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Virolho morrer, aprenda. (Você pode revelar um card de Lição seu de fora do jogo e colocá-lo em sua mão, ou descartar um card para comprar um card.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Olho Morcego\', \'flavor\': \'Os oculomantes enxergam o ingrediente perfeito para uma poção. Os morcegos não veem da mesma forma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74a95762-7bc1-4339-9dbc-d5cd8ee672e4\', \'multiverseId\': 515584}, \'multiverseid\': 515584}, {\'name\': \'Глазопырь\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Глазопырь умирает, выучите урок. (Вы можете показать принадлежащую вам карту Урока вне игры и положить ее в вашу руку, или вы можете сбросить карту, чтобы взять карту.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Глаз Летучая_мышь\', \'flavor\': \'Окуломанты видят в них хороший ингредиент для зелий. Нетопыри не видят в этом ничего хорошего.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e185d1ba-76f0-428a-8d8f-8e22d4ceb1f3\', \'multiverseId\': 515875}, \'multiverseid\': 515875}, {\'name\': \'巨眼蝠\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当巨眼蝠死去时，温习。（你可以从游戏外展示一张由你拥有的课程牌并置于你手上，或弃一张牌来抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～眼／蝙蝠\', \'flavor\': \'在视像术士眼中，这是理想的药剂配方。但在巨眼蝠眼中，它们可不这么想。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c96ce780-ff56-42db-b80f-18d5a8f17d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 516166}, \'multiverseid\': 516166}, {\'name\': \'巨眼蝠\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當巨眼蝠死去時，溫習。（你可以從遊戲外展示一張由你擁有的課程牌並置於你手上，或棄一張牌來抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～眼／蝙蝠\', \'flavor\': \'在視像術士眼中，這是理想的藥劑配方。但在巨眼蝠眼中，牠們可不這麼想。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c79f91ec-db4b-4e31-94b4-9d56bcdc1bec\', \'multiverseId\': 516457}, \'multiverseid\': 516457}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausdrucksvolle Iteration\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand, lege eine davon unter deine Bibliothek und schicke eine davon ins Exil. Du kannst die ins Exil geschickte Karte in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Prismari-Studenten tanzen im Spannungsfeld zwischen Leidenschaft und Perfektion.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab08617d-c12f-4728-8bea-4161da910c7c\', \'multiverseId\': 513969}, \'multiverseid\': 513969}, {\'name\': \'Iteración expresiva\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano, una de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y exilia una de ellas. Puedes jugar la carta exiliada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los estudiantes de Prismari bailan con la tensión entre la pasión y la perfección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'054797ab-107c-469f-80af-3ad4d55862fc\', \'multiverseId\': 514260}, \'multiverseid\': 514260}, {\'name\': \'Itération expressive\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main, mettez l\'une d\'elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, et exilez l\'une d\'elles. Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les étudiants de Prismari dansent entre passion et perfection.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514551&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ef43a89-bed6-41f9-b36b-67be585372b3\', \'multiverseId\': 514551}, \'multiverseid\': 514551}, {\'name\': \'Iterazione Espressiva\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano, mettine una in fondo al tuo grimorio ed esiliane una. Puoi giocare la carta esiliata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli studenti di Prismari danzano sul confine tra passione e perfezione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f1f0456-24e3-49da-9e5f-9aeb0a88619c\', \'multiverseId\': 514842}, \'multiverseid\': 514842}, {\'name\': \'表現の反復\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカード３枚を見る。それらのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、それらのうち１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、それらのうち１枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはその追放されたカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'プリズマリの学生たちは情熱と完璧の葛藤の中で踊る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d8cf5fd-dbd1-4645-bac6-6fb5a38879a0\', \'multiverseId\': 515133}, \'multiverseid\': 515133}, {\'name\': \'표현력 있는 재연\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 한 장은 당신의 손에, 한 장은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓고, 한 장은 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 추방된 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'프리즈마리 학생들은 열정과 완벽함 사이의 긴장감 속에서 춤을 춘다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99773f98-5498-4a88-97bb-aa6b0b1d17a8\', \'multiverseId\': 515424}, \'multiverseid\': 515424}, {\'name\': \'Iteração Expressiva\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles em sua mão, coloque um deles no fundo de seu grimório e exile um deles. Você pode jogar o card exilado neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os alunos de Prismari dançam na tensão entre paixão e perfeição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4647ee0b-50a0-4062-ac2d-8090c7b26266\', \'multiverseId\': 515715}, \'multiverseid\': 515715}, {\'name\': \'Выразительная Итерация\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, положите одну из них в низ вашей библиотеки и изгоните одну из них. Вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Студенты Призмари танцуют в напряжении между страстью и совершенством.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1911491-60dc-471f-9337-77aa58a0f755\', \'multiverseId\': 516006}, \'multiverseid\': 516006}, {\'name\': \'展现迭代\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，一张置于你的牌库底，一张放逐。本回合中，你可以使用所放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在激情与精进的张力之间，粹丽学生尽情起舞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42b7e4e5-4df2-43fe-ade8-adfc2b6cd409\', \'multiverseId\': 516297}, \'multiverseid\': 516297}, {\'name\': \'展現迭代\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，一張置於你的牌庫底，一張放逐。本回合中，你可以使用所放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'在激情與精進的張力之間，粹麗學生盡情起舞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa572ce-b2a5-4974-ba1c-03442c8b4a41\', \'multiverseId\': 516588}, \'multiverseid\': 516588}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausdrucksvolle Iteration\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand, lege eine davon unter deine Bibliothek und schicke eine davon ins Exil. Du kannst die ins Exil geschickte Karte in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Prismari-Studenten tanzen im Spannungsfeld zwischen Leidenschaft und Perfektion.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517502&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2144ae-1567-4d0b-90e6-4108671af68a\', \'multiverseId\': 517502}, \'multiverseid\': 517502}, {\'name\': \'Iteración expresiva\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano, una de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y exilia una de ellas. Puedes jugar la carta exiliada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los estudiantes de Prismari bailan con la tensión entre la pasión y la perfección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b643b3e-ca33-47e8-8609-e2beda3d8d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 517507}, \'multiverseid\': 517507}, {\'name\': \'Itération expressive\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main, mettez l\'une d\'elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, et exilez l\'une d\'elles. Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les étudiants de Prismari dansent entre passion et perfection.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517512&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a248f57-bd81-4be2-881e-4a2b0390b279\', \'multiverseId\': 517512}, \'multiverseid\': 517512}, {\'name\': \'Iterazione Espressiva\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano, mettine una in fondo al tuo grimorio ed esiliane una. Puoi giocare la carta esiliata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli studenti di Prismari danzano sul confine tra passione e perfezione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21127577-9984-4ef3-99bc-8e7f151a34ea\', \'multiverseId\': 517517}, \'multiverseid\': 517517}, {\'name\': \'表現の反復\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカード３枚を見る。それらのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、それらのうち１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、１枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはその追放されたカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'プリズマリの学生たちは情熱と完璧の葛藤の中で踊る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b09e2e4b-c15e-4733-9eb6-52d022ae8fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 517522}, \'multiverseid\': 517522}, {\'name\': \'표현력 있는 재연\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 한 장은 당신의 손에, 한 장은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓고, 한 장은 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 추방된 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'프리즈마리 학생들은 열정과 완벽함 사이의 긴장감 속에서 춤을 춘다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1555a10a-c158-4681-943a-13393d90ea40\', \'multiverseId\': 517527}, \'multiverseid\': 517527}, {\'name\': \'Iteração Expressiva\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles em sua mão, coloque um deles no fundo de seu grimório e exile um deles. Você pode jogar o card exilado neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os alunos de Prismari dançam na tensão entre paixão e perfeição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7159cd6-9963-4bde-a31f-664e4172863b\', \'multiverseId\': 517532}, \'multiverseid\': 517532}, {\'name\': \'Выразительная Итерация\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, положите одну из них в низ вашей библиотеки и изгоните одну из них. Вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Студенты Призмари танцуют в напряжении между страстью и совершенством.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbfca5f7-716f-46dc-97ac-f78a031777ea\', \'multiverseId\': 517537}, \'multiverseid\': 517537}, {\'name\': \'展现迭代\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，一张置于你的牌库底，一张放逐。本回合中，你可以使用所放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在激情与精进的张力之间，粹丽学生尽情起舞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83b79d54-5ee9-4fce-8bf5-97f951761e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 517542}, \'multiverseid\': 517542}, {\'name\': \'展現迭代\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，一張置於你的牌庫底，一張放逐。本回合中，你可以使用所放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'在激情與精進的張力之間，粹麗學生盡情起舞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5ef6228-8301-4923-9fc6-8a8dfe63acf7\', \'multiverseId\': 517547}, \'multiverseid\': 517547}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auseinanderreißen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Auseinanderreißen fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Aus der Geschichte gerissen. Aus der Erinnerung gerissen. Aus der Wirklichkeit gerissen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b34be12e-41da-4703-80cd-cd98792a87aa\', \'multiverseId\': 514008}, \'multiverseid\': 514008}, {\'name\': \'Liquidar\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Liquidar hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\n• Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Erradicado de la historia. De la memoria. De la realidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d0ee05-d2b9-4517-a409-d59abb1aeb20\', \'multiverseId\': 514299}, \'multiverseid\': 514299}, {\'name\': \'Dilacérer\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Dilacérer inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé ou un enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Arraché à l\'histoire. Arraché à la mémoire. Arraché à la réalité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514590&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3101d6d9-c8d6-4d14-a7a4-644967e63494\', \'multiverseId\': 514590}, \'multiverseid\': 514590}, {\'name\': \'Squarciare\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Squarciare infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Strappato dalla storia. Strappato dalla memoria. Strappato dalla realtà.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'793f9995-5418-45f6-bdd5-bec76c4db841\', \'multiverseId\': 514881}, \'multiverseid\': 514881}, {\'name\': \'引き裂き\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。引き裂きはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n• アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'歴史から裂かれた。記憶から裂かれた。現実から裂かれた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d32fd31-e3ed-4046-b33b-87374f5cf8c7\', \'multiverseId\': 515172}, \'multiverseid\': 515172}, {\'name\': \'찢어발기기\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 찢어발기기는 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\\n• 마법물체 또는 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'역사에서 찢겨졌다. 기억에서 찢겨졌다. 현실에서 찢겨졌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d7e299a-094c-44d4-ae20-2b37da7a1255\', \'multiverseId\': 515463}, \'multiverseid\': 515463}, {\'name\': \'Fender\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Fender causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo.\\n• Destrua o artefato ou o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Rasgado da história. Rasgado da memória. Rasgado da realidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'735f13a0-e2a3-4e1d-883c-d4bd86b240a1\', \'multiverseId\': 515754}, \'multiverseid\': 515754}, {\'name\': \'Растерзать на Части\', \'text\': "Выберите одно —\\n• Растерзать на Части наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker\'у.\\n• Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары.", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Вырван из истории. Вырван из памяти. Вырван из реальности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a29c0cbe-0817-4f84-b83d-b7a2babe7e94\', \'multiverseId\': 516045}, \'multiverseid\': 516045}, {\'name\': \'拆离\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•拆离对目标生物或鹏洛客造成3点伤害。\\n•消灭目标神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'摘离历史。摘离记忆。摘离现实。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69e484a6-6508-4d43-8aa5-54159f3d8d9b\', \'multiverseId\': 516336}, \'multiverseid\': 516336}, {\'name\': \'拆離\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•拆離對目標生物或鵬洛客造成3點傷害。\\n•消滅目標神器或結界。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'摘離歷史。摘離記憶。摘離現實。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'204fe545-3b7e-47f4-8710-330753e77d92\', \'multiverseId\': 516627}, \'multiverseid\': 516627}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auseinanderreißen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Auseinanderreißen fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Aus der Geschichte gerissen. Aus der Erinnerung gerissen. Aus der Wirklichkeit gerissen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517504&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a518b127-e4f3-4521-98fd-260903bb787e\', \'multiverseId\': 517504}, \'multiverseid\': 517504}, {\'name\': \'Liquidar\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Liquidar hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\n• Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Erradicado de la historia. De la memoria. De la realidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b94132ed-1513-44e9-9281-a92f13e37f2a\', \'multiverseId\': 517509}, \'multiverseid\': 517509}, {\'name\': \'Dilacérer\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Dilacérer inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé ou un enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Arraché à l\'histoire. Arraché à la mémoire. Arraché à la réalité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517514&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32abef71-7dee-45e1-80fc-90f82d939646\', \'multiverseId\': 517514}, \'multiverseid\': 517514}, {\'name\': \'Squarciare\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Squarciare infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Strappato dalla storia. Strappato dalla memoria. Strappato dalla realtà.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cde8b6cc-c1ed-47f8-b057-51b9b195eb7d\', \'multiverseId\': 517519}, \'multiverseid\': 517519}, {\'name\': \'引き裂き\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。引き裂きはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n• アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'歴史から裂かれた。記憶から裂かれた。現実から裂かれた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ffe3ddb-4158-43fa-9552-d67f597cac72\', \'multiverseId\': 517524}, \'multiverseid\': 517524}, {\'name\': \'찢어발기기\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 찢어발기기는 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\\n• 마법물체 또는 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'역사에서 찢겨졌다. 기억에서 찢겨졌다. 현실에서 찢겨졌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a12add1b-c67f-4ac9-9799-d05794c7e012\', \'multiverseId\': 517529}, \'multiverseid\': 517529}, {\'name\': \'Fender\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Fender causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo.\\n• Destrua o artefato ou o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Rasgado da história. Rasgado da memória. Rasgado da realidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bb616bc-0034-46a1-b4b8-b4659af2faa5\', \'multiverseId\': 517534}, \'multiverseid\': 517534}, {\'name\': \'Растерзать на Части\', \'text\': "Выберите одно —\\n• Растерзать на Части наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker\'у.\\n• Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары.", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Вырван из истории. Вырван из памяти. Вырван из реальности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744ea707-760b-4b18-8b1d-43d4f441f2d1\', \'multiverseId\': 517539}, \'multiverseid\': 517539}, {\'name\': \'拆离\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•拆离对目标生物或鹏洛客造成3点伤害。\\n•消灭目标神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'摘离历史。摘离记忆。摘离现实。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7fa1e7e-7220-402e-bd11-fa4c35af2da5\', \'multiverseId\': 517544}, \'multiverseid\': 517544}, {\'name\': \'拆離\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•拆離對目標生物或鵬洛客造成3點傷害。\\n•消滅目標神器或結界。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'摘離歷史。摘離記憶。摘離現實。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5c73bcf-0cf5-4d52-b855-38dc612e4b75\', \'multiverseId\': 517549}, \'multiverseid\': 517549}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgegrabene Mauer\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\n{1}, {T}: Du millst eine Karte. (Lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'„Lass dich von der Ruhe nicht täuschen. Diese alten Steine versuchen, mit dir zu sprechen."\\n—Augusta, Dekanin der Kundhort-Fakultät\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514038&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261f68cc-7d53-4130-a612-7380499d99aa\', \'multiverseId\': 514038}, \'multiverseid\': 514038}, {\'name\': \'Muro excavado\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\n{1}, {T}: Muele una carta. (Pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"No se dejen engañar por el silencio. Estas piedras antiguas están tratando de hablar con ustedes".\\n—Augusta, decana de Sapiéntium\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd1c1a54-2736-4739-b658-c100169561a0\', \'multiverseId\': 514329}, \'multiverseid\': 514329}, {\'name\': \'Mur déterré\', \'text\': \'Défenseur\\n{1}, {T} : Meulez une carte. (Mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mur\', \'flavor\': \'« Ne laissez pas le silence vous tromper. Ces vieilles pierres essaient de vous parler. »\\n—Augusta, doyenne de Forsapience\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514620&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0567e835-b154-42f7-8815-2a196e43401e\', \'multiverseId\': 514620}, \'multiverseid\': 514620}, {\'name\': \'Muro Dissotterrato\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\n{1}, {T}: Macina una carta. (Metti nel tuo cimitero la prima carta del tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"Non lasciare che la quiete ti inganni. Queste vecchie pietre stanno cercando di parlarti."\\n—Augusta, decana di Archeorocca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad3baf09-78e0-4d17-8ad2-a10c7d2e95fd\', \'multiverseId\': 514911}, \'multiverseid\': 514911}, {\'name\': \'発掘された壁\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n{1}, {T}：カード１枚を切削する。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードをあなたの墓地に置く。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': \'「静寂に欺かれないようにしてください。ここの古い石は皆さんに語りかけようとしています。」\\n――ロアホールドの学部長、オーガスタ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81e318e8-b6e1-4193-9872-8fbf125b55a3\', \'multiverseId\': 515202}, \'multiverseid\': 515202}, {\'name\': \'발굴된 벽\', \'text\': \'수비태세\\n{1}, {T}: 카드 한 장을 민다. (당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 벽\', \'flavor\': \'"조용함에 속지 마라. 이 오래된 돌덩이들은 네게 이야기를 하려고 하고 있으니까."\\n—로어홀드 학장, 아우구스타\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3465e13a-28ef-4118-8549-0817fcb226d1\', \'multiverseId\': 515493}, \'multiverseid\': 515493}, {\'name\': \'Muralha Escavada\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\n{1}, {T}: Triture um card. (Coloque o card do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Barreira\', \'flavor\': \'"Não se deixe enganar pela quietude. Estas pedras velhas estão tentando falar com você."\\n— Augusta, decana de Sapioforte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9378c4e1-6704-4be2-b814-78da9a129af9\', \'multiverseId\': 515784}, \'multiverseid\': 515784}, {\'name\': \'Раскопанная Стена\', \'text\': \'Защитник\\n{1}, {T}: скрутите одну карту. (Положите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Стена\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть тишина не обманывает тебя. Эти старые камни пытаются говорить с тобой».\\n— Августа, декан Лорхолда\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a42274-2d5b-44df-87e8-22a0a65233ef\', \'multiverseId\': 516075}, \'multiverseid\': 516075}, {\'name\': \'挖掘堆墙\', \'text\': \'守军\\n{1}，{T}：磨一张牌。（将你牌库顶的一张牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～墙\', \'flavor\': \'「别给这安静氛围给骗了。这旧石头想要跟你说话呢。」\\n～衡鉴院长欧歌塔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3df48917-98da-4c01-a605-aaf3d8b3f0cd\', \'multiverseId\': 516366}, \'multiverseid\': 516366}, {\'name\': \'挖掘堆牆\', \'text\': \'守軍\\n{1}，{T}：磨一張牌。（將你牌庫頂的一張牌置入你的墳墓場。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～牆\', \'flavor\': \'「別給這安靜氛圍給騙了。這舊石頭想要跟你說話呢。」\\n～衡鑑院長歐歌塔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63bd703c-2193-490a-b80e-3b5037ff0f56\', \'multiverseId\': 516657}, \'multiverseid\': 516657}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausloten des Verbotenen\', \'text\': \'Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du eine oder mehrere Kreaturen opfern. Wenn du dies tust, kopiere diesen Zauberspruch für jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise geopfert wurde.\\nDu ziehst eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Da Strixhaven sämtliche Magie aus dem Zeitalter des Blutes verboten hatte, begann Extus genau dort mit seiner Forschung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513849&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e9b4dfc-16a5-469e-a65d-b118bfc520b2\', \'multiverseId\': 513849}, \'multiverseid\': 513849}, {\'name\': \'Conectar con lo prohibido\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes sacrificar una o más criaturas. Cuando lo hagas, copia este hechizo por cada criatura sacrificada de esta manera.\\nRobas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Strixhaven prohibía toda la magia de la Edad de Sangre, por lo que Extus la consideró idónea para iniciar su investigación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ca79682-c8cd-413c-a6c8-e0cf042ed5b1\', \'multiverseId\': 514140}, \'multiverseid\': 514140}, {\'name\': "Sonder l\'interdit", \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez sacrifier au moins une créature. Quand vous faites ainsi, copiez ce sort pour chaque créature sacrifiée de cette manière.\\nVous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Strixhaven interdit toute magie issue de l\'Ère sanglante, c\'est donc par là qu\'Extus commença ses recherches.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514431&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'121c6332-cba9-4306-9b0f-9b3e1cb41091\', \'multiverseId\': 514431}, \'multiverseid\': 514431}, {\'name\': \'Sondare il Proibito\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, puoi sacrificare una o più creature. Quando lo fai, copia questa magia per ogni creatura sacrificata in questo modo.\\nPesca una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Strixhaven proibiva qualsiasi forma di magia dell\'Era del Sangue, così Extus iniziò la sua ricerca proprio da lì.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d0fc903-ccc6-4eca-a61e-b186d110b387\', \'multiverseId\': 514722}, \'multiverseid\': 514722}, {\'name\': \'禁忌の調査\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたは１体以上のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたとき、これにより生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーの数に等しい回数、この呪文をコピーする。\\nあなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ストリクスヘイヴンは血の時代の魔法をすべて禁じた。そこでエクスタスは、そこから研究を始めた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7b6dd93-0d04-40b8-890d-e1509e8e0ce3\', \'multiverseId\': 515013}, \'multiverseid\': 515013}, {\'name\': \'금지된 지식 파헤치기\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 당신은 생물을 한 개 이상 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 이렇게 희생된 각 생물마다 이 주문을 복사한다.\\n당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑고 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'스트릭스헤이븐은 피의 시대에 사용되던 모든 마법을 금지시켰고, 그렇기에 엑스투스는 거기서부터 연구를 시작했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9928f296-6342-485a-830f-da18857da921\', \'multiverseId\': 515304}, \'multiverseid\': 515304}, {\'name\': \'Perscrutar o Proibido\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, você pode sacrificar uma ou mais criaturas. Quando fizer isto, copie esta mágica para cada criatura sacrificada desta forma.\\nVocê compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Strixhaven proibiu toda a magia da Idade do Sangue, por isso foi lá que Extus começou sua pesquisa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'023205cd-cd92-4bfd-a9a7-ac5fa0f2d1d2\', \'multiverseId\': 515595}, \'multiverseid\': 515595}, {\'name\': \'Окунуться в Запретное\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания вы можете пожертвовать одно или несколько существ. Когда вы это делаете, скопируйте это заклинание за каждое существо, пожертвованное таким образом.\\nВы берете карту и теряете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Любая магия времен Кровавого века в Стриксхейвене была строго запрещена, так что именно с нее Экстус начал свои изыскания.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9898dbd-3d51-435e-be63-2ef0f9334707\', \'multiverseId\': 515886}, \'multiverseid\': 515886}, {\'name\': \'尝试禁法\', \'text\': \'你可以牺牲一个或数个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。当你如此作时，每以此法牺牲一个生物，便将此咒语复制一次。\\n你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'斯翠海文禁止使用血腥时代的任何魔法，于是埃陀斯的研究从此开始。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd05887e-5b61-4594-b824-5405f155642b\', \'multiverseId\': 516177}, \'multiverseid\': 516177}, {\'name\': \'嘗試禁法\', \'text\': \'你可以犧牲一個或數個生物，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。當你如此作時，每以此法犧牲一個生物，便將此咒語複製一次。\\n你抽一張牌且失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'斯翠海文禁止使用血腥時代的任何魔法，於是埃陀斯的研究從此開始。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261f2ee4-bae8-493f-980d-988aaaa33b40\', \'multiverseId\': 516468}, \'multiverseid\': 516468}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausmerzungsritual\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte mit Manabetrag 2 oder weniger, die kein Land ist. Erzeuge {B} oder {G} für jede auf diese Weise zerstörte bleibende Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine eigene Zerbrechlichkeit ist dein Untergang. Ich mache sie nur offenbar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513955&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'004a36d1-d9a8-470d-8547-a5baac6367b2\', \'multiverseId\': 513955}, \'multiverseid\': 513955}, {\'name\': \'Ritual de eliminación\', \'text\': \'Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con valor de maná de 2 o menos. Agrega {B} o {G} por cada permanente destruido de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu debilidad es tu perdición. Yo solo la expongo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ab3573a-62ac-4101-84d2-d33ed1d4c7a2\', \'multiverseId\': 514246}, \'multiverseid\': 514246}, {\'name\': \'Rituel sacrificiel\', \'text\': \'Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain ayant une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 2. Ajoutez {B} ou {G} pour chaque permanent détruit de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ta propre fragilité est ta faiblesse. Je ne fais que l\'exposer. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514537&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c84fabf-9112-46ff-93d8-8d23bbbc7943\', \'multiverseId\': 514537}, \'multiverseid\': 514537}, {\'name\': \'Rituale di Distruzione\', \'text\': \'Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 2. Aggiungi {B} o {G} per ogni permanente distrutto in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La tua fragilità è la tua rovina. Io mi limito a rivelarla."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0592b548-5e69-4a9a-80cd-5636e51d4adf\', \'multiverseId\': 514828}, \'multiverseid\': 514828}, {\'name\': \'選別の儀式\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が２以下で土地でないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。これにより破壊されたパーマネント１つにつき、{B}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたは自分自身の弱点で破滅したのよ。私はそれを利用しただけ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2ba4574-9862-453b-a737-725bf01603e6\', \'multiverseId\': 515119}, \'multiverseid\': 515119}, {\'name\': \'도태 의식\', \'text\': \'마나 값이 2 이하이며 대지가 아닌 각 지속물을 파괴한다. 이런 식으로 파괴된 각 지속물마다 {B} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"네 자신의 약점이 네 실패의 원인이다. 난 그저 그걸 드러냈을 뿐이야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c376b18-01df-4680-a151-71452bc2e575\', \'multiverseId\': 515410}, \'multiverseid\': 515410}, {\'name\': \'Ritual da Ceifa\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as permanentes não de terreno com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 2. Adicione {B} ou {G} para cada permanente destruída desta forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua própria fragilidade é sua desgraça. Eu apenas a exponho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40214c25-80ae-4901-ba48-42cd7a7c9dfe\', \'multiverseId\': 515701}, \'multiverseid\': 515701}, {\'name\': \'Ритуал Выбраковки\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте каждый не являющийся землей перманент с мановой ценностью не более 2. Добавьте {B} или {G} за каждый перманент, уничтоженный таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Твоя слабость станет твоей погибелью. Я же — лишь та, кто разоблачит ее».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59c3a74a-0c83-4bab-98d2-23386c732acb\', \'multiverseId\': 515992}, \'multiverseid\': 515992}, {\'name\': \'牲祭仪式\', \'text\': \'消灭所有法术力值等于或小于2的非地永久物。每以此法消灭一个永久物，便加{B}或{G}。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你失败的原因在于自身的软弱。我只不过是为你指出这一点。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4decf17-9ab8-4692-8a55-d17811bd39cb\', \'multiverseId\': 516283}, \'multiverseid\': 516283}, {\'name\': \'牲祭儀式\', \'text\': \'消滅所有魔法力值等於或小於2的非地永久物。每以此法消滅一個永久物，便加{B}或{G}。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「你失敗的原因在於自身的軟弱。我只不過是為你指出這一點。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e62b740-494c-44b8-ac07-8bc067fd8b22\', \'multiverseId\': 516574}, \'multiverseid\': 516574}]', "[{'name': 'Ausmerzungsritual', 'text': 'Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte mit Manabetrag 2 oder weniger, die kein Land ist. Erzeuge {B} oder {G} für jede auf diese Weise zerstörte bleibende Karte.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517032&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1da990ad-c5f6-4c10-999d-0a98aa9cecd6', 'multiverseId': 517032}, 'multiverseid': 517032}, {'name': 'Ritual de eliminación', 'text': 'Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con valor de maná de 2 o menos. Agrega {B} o {G} por cada permanente destruido de esta manera.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517127&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64fd8bb0-bbf9-4403-a936-60b713c02de4', 'multiverseId': 517127}, 'multiverseid': 517127}, {'name': 'Rituel sacrificiel', 'text': 'Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain ayant une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 2. Ajoutez {B} ou {G} pour chaque permanent détruit de cette manière.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517222&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69e3e075-c199-4e1b-9909-111d4aee4b25', 'multiverseId': 517222}, 'multiverseid': 517222}, {'name': 'Rituale di Distruzione', 'text': 'Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 2. Aggiungi {B} o {G} per ogni permanente distrutto in questo modo.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517317&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78dcc8a6-572e-4a7c-b37f-6318a0090c2e', 'multiverseId': 517317}, 'multiverseid': 517317}, {'name': '選別の儀式', 'text': 'マナ総量が２以下で土地でないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。これにより破壊されたパーマネント１つにつき、{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517412&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0be638af-d775-41eb-b707-d123b93330fb', 'multiverseId': 517412}, 'multiverseid': 517412}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ausstoßen\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine getappte Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Quintorius war ein Tagträumer, der sich viel lieber durch Geschichtsbücher wühlte, als Kampftaktiken zu üben. Mit der Militärakademie war er sich nur in einem Punkt einig: dass er dort nicht hingehörte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513786&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75af5771-0d59-4edc-b560-4246333ce0e3\', \'multiverseId\': 513786}, \'multiverseid\': 513786}, {\'name\': \'Echar\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura girada objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Quintorius era todo un soñador. Le hacía mucho más feliz leer libros de historia que practicar tácticas bélicas. La academia militar y él solo estaban de acuerdo en una cosa: su lugar no estaba en las filas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29c28700-ad57-4c2b-97f2-0fd38bd2aabf\', \'multiverseId\': 514077}, \'multiverseid\': 514077}, {\'name\': \'Exclusion\', \'text\': \'Exilez une créature engagée ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Quintorius était un rêveur, bien plus heureux plongé dans ses livres d\'histoire que sur le terrain à apprendre les tactiques de combat. Lui et l\'académie militaire étaient d\'accord sur un point : il n\'avait rien à faire là.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514368&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'384a80e7-cf68-4b96-a4aa-ee3012f12d15\', \'multiverseId\': 514368}, \'multiverseid\': 514368}, {\'name\': \'Allontanare\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura TAPpata bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Quintorius era un sognatore, più a suo agio fra i libri di storia che a esercitarsi in tattiche belliche. Era d\'accordo con l\'accademia militare su una sola cosa: non faceva per lui.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ca40936-f5a0-45b8-b88d-050851228882\', \'multiverseId\': 514659}, \'multiverseid\': 514659}, {\'name\': \'除名\', \'text\': \'タップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'クイントリウスは夢想家で、戦闘訓練よりも歴史書を読み漁ることに喜びを感じていた。彼と軍学校の見解が一致したのはただ一点のみ。クイントリウスは軍士官にふさわしくないということだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd22204a-969b-4fa4-95af-0266d368411b\', \'multiverseId\': 514950}, \'multiverseid\': 514950}, {\'name\': \'퇴학\', \'text\': \'탭된 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'퀸토리우스는 전투 전술을 연습하는 것보다 역사책을 뒤지는 것을 훨씬 더 행복해하는 몽상가였다. 그와 사관학교가 서로 동의한 단 한 가지는, 그가 부대에 어울리지 않는다는 것이었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19b4b572-32ee-4bcc-9227-6c5412a72f74\', \'multiverseId\': 515241}, \'multiverseid\': 515241}, {\'name\': \'Expulsar\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo virada.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quintorius era um sonhador, muito mais feliz revirando livros de história do que praticando táticas de batalha. Havia apenas uma coisa em que ele concordava com a academia militar: ele não pertencia àquele lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcb79340-9334-46ef-a734-55f709350234\', \'multiverseId\': 515532}, \'multiverseid\': 515532}, {\'name\': \'Отчислить\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое повернутое существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Квинториус был мечтателем, и ему куда больше нравилось копаться в книгах по истории, чем оттачивать боевую тактику. С военной академией он соглашался только в одном: ему не место в их рядах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d197f474-0e09-48a4-af26-a0e2f5088f5f\', \'multiverseId\': 515823}, \'multiverseid\': 515823}, {\'name\': \'除名\', \'text\': \'放逐目标已横置的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'昆托力想象力丰富，相较于刻苦训练战术，他更喜欢遨游历史书海。不过他跟军事学院倒有一点意见相同：他不适合参军。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20e4c0fb-d623-49ff-9953-db47f3e42c15\', \'multiverseId\': 516114}, \'multiverseid\': 516114}, {\'name\': \'除名\', \'text\': \'放逐目標已橫置的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'昆托力想像力豐富，相較於刻苦訓練戰術，他更喜歡遨遊歷史書海。不過他跟軍事學院倒有一點意見相同：他不適合參軍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'623e3fd6-3aa0-4d03-ba77-5a22da3e1b94\', \'multiverseId\': 516405}, \'multiverseid\': 516405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begeistertes Studium\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+1 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nLerne eine Lektion. (Du kannst entweder eine Lektion-Karte von außerhalb der Partie, die du besitzt, offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen oder eine Karte abwerfen, um eine Karte zu ziehen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn die Feder mächtiger ist als das Schwert, was kann dann erst ein riesiges Zauberbuch anrichten!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513867&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cd3037e-ed7c-4e9a-9c35-0f7b7740b42c\', \'multiverseId\': 513867}, \'multiverseid\': 513867}, {\'name\': \'Estudio esmerado\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+1 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\\nAprende. (Puedes mostrar una carta de Lección de la cual eres propietario de fuera del juego y ponerla en tu mano o descartar una carta para robar una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si una pluma es más fuerte que una espada, ¡imagínate lo que puede llegar a hacer un tomo gigante!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d51fa5-6c42-4c76-8a35-f869134612ff\', \'multiverseId\': 514158}, \'multiverseid\': 514158}, {\'name\': \'Étude enthousiaste\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +3/+1 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nApprenez. (Vous pouvez révéler une carte de leçon que vous possédez en dehors de la partie et la mettre dans votre main, ou vous défausser d\'une carte pour piocher une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Si la plume est plus forte que l\'épée, imagine ce qu\'on pourrait faire avec un grimoire géant ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ad2655a-dda5-429a-b1e8-1cbeb3ab39c7\', \'multiverseId\': 514449}, \'multiverseid\': 514449}, {\'name\': \'Studio Appassionante\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+1 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\\nApprendi. (Puoi rivelare una carta Lezione che possiedi al di fuori della partita e aggiungerla alla tua mano o scartare una carta per pescare una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se la penna ferisce più della spada, pensa cosa può fare un tomo gigantesco!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e548e181-f542-4a91-b77e-efef8740690d\', \'multiverseId\': 514740}, \'multiverseid\': 514740}, {\'name\': \'熱心な研究\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\\n履修を行う。（あなたは、ゲームの外部からあなたがオーナーである講義・カード１枚を公開しあなたの手札に加えるか、カード１枚を捨てカード１枚を引くか、どちらかを行ってもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ペンは剣よりも強いって言うでしょ。巨大な秘本ならもっとすごいわよ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd942353-ec56-443e-9f06-070e490dee02\', \'multiverseId\': 515031}, \'multiverseid\': 515031}, {\'name\': \'열정적인 연구\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+1을 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\\n학습한다. (당신은 게임 밖에서 당신이 소유한 수업 카드 한 장을 공개하고 그 카드를 당신의 손에 넣거나, 카드 한 장을 버린 후 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"펜이 칼보다 강하다면, 거대한 책으로는 무엇을 할 수 있을지 생각해 봐!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dab4f8ac-e183-4dbe-9f3f-ca59fb00f3f8\', \'multiverseId\': 515322}, \'multiverseid\': 515322}, {\'name\': \'Estudo Entusiasmado\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+1 e ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\\nAprender. (Você pode revelar um card de Lição seu de fora do jogo e colocá-lo em sua mão, ou descartar um card para comprar um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Se a pena é mais forte que a espada, imagine o que um livro gigante poderia fazer!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14be47e7-8ab7-48bb-95ce-126c3bf33421\', \'multiverseId\': 515613}, \'multiverseid\': 515613}, {\'name\': \'Увлеченное Изучение\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+1 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\\nВыучите урок. (Вы можете показать принадлежащую вам карту Урока вне игры и положить ее в вашу руку, или вы можете сбросить карту, чтобы взять карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Если перо сильнее меча, то только подумай, что можно сделать здоровенной книжищей!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4edae8e-3109-45ff-a02b-517eb6a5c8e7\', \'multiverseId\': 515904}, \'multiverseid\': 515904}, {\'name\': \'狂热钻研\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+3/+1且获得践踏异能。\\n温习。（你可以从游戏外展示一张由你拥有的课程牌并置于你手上，或弃一张牌来抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如果要说文胜于武、笔强于剑，那一本『巨』著威力该有多大！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64556b49-0fb9-4fa6-a2af-6d33a8680d50\', \'multiverseId\': 516195}, \'multiverseid\': 516195}, {\'name\': \'狂熱鑽研\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+3/+1且獲得踐踏異能。\\n溫習。（你可以從遊戲外展示一張由你擁有的課程牌並置於你手上，或棄一張牌來抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「如果要說文勝於武、筆強於劍，那一本『巨』著威力該有多大！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb1c37eb-ef26-4035-b4ba-2b394aef8f0d\', \'multiverseId\': 516486}, \'multiverseid\': 516486}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beherrschen der Unendlichkeit\', \'text\': \'Tausche deine Hand und deinen Friedhof.\\nSchicke das Beherrschen der Unendlichkeit ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Als ich in den Sternenbogen trat, wurde alles vollkommen klar. Leben und Tod sind keine Gegensätze, sondern ein endloser Pfad, der sich windet und wieder auf sich selbst trifft, sodass er nie endet und nie beginnt."\\n—Zhaer, Professorin für Biophilosophie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd796068-6990-4620-858d-20eca72540f8\', \'multiverseId\': 513974}, \'multiverseid\': 513974}, {\'name\': \'Dominar la infinidad\', \'text\': \'Intercambia tu mano y tu cementerio.\\nExilia Dominar la infinidad.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando llegué al arco estelar, lo entendí todo a la perfección. La vida y la muerte no eran contrarios, sino un camino eterno que se retorcía y retraía sobre sí mismo, sin un fin o un principio".\\n—Zhaer, profesora de biofilosofía\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09692334-f47b-4ff1-aabc-703140fac786\', \'multiverseId\': 514265}, \'multiverseid\': 514265}, {\'name\': "Dompter l\'infini", \'text\': "Échangez votre main et votre cimetière.\\nExilez Dompter l\'infini.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Lorsque j\'ai traversé l\'arche stellaire, tout est devenu parfaitement clair. La vie et la mort ne sont pas des opposés, mais une voie sans fin qui forme une boucle qui ne commence et ne finit jamais. »\\n—Zhaër, professeur de biophilosophie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514556&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ffb3571-3055-4215-8886-59499401da91\', \'multiverseId\': 514556}, \'multiverseid\': 514556}, {\'name\': "Imbrigliare l\'Infinito", \'text\': "Scambia la tua mano e il tuo cimitero.\\nEsilia Imbrigliare l\'Infinito.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Appena ho messo piede nell\\\'arco stellare, tutto mi è apparso chiaro. Vita e morte non sono opposti, bensì un sentiero infinito che si intreccia su se stesso, senza fine e senza inizio."\\n—Zhaer, professoressa di biofilosofia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18939e05-e097-4b2b-b1d9-fdded1ea7a9c\', \'multiverseId\': 514847}, \'multiverseid\': 514847}, {\'name\': \'無限性の支配\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札と墓地を交換する。\\n無限性の支配を追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「スターアーチに足を踏み入れるとすべてが完全に明白となった。生と死は対立ではなく終わりのない道だ。それ自身に巻き付きまた戻り、終わることも始まることもないのだ。」\\n――生命哲学の教授、ゼイル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58aba8db-f627-4f39-aeca-5a6a1433e949\', \'multiverseId\': 515138}, \'multiverseid\': 515138}, {\'name\': \'무한을 통제하다\', \'text\': \'당신의 손과 무덤을 교환한다.\\n무한을 통제하다를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"별 아치 안으로 들어서자, 모든 것이 완벽하게 분명해졌다. 삶과 죽음은 서로 상반되는 것이 아니라, 스스로 꿈틀거리며 끝도 없고 시작도 하지 않는, 끝없는 길이다."\\n—생명철학 교수, 자에르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c633c173-612a-4c00-bd61-914546f0ecc7\', \'multiverseId\': 515429}, \'multiverseid\': 515429}, {\'name\': \'Comandar a Infinitude\', \'text\': \'Permute sua mão e seu cemitério.\\nExile Comandar a Infinitude.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando entrei no arco estelar, tudo se tornou perfeitamente claro. A vida e a morte não são opostos, mas um caminho sem fim, rodopiando, sem início e sem fim."\\n— Zhaer, professor de biofilosofia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac582fea-70be-47dd-8dda-cc3282a841ed\', \'multiverseId\': 515720}, \'multiverseid\': 515720}, {\'name\': \'Укрощение Бесконечности\', \'text\': \'Поменяйте местами вашу руку и ваше кладбище.\\nИзгоните Укрощение Бесконечности.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда я шагнула в звездную арку, все стало совершенно ясно. Жизнь и смерть — это не противоположности, а бесконечный путь, который извивается, петляет, пересекается сам с собой, который никогда не начинался и никогда не закончится».\\n— Жейр, профессор биофилософии\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2a86a44-0e5b-4f3d-b3f2-0a65753b6bbb\', \'multiverseId\': 516011}, \'multiverseid\': 516011}, {\'name\': \'掌驭无垠\', \'text\': \'交换你的手牌和坟墓场。\\n放逐掌驭无垠。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我踏入星拱，一切都变得豁然开朗。生死并非对立两面，而是一条无尽通途。这条道路蜿蜒缠绕，最后连结一体，无所谓终，也无所谓始。」\\n～生物哲学教授札依儿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'577eaa21-b814-439f-b38e-69e9d7e3f6f1\', \'multiverseId\': 516302}, \'multiverseid\': 516302}, {\'name\': \'掌馭無垠\', \'text\': \'交換你的手牌和墳墓場。\\n放逐掌馭無垠。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我踏入星拱，一切都變得豁然開朗。生死並非對立兩面，而是一條無盡通途。這條道路蜿蜒纏繞，最後連結一體，無所謂終，也無所謂始。」\\n～生物哲學教授札依兒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d33bd9a1-cbc1-41aa-be04-c9a8f20cf47a\', \'multiverseId\': 516593}, \'multiverseid\': 516593}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beherrschen der Unendlichkeit\', \'text\': \'Tausche deine Hand und deinen Friedhof.\\nSchicke das Beherrschen der Unendlichkeit ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517038&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0679884-3696-402d-b7a6-4bfb28d01ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 517038}, \'multiverseid\': 517038}, {\'name\': \'Dominar la infinidad\', \'text\': \'Intercambia tu mano y tu cementerio.\\nExilia Dominar la infinidad.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a43414d-b76a-44b7-a510-1e25271e52a3\', \'multiverseId\': 517133}, \'multiverseid\': 517133}, {\'name\': "Dompter l\'infini", \'text\': "Échangez votre main et votre cimetière.\\nExilez Dompter l\'infini.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517228&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24acc110-e7e7-4e18-bddf-2b00988b8c7c\', \'multiverseId\': 517228}, \'multiverseid\': 517228}, {\'name\': "Imbrigliare l\'Infinito", \'text\': "Scambia la tua mano e il tuo cimitero.\\nEsilia Imbrigliare l\'Infinito.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62e65734-2994-4260-b26a-11150ad69492\', \'multiverseId\': 517323}, \'multiverseid\': 517323}, {\'name\': \'無限性の支配\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札と墓地を交換する。\\n無限性の支配を追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61cca4cb-8c2f-4a39-bd6d-f0c0f5c981a3\', \'multiverseId\': 517418}, \'multiverseid\': 517418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beledros Blütenwelk\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments erzeugst du einen 1/1 schwarzen und grünen Schädling-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu."\\nBezahle 10 Lebenspunkte: Enttappe alle Länder, die du kontrollierst. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae43edf8-b410-468b-9cb0-c7370bee7940\', \'multiverseId\': 513946}, \'multiverseid\': 513946}, {\'name\': \'Beledros Flosmarcitus\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, crea una ficha de criatura Plaga negra y verde 1/1 con "Cuando esta criatura muera, ganas 1 vida".\\nPagar 10 vidas: Endereza todas las tierras que controlas. Activa esto solo una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón anciano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2924c242-ddab-4677-a857-81212908fb3e\', \'multiverseId\': 514237}, \'multiverseid\': 514237}, {\'name\': \'Beledros Flestrefleur\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de chaque entretien, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire et verte Parasite avec « Quand cette créature meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie ».\\nPayez 10 points de vie : Dégagez tous les terrains que vous contrôlez. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514528&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ac3ec8-fdc1-46dd-ab27-97b8d382a43a\', \'multiverseId\': 514528}, \'multiverseid\': 514528}, {\'name\': \'Beledros Germoglioscuro\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nAll\\\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, crea una pedina creatura Peste 1/1 nera e verde con "Quando questa creatura muore, guadagni 1 punto vita".\\nPaga 10 punti vita: STAPpa tutte le terre che controlli. Attiva solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Antico Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a5f362-4b09-4dd0-a568-aba86458c080\', \'multiverseId\': 514819}, \'multiverseid\': 514819}, {\'name\': \'ベレドロス・ウィザーブルーム\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n各アップキープの開始時に、「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。」を持つ黒緑の１/１の邪魔者・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n10点のライフを支払う：あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地をアンタップする。毎ターン１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'691a2930-18aa-4577-8200-2d6c4d7baaff\', \'multiverseId\': 515110}, \'multiverseid\': 515110}, {\'name\': \'벨레드로스 위더블룸\', \'text\': \'비행\\n각 유지단 시작에, "이 생물이 죽을 때, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다."를 가진 1/1 흑색 및 녹색 해충 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n생명 10점을 지불한다: 당신이 조종하는 모든 대지를 언탭한다. 한 턴에 한 번만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 장로 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ddad7e7-b485-4ff4-aee1-b8cfdcb63261\', \'multiverseId\': 515401}, \'multiverseid\': 515401}, {\'name\': \'Beledros Murchaflor\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, crie uma ficha de criatura Peste preta e verde 1/1 com "Quando esta criatura morre, você ganha 1 ponto de vida".\\nPague 10 pontos de vida: Desvire todos os terrenos que você controla. Ative somente uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão Ancião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7eed438-b4e1-4826-b908-7e0034eacb43\', \'multiverseId\': 515692}, \'multiverseid\': 515692}, {\'name\': \'Беледрос Визерблум\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 черный и зеленый Вредитель со способностью «Когда это существо умирает, вы получаете 1 жизнь».\\nЗаплатите 10 жизней: разверните все земли под вашим контролем. Активируйте только один раз в каждом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Старейшина Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9de56c6f-3cc2-420a-b79e-f3f3fc1c3b49\', \'multiverseId\': 515983}, \'multiverseid\': 515983}, {\'name\': \'贝雷卓靡华\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在每个维持开始时，派出一个1/1，黑绿双色的害虫衍生生物，且具有「当此生物死去时，你获得1点生命。」\\n支付10点生命：重置所有由你操控的地。每回合只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～长老／龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31c1db16-bef8-4a8b-b1d5-6468d124457c\', \'multiverseId\': 516274}, \'multiverseid\': 516274}, {\'name\': \'貝雷卓靡華\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n在每個維持開始時，派出一個1/1，黑綠雙色的害蟲衍生生物，且具有「當此生物死去時，你獲得1點生命。」\\n支付10點生命：重置所有由你操控的地。每回合只能起動一次。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～長老／龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ff2653d-b04c-4aac-849b-40d359d52d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 516565}, \'multiverseid\': 516565}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beledros Blütenwelk\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments erzeugst du einen 1/1 schwarzen und grünen Schädling-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu."\\nBezahle 10 Lebenspunkte: Enttappe alle Länder, die du kontrollierst. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517448&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21de3cd2-6ef2-442e-9853-c4ef46202746\', \'multiverseId\': 517448}, \'multiverseid\': 517448}, {\'name\': \'Beledros Flosmarcitus\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, crea una ficha de criatura Plaga negra y verde 1/1 con "Cuando esta criatura muera, ganas 1 vida".\\nPagar 10 vidas: Endereza todas las tierras que controlas. Activa esto solo una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón anciano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cab86ca7-db02-48b9-9a11-dd405ecb86e4\', \'multiverseId\': 517453}, \'multiverseid\': 517453}, {\'name\': \'Beledros Flestrefleur\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de chaque entretien, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire et verte Parasite avec « Quand cette créature meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie ».\\nPayez 10 points de vie : Dégagez tous les terrains que vous contrôlez. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a01f7684-a504-48aa-afc6-33b9ade5fe04\', \'multiverseId\': 517458}, \'multiverseid\': 517458}, {\'name\': \'Beledros Germoglioscuro\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nAll\\\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, crea una pedina creatura Peste 1/1 nera e verde con "Quando questa creatura muore, guadagni 1 punto vita".\\nPaga 10 punti vita: STAPpa tutte le terre che controlli. Attiva solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Antico Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1eb2596-d311-45a3-88fa-ed3f3a443a56\', \'multiverseId\': 517463}, \'multiverseid\': 517463}, {\'name\': \'ベレドロス・ウィザーブルーム\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n各アップキープの開始時、「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。」を持つ黒緑の１/１の邪魔者・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n10点のライフを支払う：あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地をアンタップする。毎ターン１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afca9be1-4589-4b9d-b3a9-8f773d3e521d\', \'multiverseId\': 517468}, \'multiverseid\': 517468}, {\'name\': \'벨레드로스 위더블룸\', \'text\': \'비행\\n각 유지단 시작에, "이 생물이 죽을 때, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다."를 가진 1/1 흑색 및 녹색 해충 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n생명 10점을 지불한다: 당신이 조종하는 모든 대지를 언탭한다. 한 턴에 한 번만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 장로 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dda87889-d903-413f-a7c8-01ff5026e0f6\', \'multiverseId\': 517473}, \'multiverseid\': 517473}, {\'name\': \'Beledros Murchaflor\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, crie uma ficha de criatura Peste preta e verde 1/1 com "Quando esta criatura morre, você ganha 1 ponto de vida".\\nPague 10 pontos de vida: Desvire todos os terrenos que você controla. Ative somente uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão Ancião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c26048ef-d308-473e-ba44-06c270c127b3\', \'multiverseId\': 517478}, \'multiverseid\': 517478}, {\'name\': \'Беледрос Визерблум\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 черный и зеленый Вредитель со способностью «Когда это существо умирает, вы получаете 1 жизнь».\\nЗаплатите 10 жизней: разверните все земли под вашим контролем. Активируйте только один раз в каждом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Старейшина Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aa02144-bdd3-453c-bdf1-9c687deff3b7\', \'multiverseId\': 517483}, \'multiverseid\': 517483}, {\'name\': \'贝雷卓靡华\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在每个维持开始时，派出一个1/1，黑绿双色的害虫衍生生物，且具有「当此生物死去时，你获得1点生命。」\\n支付10点生命：重置所有由你操控的地。每回合只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～长老／龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f79021a-541a-4c72-b003-db01f1761896\', \'multiverseId\': 517488}, \'multiverseid\': 517488}, {\'name\': \'貝雷卓靡華\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n在每個維持開始時，派出一個1/1，黑綠雙色的害蟲衍生生物，且具有「當此生物死去時，你獲得1點生命。」\\n支付10點生命：重置所有由你操控的地。每回合只能起動一次。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～長老／龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a98a096b-59c7-489c-bbd5-e26753b2a5a9\', \'multiverseId\': 517493}, \'multiverseid\': 517493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beleuchten der Geschichte\', \'text\': \'Wirf eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten. Falls dann sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind, erzeuge einen 3/2 roten und weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei — Lektion\', \'flavor\': \'„Schau dir die Details in diesem Mauerwerk an! Professor, unsere Annahmen über die Benutzung von Werkzeugen bei den frühen Kathorranern sind möglicherweise nicht korrekt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513876&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ae5abc5-9efd-4686-9982-45badc423296\', \'multiverseId\': 513876}, \'multiverseid\': 513876}, {\'name\': \'Iluminar la historia\', \'text\': \'Descarta cualquier cantidad de cartas y luego roba esa misma cantidad de cartas. Luego, si hay siete o más cartas en tu cementerio, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu roja y blanca 3/2.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro — Lección\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Fíjese en los detalles de esta cantería! Profesor, nuestras conjeturas sobre los primeros usos de las herramientas kathorranas quizá no son correctas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cdc9cd5-2533-4574-8c3b-a9f263577a32\', \'multiverseId\': 514167}, \'multiverseid\': 514167}, {\'name\': "Éclairer l\'histoire", \'text\': "Défaussez-vous de n\'importe quel nombre de cartes, puis piochez autant de cartes. Puis, s\'il y a au moins sept cartes dans votre cimetière, créez un jeton de créature 3/2 rouge et blanche Esprit.", \'type\': \'Rituel : leçon\', \'flavor\': "« Regardez tous ces détails dans la sculpture ! Professeur, nos suppositions sur l\'utilisation d\'outils par les premiers Kathorrans pourraient être fausses. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c31fc44b-bbcf-4bf5-9746-046556b6c428\', \'multiverseId\': 514458}, \'multiverseid\': 514458}, {\'name\': \'Illuminare la Storia\', \'text\': \'Scarta un qualsiasi numero di carte, poi pesca altrettante carte. Poi, se ci sono sette o più carte nel tuo cimitero, crea una pedina creatura Spirito 3/2 rossa e bianca.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria — Lezione\', \'flavor\': \'"Guardi i dettagli di queste statue! Professore, le nostre supposizioni sugli utensili dei primi Kathorrani potrebbero essere errate."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acdcbb4b-c661-43b5-b34b-b3bd019c6785\', \'multiverseId\': 514749}, \'multiverseid\': 514749}, {\'name\': \'歴史解明学\', \'text\': \'望む枚数のカードを捨て、その後その枚数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、あなたの墓地に７枚以上のカードがあるなら、赤白の３/２のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー — 講義\', \'flavor\': \'「この石像の細部を見てください！教授、初期カソーラの工具使用に関する仮説は間違っていたかもしれません。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77760930-631d-4b07-89bc-314ded51c4ed\', \'multiverseId\': 515040}, \'multiverseid\': 515040}, {\'name\': \'역사 조명\', \'text\': \'카드를 원하는 수만큼 버린 후, 그만큼 카드를 뽑는다. 그 후 당신의 무덤에 카드가 일곱 장 이상 있다면, 3/2 적색 및 백색 신령 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법 — 수업\', \'flavor\': \'"섬세하게 조각된 이 석조물을 보세요! 교수님, 카토란 초기 도구 사용에 대한 저희의 가설이 정확하지 않을 수도 있습니다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'987d913a-bf9a-4975-adad-5cf5ca5ac0a7\', \'multiverseId\': 515331}, \'multiverseid\': 515331}, {\'name\': \'Iluminar a História\', \'text\': \'Descarte qualquer número de cards e depois compre uma quantidade correspondente de cards. Depois, se houver sete ou mais cards em seu cemitério, crie uma ficha de criatura Espírito vermelha e branca 3/2.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço — Lição\', \'flavor\': \'"Veja o detalhe nesta cantaria! Professor, nossa teoria sobre o uso de ferramentas dos primeiros kathorranos talvez esteja incorreta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a912842a-256d-4d3b-a4cf-6ebc45fa901a\', \'multiverseId\': 515622}, \'multiverseid\': 515622}, {\'name\': \'Освещение Истории\', \'text\': \'Сбросьте любое количество карт, затем возьмите столько же карт. Затем, если на вашем кладбище не менее семи карт, создайте одну фишку существа 3/2 красный и белый Дух.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство — Урок\', \'flavor\': \'«Посмотрите, какая тонкая работа по камню! Профессор, наши предположения о том, какими инструментами пользовались ранние каторрцы, могут быть неверны».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60038fc-9a53-456c-bd3f-1fcbc3f51b0e\', \'multiverseId\': 515913}, \'multiverseid\': 515913}, {\'name\': \'照亮历史\', \'text\': \'弃任意数量的牌，然后抓等量的牌。然后如果你的坟墓场中有七张或更多牌，则派出一个3/2，红白双色的精怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术 ～课程\', \'flavor\': \'「看看这石雕细部的精妙处理！教授，也许我们对于卡瑟朗族早期使用工具的假设有误。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8c4d5ba-46a4-4153-9d4a-fee9fc1bcfd0\', \'multiverseId\': 516204}, \'multiverseid\': 516204}, {\'name\': \'照亮歷史\', \'text\': \'棄任意數量的牌，然後抽等量的牌。然後如果你的墳墓場中有七張或更多牌，則派出一個3/2，紅白雙色的精靈衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術 ～課程\', \'flavor\': \'「看看這石雕細部的精妙處理！教授，也許我們對於卡瑟朗族早期使用工具的假設有誤。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c9b618-caec-4863-bedd-5c47ef42ba80\', \'multiverseId\': 516495}, \'multiverseid\': 516495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beleuchten der Geschichte\', \'text\': \'Wirf eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten. Falls dann sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind, erzeuge einen 3/2 roten und weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei — Lektion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f828c202-7f6d-490a-840d-392e08a87412\', \'multiverseId\': 516994}, \'multiverseid\': 516994}, {\'name\': \'Iluminar la historia\', \'text\': \'Descarta cualquier cantidad de cartas y luego roba esa misma cantidad de cartas. Luego, si hay siete o más cartas en tu cementerio, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu roja y blanca 3/2.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro — Lección\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55b94bf3-0c16-4457-898a-d0f900ecbb3e\', \'multiverseId\': 517089}, \'multiverseid\': 517089}, {\'name\': "Éclairer l\'histoire", \'text\': "Défaussez-vous de n\'importe quel nombre de cartes, puis piochez autant de cartes. Puis, s\'il y a au moins sept cartes dans votre cimetière, créez un jeton de créature 3/2 rouge et blanche Esprit.", \'type\': \'Rituel : leçon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517184&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ada8d9-a9cf-42dc-82c6-ed2f4b9de10c\', \'multiverseId\': 517184}, \'multiverseid\': 517184}, {\'name\': \'Illuminare la Storia\', \'text\': \'Scarta un qualsiasi numero di carte, poi pesca altrettante carte. Poi, se ci sono sette o più carte nel tuo cimitero, crea una pedina creatura Spirito 3/2 rossa e bianca.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria — Lezione\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcbfe49e-dcf7-408f-8194-9a4debcaecc4\', \'multiverseId\': 517279}, \'multiverseid\': 517279}, {\'name\': \'歴史解明学\', \'text\': \'望む枚数のカードを捨て、その後その枚数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、あなたの墓地に７枚以上のカードがあるなら、赤白の３/２のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー — 講義\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'334765b9-5ef3-4325-a5a1-d829abe6b228\', \'multiverseId\': 517374}, \'multiverseid\': 517374}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergender Phoenix\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nWenn der Bergende Phoenix ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, lerne eine Lektion. (Du kannst entweder eine Lektion-Karte von außerhalb der Partie, die du besitzt, offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen oder eine Karte abwerfen, um eine Karte zu ziehen.)\\nSolange sich der Bergende Phoenix in deinem Friedhof befindet und falls du eine Lektion lernen würdest, kannst du stattdessen den Bergenden Phoenix ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phoenix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513881&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'090e321b-4b72-4268-ab0f-cd87bebc079c\', \'multiverseId\': 513881}, \'multiverseid\': 513881}, {\'name\': \'Fénix recolector\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nCuando el Fénix recolector entre al campo de batalla, si lo lanzaste, aprende. (Puedes mostrar una carta de Lección de la cual eres propietario de fuera del juego y ponerla en tu mano o descartar una carta para robar una carta.)\\nMientras el Fénix recolector esté en tu cementerio, si fueras a aprender, en vez de eso, puedes regresar el Fénix recolector al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fa7a23e-c908-4be3-95a8-97f5db801274\', \'multiverseId\': 514172}, \'multiverseid\': 514172}, {\'name\': \'Phénix récupérateur\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nQuand le Phénix récupérateur arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, apprenez. (Vous pouvez révéler une carte de leçon que vous possédez en dehors de la partie et la mettre dans votre main, ou vous défausser d\'une carte pour piocher une carte.)\\nTant que le Phénix récupérateur est dans votre cimetière, si vous deviez apprendre, vous pouvez à la place renvoyer le Phénix récupérateur sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : phénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88c19c7f-c742-47f8-89c9-a13e61b6dd43\', \'multiverseId\': 514463}, \'multiverseid\': 514463}, {\'name\': \'Fenice da Riporto\', \'text\': "Volare, rapidità\\nQuando la Fenice da Riporto entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciata, apprendi. (Puoi rivelare una carta Lezione che possiedi al di fuori della partita e aggiungerla alla tua mano o scartare una carta per pescare una carta.)\\nFintanto che la Fenice da Riporto è nel tuo cimitero, se stai per apprendere, puoi invece rimettere sul campo di battaglia la Fenice da Riporto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Fenice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17751af5-b5a3-4e6a-bcf0-e119dd775d91\', \'multiverseId\': 514754}, \'multiverseid\': 514754}, {\'name\': \'回収するフェニックス\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n回収するフェニックスが戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、履修を行う。（あなたは、ゲームの外部からあなたがオーナーである講義・カード１枚を公開しあなたの手札に加えるか、カード１枚を捨てカード１枚を引くか、どちらかを行ってもよい。）\\n回収するフェニックスがあなたの墓地にあるかぎり、あなたが履修を行うなら、あなたは代わりに回収するフェニックスを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェニックス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfada0c6-02a6-49d8-a129-cbafcd4b537c\', \'multiverseId\': 515045}, \'multiverseid\': 515045}, {\'name\': \'회수자 불사조\', \'text\': \'비행, 신속\\n회수자 불사조가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 회수자 불사조를 발동했다면, 학습한다. (당신은 게임 밖에서 당신이 소유한 수업 카드 한 장을 공개하고 그 카드를 당신의 손에 넣거나, 카드 한 장을 버린 후 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다.)\\n회수자 불사조가 당신의 무덤에 있는 한, 당신이 학습하려 하면, 당신은 대신 회수자 불사조를 전장으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 불사조\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'416318ae-b627-4c9b-b801-7db765501189\', \'multiverseId\': 515336}, \'multiverseid\': 515336}, {\'name\': \'Fênix de Busca\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpeto\\nQuando Fênix de Busca entrar no campo de batalha, se você a conjurou, aprenda. (Você pode revelar um card de Lição seu de fora do jogo e colocá-lo em sua mão, ou descartar um card para comprar um card.)\\nEnquanto Fênix de Busca estiver em seu cemitério, se você for aprender, em vez disso, você pode devolver Fênix de Busca ao campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fênix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efb555f9-e558-47ce-b44f-6664f08ed70b\', \'multiverseId\': 515627}, \'multiverseid\': 515627}, {\'name\': \'Достающий Феникс\', \'text\': \'Полет, Ускорение\\nКогда Достающий Феникс выходит на поле битвы, если вы разыграли его, выучите урок. (Вы можете показать принадлежащую вам карту Урока вне игры и положить ее в вашу руку, или вы можете сбросить карту, чтобы взять карту.)\\nПока Достающий Феникс находится на вашем кладбище, если вы должны выучить урок, вместо этого вы можете вернуть Достающего Феникса на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Феникс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66151840-97e0-435e-9cb7-5cc2a94f2dca\', \'multiverseId\': 515918}, \'multiverseid\': 515918}, {\'name\': \'折返凤凰\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n当折返凤凰进战场时，若你施放之，则温习。（你可以从游戏外展示一张由你拥有的课程牌并置于你手上，或弃一张牌来抓一张牌。）\\n只要折返凤凰在你的坟墓场中，如果你将温习，你便可以改为将折返凤凰移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～凤凰\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a72f4239-8e87-4b9f-a78a-646782be1bf9\', \'multiverseId\': 516209}, \'multiverseid\': 516209}, {\'name\': \'折返鳳凰\', \'text\': \'飛行，敏捷\\n當折返鳳凰進戰場時，若你施放之，則溫習。（你可以從遊戲外展示一張由你擁有的課程牌並置於你手上，或棄一張牌來抽一張牌。）\\n只要折返鳳凰在你的墳墓場中，如果你將溫習，你便可以改為將折返鳳凰移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳳凰\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08f2c7a5-dd92-4db6-a4f7-cc1cf6d33aeb\', \'multiverseId\': 516500}, \'multiverseid\': 516500}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergender Phoenix\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nWenn der Bergende Phoenix ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, lerne eine Lektion.\\nSolange sich der Bergende Phoenix in deinem Friedhof befindet und falls du eine Lektion lernen würdest, kannst du stattdessen den Bergenden Phoenix ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phoenix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15f99fe7-d4a0-475e-afe2-f17cbf497c1b\', \'multiverseId\': 516995}, \'multiverseid\': 516995}, {\'name\': \'Fénix recolector\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nCuando el Fénix recolector entre al campo de batalla, si lo lanzaste, aprende.\\nMientras el Fénix recolector esté en tu cementerio, si fueras a aprender, en vez de eso, puedes regresar el Fénix recolector al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c64da48-b644-444b-b423-aa813c8a2cb2\', \'multiverseId\': 517090}, \'multiverseid\': 517090}, {\'name\': \'Phénix récupérateur\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nQuand le Phénix récupérateur arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, apprenez.\\nTant que le Phénix récupérateur est dans votre cimetière, si vous deviez apprendre, vous pouvez à la place renvoyer le Phénix récupérateur sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : phénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517185&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'895caf54-d8cc-4641-8a08-442b8167c7a0\', \'multiverseId\': 517185}, \'multiverseid\': 517185}, {\'name\': \'Fenice da Riporto\', \'text\': "Volare, rapidità\\nQuando la Fenice da Riporto entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciata, apprendi.\\nFintanto che la Fenice da Riporto è nel tuo cimitero, se stai per apprendere, puoi invece rimettere sul campo di battaglia la Fenice da Riporto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Fenice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdc9fb99-2290-4213-ad65-472ca6317e0f\', \'multiverseId\': 517280}, \'multiverseid\': 517280}, {\'name\': \'回収するフェニックス\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n回収するフェニックスが戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、履修を行う。\\n回収するフェニックスがあなたの墓地にあるかぎり、あなたが履修を行うなら、あなたは代わりに回収するフェニックスを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェニックス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dc47776-c7fa-4896-a1c3-3adde8ca004e\', \'multiverseId\': 517375}, \'multiverseid\': 517375}]', '[{\'name\': \'Biblioplex-Assistent\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Biblioplex-Assistent ins Spiel kommt, lege bis zu eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin dankbar für die Hilfe, und, um ehrlich zu sein, es ist sehr unterhaltsam."\\n—Isabough vom Biblioplex\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514034&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'770f1c20-95d6-4e6f-8958-3776deddd846\', \'multiverseId\': 514034}, \'multiverseid\': 514034}, {\'name\': \'Asistente de la Biblioplex\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Asistente de la Biblioplex entre al campo de batalla, pon hasta una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gárgola\', \'flavor\': \'"Agradezco tu ayuda y, a decir verdad, es de lo más entretenida".\\n—Ísabough de la Biblioplex\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2735f245-e739-475a-b7b7-dd0830fa91c4\', \'multiverseId\': 514325}, \'multiverseid\': 514325}, {\'name\': \'Assistant du Biblioplexe\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Assistant du Biblioplexe arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez jusqu\'à une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : gargouille\', \'flavor\': "« J\'apprécie le coup de main, et honnêtement, c\'est aussi très amusant. »\\n—Durameau du Biblioplexe", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514616&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f611728c-d7d8-470d-a25f-732e795b5b80\', \'multiverseId\': 514616}, \'multiverseid\': 514616}, {\'name\': \'Assistente del Biblioplex\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Assistente del Biblioplex entra nel campo di battaglia, metti fino a una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero in cima al tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'"Apprezzo il suo aiuto e, sinceramente, mi diverte molto."\\n—Isabough del Biblioplex\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87d55e66-6708-4b31-abe4-3e7fc3164cc1\', \'multiverseId\': 514907}, \'multiverseid\': 514907}, {\'name\': \'大図書棟の助手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n大図書棟の助手が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード最大１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ガーゴイル\', \'flavor\': \'「支援には感謝しています。それに、非常に楽しませてもらっています。」\\n――大図書棟のイサボウ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ff84bf9-0228-49bb-911d-e607fb0f4138\', \'multiverseId\': 515198}, \'multiverseid\': 515198}, {\'name\': \'비블리오플렉스 조수\', \'text\': \'비행\\n비블리오플렉스 조수가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드를 최대 한 장까지 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 가고일\', \'flavor\': \'"도와줘서 고맙고, 솔직히 말하면, 아주 재미있어."\\n—비블리오플렉스의 이사보우\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901bc891-6000-4cfe-9f0d-f67784d89211\', \'multiverseId\': 515489}, \'multiverseid\': 515489}, {\'name\': \'Assistente do Biblioplexo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Assistente do Biblioplexo entrar no campo de batalha, coloque até um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Gárgula\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu agradeço a ajuda e, honestamente, é bastante interessante."\\n— Eumramo do Biblioplexo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0d40933-4e6a-44fd-975c-14ac4af58ca1\', \'multiverseId\': 515780}, \'multiverseid\': 515780}, {\'name\': \'Помощник из Библиоплекса\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Помощник из Библиоплекса выходит на поле битвы, положите не более одной целевой карты мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища на верх вашей библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Горгулья\', \'flavor\': \'«Я ценю твою помощь, и, честно говоря, это очень забавно».\\n— Изабог из Библиоплекса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c46c20b-6896-4245-80c4-50672fbc8cf8\', \'multiverseId\': 516071}, \'multiverseid\': 516071}, {\'name\': \'茂典阁助手\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当茂典阁助手进战场时，将至多一张目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场置于你的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～石像鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「非常感谢你的帮忙，老实说，看着很有趣。」\\n～茂典阁的伊瑟伯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bff3a47f-df85-41ba-b6a3-898a838c3b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 516362}, \'multiverseid\': 516362}, {\'name\': \'茂典閣助手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當茂典閣助手進戰場時，將至多一張目標瞬間或巫術牌從你的墳墓場置於你的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～石像鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「非常感謝你的幫忙，老實說，看著很有趣。」\\n～茂典閣的伊瑟伯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2db7682-edeb-49a6-b528-4b7f19a1b0ea\', \'multiverseId\': 516653}, \'multiverseid\': 516653}]', '[{\'name\': \'Biomathematiker\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Biomathematiker ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege auf jedes Fraktalwesen, das du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde die Unendlichkeit erreichen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7805609e-d187-41a4-b37c-5de9e639a44c\', \'multiverseId\': 513947}, \'multiverseid\': 513947}, {\'name\': \'Biomatemático\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Biomatemático entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada Fractal que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Llegaré al infinito".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98fee99b-23fe-4c33-8178-73e09831d628\', \'multiverseId\': 514238}, \'multiverseid\': 514238}, {\'name\': \'Biomathématicien\', \'text\': \'Quand le Biomathématicien arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque fractale que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'atteindrai l\'infini. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514529&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbc785d8-9d66-4857-a345-ee81e700ecc1\', \'multiverseId\': 514529}, \'multiverseid\': 514529}, {\'name\': \'Biomatematico\', \'text\': \'Quando il Biomatematico entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni Frattale che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Raggiungerò l\\\'infinità."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6165c1e9-2673-4366-99fb-e85b006a19a1\', \'multiverseId\': 514820}, \'multiverseid\': 514820}, {\'name\': \'生物数学者\', \'text\': \'生物数学者が戦場に出たとき、緑青の０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。あなたがコントロールしている各フラクタルの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「私は無限に達してみせる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da4007b7-967e-4296-a867-a53e4ceb1da5\', \'multiverseId\': 515111}, \'multiverseid\': 515111}, {\'name\': \'생명수학자\', \'text\': \'생명수학자가 전장에 들어올 때, 0/0 녹색 및 청색 프랙탈 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 당신이 조종하는 각 프랙탈에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"난 무한에 도달하고 말겠어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3de3c73-7321-4714-87d9-562979f9742f\', \'multiverseId\': 515402}, \'multiverseid\': 515402}, {\'name\': \'Biomatemático\', \'text\': \'Quando Biomatemático entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Fractal verde e azul 0/0. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada Fractal que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcançarei o infinito."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97ce04f1-7b3c-42dc-9db3-536e2fb3c458\', \'multiverseId\': 515693}, \'multiverseid\': 515693}, {\'name\': \'Биоматематик\', \'text\': \'Когда Биоматематик выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 зеленый и синий Фрактал. Положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждый Фрактал под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Я достигну бесконечности».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ac0a7e8-f812-4424-9410-d6528f9ad695\', \'multiverseId\': 515984}, \'multiverseid\': 515984}, {\'name\': \'生机数学家\', \'text\': \'当生机数学家进战场时，派出一个0/0，绿蓝双色的分灵衍生生物。在每个由你操控的分灵上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我将达到无穷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9020c7a-22e5-4a08-882e-c68624447310\', \'multiverseId\': 516275}, \'multiverseid\': 516275}, {\'name\': \'生機數學家\', \'text\': \'當生機數學家進戰場時，派出一個0/0，綠藍雙色的分靈衍生生物。在每個由你操控的分靈上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「我將達到無窮。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46dbc924-e59a-4e46-b780-c23f3f2997cb\', \'multiverseId\': 516566}, \'multiverseid\': 516566}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutforscherin\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Blutforscherin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Dekan Valentin warnt uns aus Sicherheitsgründen davor, die Proben zu verzehren, aber ich glaube, er will sie nur für sich behalten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513949&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b58fbcd7-2e1a-48c8-be79-ba628422275f\', \'multiverseId\': 513949}, \'multiverseid\': 513949}, {\'name\': \'Investigadora de sangre\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\\nSiempre que ganes vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Investigadora de sangre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"El decano Valentin nos advirtió de que no consumiéramos las muestras por nuestra propia seguridad, pero yo creo que lo hace por avaricia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'017645e6-925c-4678-a2c6-b114cf4cc525\', \'multiverseId\': 514240}, \'multiverseid\': 514240}, {\'name\': \'Chercheuse en sang\', \'text\': \'Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Chercheuse en sang.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Le doyen Valentin nous ordonne de ne pas consommer les échantillons pour notre sécurité, mais je crois qu\'il veut simplement tout garder pour lui. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514531&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb750405-689d-45e0-8cb6-8a6153d9225e\', \'multiverseId\': 514531}, \'multiverseid\': 514531}, {\'name\': \'Ricercatrice del Sangue\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\\nOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Ricercatrice del Sangue.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Il decano Valentin dice di non consumare i campioni per la nostra sicurezza, ma secondo me è solo ingordo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7835823-0857-4caa-b6ca-4181869f0ccc\', \'multiverseId\': 514822}, \'multiverseid\': 514822}, {\'name\': \'血の研究者\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。）\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、血の研究者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「ヴァレンティン学部長は、危険だからサンプルは摂取するなと言ったけど、あの人が欲張っているだけじゃないかしら。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b3eefe7-79f1-405b-85b9-bdc1add6c659\', \'multiverseId\': 515113}, \'multiverseid\': 515113}, {\'name\': \'피 연구자\', \'text\': \'호전적 (이 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)\\n당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 피 연구자에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"발렌틴 학장님은 안전을 위해 표본을 먹지 말라고 경고하시지만, 나는 그분이 그냥 욕심을 부리는 거라고 생각해."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f50e29eb-9e8f-4d40-8825-7268eeadeb2e\', \'multiverseId\': 515404}, \'multiverseid\': 515404}, {\'name\': \'Pesquisadora do Sangue\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)\\nToda vez que você ganhar pontos de vida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Pesquisadora do Sangue.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"O decano Valentin disse para não consumir as amostras para nossa própria segurança. Mas acho que ele estava apenas sendo ganancioso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'156f2679-7fa9-4f4a-b685-0dd813fd3573\', \'multiverseId\': 515695}, \'multiverseid\': 515695}, {\'name\': \'Исследовательница Крови\', \'text\': \'Угроза (Это существо не может быть заблокировано менее чем двумя существами.)\\nКаждый раз, когда вы получаете жизнь(-и), положите один жетон +1/+1 на Исследовательницу Крови.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Декан Валентин велел нам не пробовать образцы. Говорит, что для нашей безопасности, но я думаю, что он просто жадничает».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a628818e-6b21-486e-a5ac-4fa846d79dd3\', \'multiverseId\': 515986}, \'multiverseid\': 515986}, {\'name\': \'鲜血研究员\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\\n每当你获得生命时，在鲜血研究员上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「瓦伦丁院长告诫我们说，为了自身安全着想，请勿吞服样品。但我觉得他就是太贪心。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1852625-078e-40c0-b140-ba2165c60461\', \'multiverseId\': 516277}, \'multiverseid\': 516277}, {\'name\': \'鮮血研究員\', \'text\': \'威懾（此生物只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。）\\n每當你獲得生命時，在鮮血研究員上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「瓦倫丁院長告誡我們說，為了自身安全著想，請勿吞服樣品。但我覺得他就是太貪心。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cc3bea2-e751-4234-8341-d6afefe9567d\', \'multiverseId\': 516568}, \'multiverseid\': 516568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutzeitalter-General\', \'text\': \'{T}: Angreifende Geister erhalten +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Schon vor Jahrhunderten nahmen seine Truppen die Festung von Caerdoon ein, und dennoch kämpft er weiter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513861&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d776a8d-d897-41c1-9126-fe5ad72568c1\', \'multiverseId\': 513861}, \'multiverseid\': 513861}, {\'name\': \'General de la Edad de Sangre\', \'text\': \'{T}: Los Espíritus atacantes obtienen +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Sus tropas se hicieron con la fortaleza de Caerdoon hace siglos, mas él continúa luchando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ca5290-753a-4de9-b64e-4231e99f09c8\', \'multiverseId\': 514152}, \'multiverseid\': 514152}, {\'name\': "Général de l\'Ère sanglante", \'text\': "{T} : Les esprits attaquants gagnent +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Ses troupes ont pris d\'assaut la Forteresse de Caerdoon il y a des siècles, mais il continue le combat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'722fd8ee-0eda-4b1c-a825-f52408e5dc95\', \'multiverseId\': 514443}, \'multiverseid\': 514443}, {\'name\': "Generale dell\'Era del Sangue", \'text\': \'{T}: Gli Spiriti attaccanti prendono +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Le sue truppe conquistarono la Fortezza di Caerdoon secoli fa, eppure non ha ancora smesso di combattere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b93d7f-00fb-4512-a792-c7aedc34db43\', \'multiverseId\': 514734}, \'multiverseid\': 514734}, {\'name\': \'血の時代の将軍\', \'text\': \'{T}：ターン終了時まで、攻撃しているすべてのスピリットは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'将軍の兵団がセイアドゥーンの砦を奪取したのは数百年前だが、彼は今でも戦っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a1747e-f399-4883-aa78-00b420f5d472\', \'multiverseId\': 515025}, \'multiverseid\': 515025}, {\'name\': \'피의 시대 장군\', \'text\': \'{T}: 공격 중인 신령들은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령 전사\', \'flavor\': \'그의 군대는 수 세기 전에 카에르둔의 요새를 점령했지만, 그는 여전히 싸워나간다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f06461b-a369-4b05-bb45-ba5dc915b592\', \'multiverseId\': 515316}, \'multiverseid\': 515316}, {\'name\': \'General da Idade do Sangue\', \'text\': \'{T}: Os Espíritos atacantes recebem +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Suas tropas conquistaram a Fortaleza de Caerdoon séculos atrás, mas ainda assim ele continua lutando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'451ae85d-338d-48e5-9bc7-c0fa8e74503e\', \'multiverseId\': 515607}, \'multiverseid\': 515607}, {\'name\': \'Генерал Кровавого Века\', \'text\': \'{T}: атакующие Духи получают +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Его войска захватили крепость Сейрдун много веков назад, но он до сих пор сражается.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'175d9a46-e3ef-4d30-9da1-b320ab77600e\', \'multiverseId\': 515898}, \'multiverseid\': 515898}, {\'name\': \'血腥时代将军\', \'text\': \'{T}：进行攻击的精怪得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'虽然他手下部队数百年前就已攻占瑟盾要塞，但他仍在沙场征战。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68d3fc10-9f19-43bb-a451-eca1f7c5e668\', \'multiverseId\': 516189}, \'multiverseid\': 516189}, {\'name\': \'血腥時代將軍\', \'text\': \'{T}：進行攻擊的精靈得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精靈／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'雖然他手下部隊數百年前就已攻佔瑟盾要塞，但他仍在沙場征戰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d547001d-4fcc-489b-8f56-237ddcc66d70\', \'multiverseId\': 516480}, \'multiverseid\': 516480}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blütenwelk-Befehl\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt drei Karten. Bringe dann eine Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n• Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 2 oder weniger, die weder eine Kreatur noch ein Land ist.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -3/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Ein Gegner deiner Wahl verliert 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514031&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3027cbce-4343-45c6-bd84-a742799f192b\', \'multiverseId\': 514031}, \'multiverseid\': 514031}, {\'name\': \'Dictado de Flosmarcitus\', \'text\': \'Elige dos:\\n• El jugador objetivo muele tres cartas, luego regresas una carta de tierra de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n• Destruye el permanente objetivo que no sea criatura ni tierra con valor de maná de 2 o menos.\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-1 hasta el final del turno.\\n• El oponente objetivo pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5716603-8f75-415c-af7c-72fba540544d\', \'multiverseId\': 514322}, \'multiverseid\': 514322}, {\'name\': \'Commandement de Flestrefleur\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Un joueur ciblé meule trois cartes, puis vous renvoyez une carte de terrain depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\n• Détruisez un permanent non-créature non-terrain ciblé ayant une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 2.\\n• Une créature ciblée gagne -3/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Un adversaire ciblé perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514613&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dfcf90c-1a16-47d0-8016-a32b6a93dc41\', \'multiverseId\': 514613}, \'multiverseid\': 514613}, {\'name\': \'Comando di Germoglioscuro\', \'text\': \'Scegli due —\\n• Un giocatore bersaglio macina tre carte, poi riprendi in mano una carta terra dal tuo cimitero.\\n• Distruggi un permanente non creatura, non terra bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 2.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Un avversario bersaglio perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63d829fe-49fc-42cc-8343-9606fad83a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 514904}, \'multiverseid\': 514904}, {\'name\': \'ウィザーブルームの命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード３枚を切削する。その後、あなたはあなたの墓地から土地・カード１枚をあなたの手札に戻す。\\n• マナ総量が２以下でクリーチャーでも土地でもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－３/－１の修整を受ける。\\n• 対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2e0efe6-bd86-43b5-96ab-201cc8a54475\', \'multiverseId\': 515195}, \'multiverseid\': 515195}, {\'name\': \'위더블룸 명령\', \'text\': \'둘을 선택한다 —\\n• 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어가 카드 세 장을 민 후, 당신은 당신의 무덤에서 대지 카드 한 장을 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\\n• 마나 값이 2 이하이며 생물이 아니고 대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 파괴한다.\\n• 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -3/-1을 받는다.\\n• 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 생명 2점을 잃고 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b1f62f5-bebe-4237-913f-620890d862da\', \'multiverseId\': 515486}, \'multiverseid\': 515486}, {\'name\': \'Comando de Murchaflor\', \'text\': \'Escolha dois —\\n• O jogador alvo tritura três cards. Em seguida, você devolve um card de terreno de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\n• Destrua a permanente alvo não de criatura e não de terreno com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 2.\\n• A criatura alvo recebe -3/-1 até o final do turno.\\n• O oponente alvo perde 2 pontos de vida e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b52c5830-7759-4e44-ba1c-d0cccf30b9ad\', \'multiverseId\': 515777}, \'multiverseid\': 515777}, {\'name\': \'Команда Визерблума\', \'text\': \'Выберите два —\\n• Целевой игрок скручивает три карты, затем вы возвращаете карту земли из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\n• Уничтожьте целевой не являющаяся существом или землей перманент с мановой ценностью не более 2.\\n• Целевое существо получает -3/-1 до конца хода.\\n• Целевой оппонент теряет 2 жизни, а вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01762d77-2c7b-43d2-a814-c5688f951327\', \'multiverseId\': 516068}, \'multiverseid\': 516068}, {\'name\': \'靡华指命\', \'text\': \'选择两项～\\n•目标牌手磨三张牌，然后你将一张地牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n•消灭目标非生物且非地的永久物，且其法术力值须等于或小于2。\\n•目标生物得-3/-1直到回合结束。\\n•目标对手失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd337092-de43-4bf9-ab71-0341241d4edc\', \'multiverseId\': 516359}, \'multiverseid\': 516359}, {\'name\': \'靡華指命\', \'text\': \'選擇兩項～\\n•目標玩家磨三張牌，然後你將一張地牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\\n•消滅目標非生物且非地的永久物，且其魔法力值須等於或小於2。\\n•目標生物得-3/-1直到回合結束。\\n•目標對手失去2點生命且你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e379ba8-9fff-4029-8d71-68dd873a1992\', \'multiverseId\': 516650}, \'multiverseid\': 516650}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blütenwelk-Befehl\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt drei Karten. Bringe dann eine Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n• Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 2 oder weniger, die weder eine Kreatur noch ein Land ist.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -3/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Ein Gegner deiner Wahl verliert 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517051&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e48727f-3b38-4b23-8adc-bc3bf747be43\', \'multiverseId\': 517051}, \'multiverseid\': 517051}, {\'name\': \'Dictado de Flosmarcitus\', \'text\': \'Elige dos:\\n• El jugador objetivo muele tres cartas, luego regresas una carta de tierra de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n• Destruye el permanente objetivo que no sea criatura ni tierra con valor de maná de 2 o menos.\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-1 hasta el final del turno.\\n• El oponente objetivo pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1ca8d77-d0ef-428a-abd8-4431b22537a8\', \'multiverseId\': 517146}, \'multiverseid\': 517146}, {\'name\': \'Commandement de Flestrefleur\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Un joueur ciblé meule trois cartes, puis vous renvoyez une carte de terrain depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\n• Détruisez un permanent non-créature non-terrain ciblé ayant une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 2.\\n• Une créature ciblée gagne -3/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Un adversaire ciblé perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517241&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba12ca67-1ec0-40dc-b0e5-b3e89ab1580f\', \'multiverseId\': 517241}, \'multiverseid\': 517241}, {\'name\': \'Comando di Germoglioscuro\', \'text\': \'Scegli due —\\n• Un giocatore bersaglio macina tre carte, poi riprendi in mano una carta terra dal tuo cimitero.\\n• Distruggi un permanente non creatura, non terra bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 2.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Un avversario bersaglio perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'968fcb36-2d85-4dc8-94ed-ac623cc32b83\', \'multiverseId\': 517336}, \'multiverseid\': 517336}, {\'name\': \'ウィザーブルームの命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード３枚を切削する。その後、あなたはあなたの墓地から土地・カード１枚をあなたの手札に戻す。\\n• マナ総量が２以下でクリーチャーでも土地でもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－３/－１の修整を受ける。\\n• 対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f34db9bc-5f47-46d7-a041-501331355a38\', \'multiverseId\': 517431}, \'multiverseid\': 517431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blütenwelk-Campus\', \'text\': \'Der Blütenwelk-Campus kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.\\n{4}, {T}: Hellsicht 1.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Magiestudenten, die von den Energien von Leben und Tod fasziniert sind, wählen Blütenwelk, die Fakultät der Essenzstudien.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514058&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4516e41-fd00-4479-831c-a3de3bbeb253\', \'multiverseId\': 514058}, \'multiverseid\': 514058}, {\'name\': \'Campus de Flosmarcitus\', \'text\': \'El Campus de Flosmarcitus entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.\\n{4}, {T}: Adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los estudiantes de magia asombrados por la energía de la vida y la muerte eligen Flosmarcitus, la facultad de estudios de la esencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdac3ada-6555-4192-9523-72d11e3517f6\', \'multiverseId\': 514349}, \'multiverseid\': 514349}, {\'name\': \'Campus de Flestrefleur\', \'text\': \'Le Campus de Flestrefleur arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.\\n{4}, {T} : Regard 1.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les mages-étudiants fascinés par les énergies de la vie et de la mort choisissent Flestrefleur, l\'université des études d\'essence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514640&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b674683-08c1-4ae2-b93d-6e6fe114571a\', \'multiverseId\': 514640}, \'multiverseid\': 514640}, {\'name\': \'Campus di Germoglioscuro\', \'text\': \'Il Campus di Germoglioscuro entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.\\n{4}, {T}: Profetizza 1.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Gli studenti-maghi affascinati dalle energie della vita e della morte scelgono Germoglioscuro, l\'accademia di studi dell\'essenza.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21d04f7e-b686-40d4-ac47-3d475c74d3b9\', \'multiverseId\': 514931}, \'multiverseid\': 514931}, {\'name\': \'ウィザーブルームの学舎\', \'text\': \'ウィザーブルームの学舎はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'生と死のエネルギーに魅入られた魔道生徒は本質学の大学ウィザーブルームを選ぶ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1139c436-8fa2-44d9-9c1f-32e0c8605780\', \'multiverseId\': 515222}, \'multiverseid\': 515222}, {\'name\': \'위더블룸 캠퍼스\', \'text\': \'위더블룸 캠퍼스는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {B} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.\\n{4}, {T}: 점술 1을 한다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'삶과 죽음의 에너지에 매력을 느끼는 마도사 학생들은 정수 연구의 대학인 위더블룸을 선택한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c56527c1-2202-4a66-9fdf-cfe936df4f2c\', \'multiverseId\': 515513}, \'multiverseid\': 515513}, {\'name\': \'Campus de Murchaflor\', \'text\': \'Campus de Murchaflor entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.\\n{4}, {T}: Use vidência 1.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os alunos-magos fascinados pelas energias da vida e da morte escolhem Murchaflor, a faculdade dos estudos da essência.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9df860f9-5396-41a1-9aee-c3968fb9b301\', \'multiverseId\': 515804}, \'multiverseid\': 515804}, {\'name\': \'Кампус Визерблума\', \'text\': \'Кампус Визерблума выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {G}.\\n{4}, {T}: предскажите 1.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Студенты магии, очарованные энергией жизни и смерти, выбирают Визерблум, факультет сущностноведения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c01eb4e-dc99-4410-aeed-04652c68d3bd\', \'multiverseId\': 516095}, \'multiverseid\': 516095}, {\'name\': \'靡华校区\', \'text\': \'靡华校区须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。\\n{4}，{T}：占卜1。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'痴狂生死的修习法师，会选读知命学院靡华，深耕菁华之能。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'460be2ee-fb3f-49f8-8de9-f1fcf56ea730\', \'multiverseId\': 516386}, \'multiverseid\': 516386}, {\'name\': \'靡華校區\', \'text\': \'靡華校區須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。\\n{4}，{T}：占卜1。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'癡狂生死的修習法師，會選讀知命學院靡華，深耕菁華之能。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2ff60fa-8f5f-4ed2-910d-1a4095b825e2\', \'multiverseId\': 516677}, \'multiverseid\': 516677}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blütenwelk-Schwurmagier\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Tod ist im Grunde einfach nur eine Energieübertragung. Diesen Schädlingen, die ich geerntet habe, wird die Ehre zuteil, zu reiner Magie zu werden. Was könnte schöner sein?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514032&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'119d7f7c-3ce6-45cd-b19e-e20f84105e54\', \'multiverseId\': 514032}, \'multiverseid\': 514032}, {\'name\': \'Magopromesa de Flosmarcitus\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': \'"La muerte no es más que una transferencia de energía. Las plagas que coseché tienen el honor de convertirse en pura magia. ¿Acaso existe algo más bello?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a5d3081-cd7f-48a7-87c0-ce84cf198e0b\', \'multiverseId\': 514323}, \'multiverseid\': 514323}, {\'name\': \'Juremage de Flestrefleur\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel,vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : sylvin et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': "« La mort n\'est qu\'un simple transfert d\'énergie. Ces nuisibles que j\'ai récoltés ont l\'honneur de devenir de la magie pure. Qu\'y a-t-il de plus beau ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514614&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05a2e263-7435-4219-a74f-5b9c8c76c434\', \'multiverseId\': 514614}, \'multiverseid\': 514614}, {\'name\': \'Mago Iniziato di Germoglioscuro\', \'text\': \'Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': \'"La morte non è che un trasferimento di energia. Le pesti che ho raccolto hanno l\\\'onore di diventare pura magia. Cosa c\\\'è di più bello?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a920da54-7786-4eee-94d7-0dba9e0568a6\', \'multiverseId\': 514905}, \'multiverseid\': 514905}, {\'name\': \'ウィザーブルームの誓約魔道士\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「死とは、実際にはエネルギーの移転に過ぎない。私が捕獲した害獣は純粋な魔法になるという名誉にあずかる。これ以上に美しいことがあるだろうか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b942b681-1bd1-4a3e-b9eb-d2617842bfee\', \'multiverseId\': 515196}, \'multiverseid\': 515196}, {\'name\': \'위더블룸 서약마도사\', \'text\': \'마도제작술 — 당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동하거나 복사할 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인목 흑마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"죽음은 그저 에너지를 전달하는 것일 뿐이야. 내가 수확한 그 해충들은 순수한 마법이 되는 영광을 누리는 거지. 뭐가 그것보다 더 아름다울 수 있겠어?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d652095a-83ce-456e-82f5-810a7c2ffb17\', \'multiverseId\': 515487}, \'multiverseid\': 515487}, {\'name\': \'Mago Iniciado de Murchaflor\', \'text\': \'Magifício — Toda vez que você conjura ou copia uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ent Bruxo\', \'flavor\': \'"A morte é na verdade apenas uma transferência de energia. Aquelas pestes que eu colhi têm a honra de se tornar magia pura. O que poderia ser mais belo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e019195f-5f1c-4ed8-81f8-731bfd749ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 515778}, \'multiverseid\': 515778}, {\'name\': \'Маг Клятвы с Визерблума\', \'text\': \'Чародейство — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете или копируете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Лесовик Колдун\', \'flavor\': \'«Смерть — это всего лишь переход энергии. Вредителям, которых я собрал, выпала честь стать чистой магией. Что может быть прекраснее?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9dcf0b7-a1c7-480d-93a2-19982f64b049\', \'multiverseId\': 516069}, \'multiverseid\': 516069}, {\'name\': \'靡华证法师\', \'text\': \'魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～树妖／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'「死亡不过是能量转移。我捉到的这些害虫有幸能够转变成纯粹魔法。还有比这更美丽的东西吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26c655b2-7f83-449d-8f3d-d9e71af15d27\', \'multiverseId\': 516360}, \'multiverseid\': 516360}, {\'name\': \'靡華證法師\', \'text\': \'魔藝～每當你施放或複製瞬間或巫術咒語時，你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～樹妖／邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「死亡不過是能量轉移。我捉到的這些害蟲有幸能夠轉變成純粹魔法。還有比這更美麗的東西嗎？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'058f71e5-5595-4bf6-9953-80a4c9f57f28\', \'multiverseId\': 516651}, \'multiverseid\': 516651}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blütenwelk-Zauberlehrling\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Alle, was wir sind, jedes Gefühl, jede Handlung, wird von einem einzigen, filigranen kleinen Organ bestimmt. Das Leben ist so furchterregend wunderbar zerbrechlich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514030&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbfb32a1-23a2-483e-aef8-09c8eab31d47\', \'multiverseId\': 514030}, \'multiverseid\': 514030}, {\'name\': \'Aprendiz de Flosmarcitus\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Todo lo que somos —cada sentimiento, cada acción— está alimentado por un único y delicado órgano. Cuán espantosa y bella es la fragilidad de la vida".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0060c46-d62a-407b-a856-ab8c26cd30e4\', \'multiverseId\': 514321}, \'multiverseid\': 514321}, {\'name\': \'Apprenti de Flestrefleur\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Tout ce que nous sommes — chaque sentiment, chaque action — à la merci d\'un seul petit organe délicat. La vie est si magnifiquement et terriblement fragile. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514612&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77076be8-5cff-49a5-8685-e6ff2bbae673\', \'multiverseId\': 514612}, \'multiverseid\': 514612}, {\'name\': \'Apprendista di Germoglioscuro\', \'text\': \'Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutto ciò che siamo, ogni sensazione, ogni azione, dipende da un unico organo delicato. La vita è così terribilmente, magnificamente fragile."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c407bb81-4bb2-4aec-91d5-3dab76426d9a\', \'multiverseId\': 514903}, \'multiverseid\': 514903}, {\'name\': \'ウィザーブルームの初学者\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は誰でも、すべての感覚も一切の動作も、たったひとつの小さく繊細な臓器から力を得ている。生命はなんと壊れやすいことか。恐ろしくまた美しい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfd32d55-29dd-4c9c-9976-052bf5556d84\', \'multiverseId\': 515194}, \'multiverseid\': 515194}, {\'name\': \'위더블룸 견습생\', \'text\': \'마도제작술 — 당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동하거나 복사할 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"우리 모두는—모든 감정, 모든 행동은—섬세하고 작은 장기 한 개를 통해 움직여. 인생은 너무나 무섭고도 아름답게 연약하지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28368d39-1538-4032-b5ac-cdb69c301741\', \'multiverseId\': 515485}, \'multiverseid\': 515485}, {\'name\': \'Aprendiz de Murchaflor\', \'text\': \'Magifício — Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Tudo que somos, cada sentimento, cada ação, é impulsionado por um único, pequeno e delicado órgão. A vida é tão bela e terrivelmente frágil."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'722b59d6-aaa6-4664-acd5-4abd9bf467f1\', \'multiverseId\': 515776}, \'multiverseid\': 515776}, {\'name\': \'Ученик с Визерблума\', \'text\': \'Чародейство — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете или копируете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Все, чем мы являемся, — каждое чувство, каждое действие, — все это управляется лишь одним нежным маленьким органом. Жизнь настолько ужасающе и чудесно хрупкая».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6861ed2-f748-41c4-93dd-42155ee782ee\', \'multiverseId\': 516067}, \'multiverseid\': 516067}, {\'name\': \'靡华学徒\', \'text\': \'魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，每位对手各失去1点生命，且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的一切～包括感情、动作～都源自这么一个小小的器官。生命这东西虽纤弱得可怕，但也纤弱得美丽。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f70a0160-32e9-40f7-bf94-f8087195f1be\', \'multiverseId\': 516358}, \'multiverseid\': 516358}, {\'name\': \'靡華學徒\', \'text\': \'魔藝～每當你施放或複製瞬間或巫術咒語時，每位對手各失去1點生命，且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「我們的一切～包括感情、動作～都源自這麼一個小小的器官。生命這東西雖纖弱得可怕，但也纖弱得美麗。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43af0340-59da-4982-92a2-cad90951c1a9\', \'multiverseId\': 516649}, \'multiverseid\': 516649}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogengang-Allmende\', \'text\': \'Die Bogengang-Allmende kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Bogengang-Allmende ins Spiel kommt, opfere sie, es sei denn, du bezahlst {1}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514046&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7e53080-bfdd-4a0e-b67f-7f9cbb1d1837\', \'multiverseId\': 514046}, \'multiverseid\': 514046}, {\'name\': \'Plaza del arco\', \'text\': \'La Plaza del arco entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Plaza del arco entre al campo de batalla, sacrifícala a menos que pagues {1}.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'513c6755-5ca1-402f-9603-f1212271e547\', \'multiverseId\': 514337}, \'multiverseid\': 514337}, {\'name\': "Place de l\'arche", \'text\': "La Place de l\'arche arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Place de l\'arche arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez-la à moins que vous ne payiez {1}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514628&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4dbaccd-0e8d-403f-b81b-28db21f2d524\', \'multiverseId\': 514628}, \'multiverseid\': 514628}, {\'name\': "Giardino dell\'Arcata", \'text\': "Il Giardino dell\'Arcata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Giardino dell\'Arcata entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrificalo a meno che non paghi {1}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcdb4fe0-0a7e-4c67-afc7-621152bdac66\', \'multiverseId\': 514919}, \'multiverseid\': 514919}, {\'name\': \'アーチ道の公共地\', \'text\': \'アーチ道の公共地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nアーチ道の公共地が戦場に出たとき、あなたが{1}を支払わないかぎり、これを生け贄に捧げる。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a91bcb-7fc2-484b-8976-d7ad32c6edb7\', \'multiverseId\': 515210}, \'multiverseid\': 515210}, {\'name\': \'아치길 공동구역\', \'text\': \'아치길 공동구역은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n아치길 공동구역이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 {1}을 지불하지 않으면 아치길 공동구역을 희생한다.\\n{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077c499f-78a5-4ed6-b200-43d8a095c18f\', \'multiverseId\': 515501}, \'multiverseid\': 515501}, {\'name\': \'Esplanada do Arco\', \'text\': \'Esplanada do Arco entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Esplanada do Arco entrar no campo de batalha, sacrifique-a, a menos que você pague {1}.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da231564-4e06-4951-b1fa-25be23c347df\', \'multiverseId\': 515792}, \'multiverseid\': 515792}, {\'name\': \'Арочная Площадь\', \'text\': \'Арочная Площадь выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Арочная Площадь выходит на поле битвы, пожертвуйте ее, если только вы не заплатите {1}.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e70e9b0a-c0a5-44aa-8b8f-4a0538775f41\', \'multiverseId\': 516083}, \'multiverseid\': 516083}, {\'name\': \'拱顶公地\', \'text\': \'拱顶公地须横置进战场。\\n当拱顶公地进战场时，除非你支付{1}，否则牺牲之。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe9a6ee7-6f1e-4128-814c-ca9a36354c1f\', \'multiverseId\': 516374}, \'multiverseid\': 516374}, {\'name\': \'拱頂公地\', \'text\': \'拱頂公地須橫置進戰場。\\n當拱頂公地進戰場時，除非你支付{1}，否則犧牲之。\\n{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'270240a9-78f1-4c27-9169-15ae988d3182\', \'multiverseId\': 516665}, \'multiverseid\': 516665}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boshafte Bande\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nDie Boshafte Bande kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Boshafte Bande stirbt, lege ihre Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'„Weißt du nicht, dass Studienanfänger Wegezoll zahlen müssen, um hier durchgehen zu dürfen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce5d114-7bfe-4a91-880d-12aff3ee81cb\', \'multiverseId\': 514020}, \'multiverseid\': 514020}, {\'name\': \'Pandilla rencorosa\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nLa Pandilla rencorosa entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nCuando la Pandilla rencorosa muera, pon sus contadores sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Acaso no sabes que los novatos tienen que pagar para pasar por aquí?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'205de76c-5ee1-4276-b18f-116ec44025d4\', \'multiverseId\': 514311}, \'multiverseid\': 514311}, {\'name\': \'Escouade malveillante\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nL\'Escouade malveillante arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nQuand l\'Escouade malveillante meurt, mettez ses marqueurs sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': "« Tu ne sais pas que les étudiants de première année doivent s\'acquitter d\'une dîme pour passer par ici ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514602&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2aa5c37-1d2a-4ef0-9b0a-af1dd5234940\', \'multiverseId\': 514602}, \'multiverseid\': 514602}, {\'name\': \'Banda Astiosa\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nLa Banda Astiosa entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\\nQuando la Banda Astiosa muore, metti i suoi segnalini su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non sapevi che le matricole pagano un pedaggio per passare da qui?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7256e4c4-ea93-43c9-99b0-5f04deb705ff\', \'multiverseId\': 514893}, \'multiverseid\': 514893}, {\'name\': \'悪意に満ちた部隊\', \'text\': \'接死\\n悪意に満ちた部隊は、＋１/＋１カウンター２個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n悪意に満ちた部隊が死亡したとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これの上にあるすべてのカウンターをそれの上に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「知らないの？ 一年生はここを通るのに代金がいるのよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66ae71ab-c64a-442e-bf2c-36aae79951f5\', \'multiverseId\': 515184}, \'multiverseid\': 515184}, {\'name\': \'악의적인 무리\', \'text\': \'치명타\\n악의적인 무리는 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\\n악의적인 무리가 죽을 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 악의적인 무리가 가진 카운터들을 그 생물에 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 흑마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"신입생들이 이곳을 지나가려면 통행료를 내야 한다는 걸 몰랐어?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a07eb498-7b0e-4661-83a3-0de0063d59a5\', \'multiverseId\': 515475}, \'multiverseid\': 515475}, {\'name\': \'Esquadrão Malévolo\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nEsquadrão Malévolo entra no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1.\\nQuando Esquadrão Malévolo morrer, coloque seus marcadores na criatura alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Bruxo\', \'flavor\': \'"Você não sabia que os calouros pagam um pedágio para andar por aqui?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'658f847c-a78e-485b-accb-592fdc9fb68a\', \'multiverseId\': 515766}, \'multiverseid\': 515766}, {\'name\': \'Зловредный Отряд\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nЗловредный Отряд выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.\\nКогда Зловредный Отряд умирает, положите жетоны с него на целевое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Колдун\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты что, не знаешь, что первокурсникам за то, чтобы здесь пройти, полагается платить?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'075a5e6a-62eb-470e-ab35-822ebef6b25c\', \'multiverseId\': 516057}, \'multiverseid\': 516057}, {\'name\': \'怨毒小队\', \'text\': \'死触\\n怨毒小队进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\\n当怨毒小队死去时，将它的指示物放置在目标由你操控的生物上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'「你不知道一年级新生走这条路要付钱吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d5b899-6392-4438-ba2e-8dddb122dffa\', \'multiverseId\': 516348}, \'multiverseid\': 516348}, {\'name\': \'怨毒小隊\', \'text\': \'死觸\\n怨毒小隊進戰場時上面有兩個+1/+1指示物。\\n當怨毒小隊死去時，將它的指示物放置在目標由你操控的生物上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「你不知道一年級新生走這條路要付錢嗎？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e905a67-f655-4788-a236-205d6a46ff7b\', \'multiverseId\': 516639}, \'multiverseid\': 516639}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brackwasser-Stampfer\', \'text\': \'Der Brackwasser-Stampfer kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{1}{B}: Bringe den Brackwasser-Stampfer aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Die meisten Stampfer sind mit verrottendem Pflanzenmaterial bedeckt und bieten daher ideale Brutplätze für Pilzsporen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513833&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a5590dd-9ead-480d-9a2c-75b1fecca9c0\', \'multiverseId\': 513833}, \'multiverseid\': 513833}, {\'name\': \'Pantanoso salobre\', \'text\': \'El Pantanoso salobre entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{1}{B}: Regresa el Pantanoso salobre de tu cementerio a tu mano. Activa esto solo si ganaste vidas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia hongo\', \'flavor\': \'La mayoría de pantanosos están cubiertos de una vegetación descompuesta idónea para que se reproduzcan las esporas fúngicas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57ae9c68-086a-4f43-b30f-f27f94179464\', \'multiverseId\': 514124}, \'multiverseid\': 514124}, {\'name\': \'Traînailleur saumâtre\', \'text\': "Le Traînailleur saumâtre arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{1}{B} : Renvoyez le Traînailleur saumâtre depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. N\'activez que si vous avez gagné des points de vie ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : fongus et bête\', \'flavor\': \'La plupart des traînailleurs sont recouverts de matière végétale en décomposition, ce qui en fait le terrain parfait pour cultiver des spores fongiques.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514415&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea8b91a-25f2-444d-8ae9-4d00a2917e83\', \'multiverseId\': 514415}, \'multiverseid\': 514415}, {\'name\': \'Micopalustre Salmastro\', \'text\': \'Il Micopalustre Salmastro entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{1}{B}: Riprendi in mano il Micopalustre Salmastro dal tuo cimitero. Attiva solo se hai guadagnato punti vita in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Fungus\', \'flavor\': \'Molti micopalustri sono ricoperti di vegetali in decomposizione, che li rendono terreno fertile per spore fungine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06ae55ec-fac0-4786-ae16-87f3f04c39ec\', \'multiverseId\': 514706}, \'multiverseid\': 514706}, {\'name\': \'汽水トラッジ\', \'text\': \'汽水トラッジはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}{B}：あなたの墓地から汽水トラッジをあなたの手札に戻す。あなたがこのターンにライフを得ていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'大抵のトラッジは枯れた植物質に覆われており、きのこ類の胞子を栽培するのに最適である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48df0970-a41b-46da-b1a9-0d9073ce19cb\', \'multiverseId\': 514997}, \'multiverseid\': 514997}, {\'name\': \'불쾌한 트러지\', \'text\': \'불쾌한 트러지는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{1}{B}: 불쾌한 트러지를 당신의 무덤에서 당신의 손으로 되돌린다. 당신이 이 턴에 생명점을 얻은 경우에만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 진균 야수\', \'flavor\': \'대부분의 트러지는 썩어 가는 식물들로 덮여 있어, 곰팡이 포자의 이상적인 번식지가 되어 준다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b64c8dc1-469f-4100-9bd0-582470c619da\', \'multiverseId\': 515288}, \'multiverseid\': 515288}, {\'name\': \'Rojo Salobro\', \'text\': \'Rojo Salobro entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{1}{B}: Devolva Rojo Salobro de seu cemitério para sua mão. Ative somente se você ganhou pontos de vida neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fungo Besta\', \'flavor\': \'A maioria dos rojos é coberta de matéria vegetal em decomposição, o que faz deles o terreno ideal para a procriação de esporos fúngicos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58506716-2562-4edf-bc6c-cac88bb2bff8\', \'multiverseId\': 515579}, \'multiverseid\': 515579}, {\'name\': \'Солоноводный Болотник\', \'text\': \'Солоноводный Болотник выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{1}{B}: верните Солоноводного Болотника из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Активируйте, только если вы получали жизни в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Плесень Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Большинство болотников покрыто гниющей растительной массой, так что на них отлично размножаются грибные споры.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb230350-87f5-45e1-a49a-64a7d743cf37\', \'multiverseId\': 515870}, \'multiverseid\': 515870}, {\'name\': \'盐碱楚吉兽\', \'text\': \'盐碱楚吉兽须横置进战场。\\n{1}{B}：将盐碱楚吉兽从你的坟墓场移回你手上。只能于你获得过生命的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～真菌／野兽\', \'flavor\': \'大多数楚吉兽背上都覆有一片腐植层，令它们成为培养真菌孢子的最佳选择。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b634e781-c7a7-4c19-ac83-fbc01cd998e6\', \'multiverseId\': 516161}, \'multiverseid\': 516161}, {\'name\': \'鹽鹼楚吉獸\', \'text\': \'鹽鹼楚吉獸須橫置進戰場。\\n{1}{B}：將鹽鹼楚吉獸從你的墳墓場移回你手上。只能於你獲得過生命的回合中起動。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～真菌／野獸\', \'flavor\': \'大多數楚吉獸背上都覆有一片腐植層，令牠們成為培養真菌孢子的最佳選擇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e0d3f8f-1698-4e3d-9297-528c7cbe965f\', \'multiverseId\': 516452}, \'multiverseid\': 516452}]', '[{\'name\': \'Burrog-Verwirrer\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn der Burrog-Verwirrer ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, -1/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Frosch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Studenten, die in Doradur nach Flusskräutern suchen, stellen schnell fest, dass sie etwas feucht und völlig umzingelt sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513806&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6271d87a-3b3d-4993-a0b0-ad028c380e26\', \'multiverseId\': 513806}, \'multiverseid\': 513806}, {\'name\': \'Brujisapo aturdidor\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando el Brujisapo aturdidor entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -1/-0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero rana\', \'flavor\': \'Los estudiantes que buscan hierbas en los ríos de Dóradur acaban ligeramente empapados y completamente rodeados en menos que croa una rana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68cb3a0b-bcf4-4fb2-8d6f-74b3deab33d4\', \'multiverseId\': 514097}, \'multiverseid\': 514097}, {\'name\': \'Embrouilleur burrog\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Embrouilleur burrog arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -1/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : grenouille et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Les étudiants qui cherchent des herbes de rivière à Doradur se retrouvent rapidement trempés et cernés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514388&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93701e7b-7976-4c1c-bbe1-fd36f9cbb8d2\', \'multiverseId\': 514388}, \'multiverseid\': 514388}, {\'name\': \'Grac Disorientatore\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando il Grac Disorientatore entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -1/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Rana\', \'flavor\': \'Gli studenti in cerca di erbe di fiume a Doradur si trovano presto un poco umidi e molto circondati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d7ef694-27de-436d-804b-5b7fd140d2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 514679}, \'multiverseid\': 514679}, {\'name\': \'バロッグの混乱起こし\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nバロッグの混乱起こしが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — カエル・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'ドラドゥールで水草を探す生徒は、自分が少々濡れて周囲を完全に囲まれていることに気づく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'592ca227-0f4d-43c6-b174-e8681e72cf95\', \'multiverseId\': 514970}, \'multiverseid\': 514970}, {\'name\': \'버로그 장난꾼\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n버로그 장난꾼이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -1/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 개구리 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'도라두르에서 강 약초를 찾는 학생들은 이내 축축해진 상태로 완전히 둘러싸인 자신을 발견한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b53aff29-3612-4225-ab76-9fcf6a5deb54\', \'multiverseId\': 515261}, \'multiverseid\': 515261}, {\'name\': \'Sapruxo Desorientador\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Sapruxo Desorientador entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -1/-0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sapo Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Os alunos que procuram ervas ribeirinhas em Doradur rapidamente descobrem que estão um pouco molhados e completamente cercados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49e55991-9f7a-456b-9414-9c9668867e69\', \'multiverseId\': 515552}, \'multiverseid\': 515552}, {\'name\': \'Буррог-Обманщик\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Буррог-Обманщик выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо под контролем оппонента получает -1/-0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Лягушка Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Студенты, собирающие речные травы в Дорадуре, быстро оказываются слегка промокшими и со всех сторон окруженными.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b61a3879-9448-4088-8039-0ebe642272c9\', \'multiverseId\': 515843}, \'multiverseid\': 515843}, {\'name\': \'惑心布蛙\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当惑心布蛙进战场时，目标由对手操控的生物得-1/-0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛙／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'前往多拉度采摘河草的学生，很快就发现自己周身沾水，陷入重重包围。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ec343d-eb32-4b23-a0ce-3f5ab05114cc\', \'multiverseId\': 516134}, \'multiverseid\': 516134}, {\'name\': \'惑心布蛙\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當惑心布蛙進戰場時，目標由對手操控的生物得-1/-0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛙／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'前往多拉度採摘河草的學生，很快就發現自己周身沾水，陷入重重包圍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b12b9b8c-528c-45e2-96c6-6ff64d80694f\', \'multiverseId\': 516425}, \'multiverseid\': 516425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böswilliger Peitschenhieb\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die stärksten Schattenzauber entstehen aus Verachtung für andere, nicht aus Frustration mit dir selbst."\\n—Embrose, Dekan der Silberkiel-Fakultät\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513842&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f4c5879-52ab-4e89-ad67-a69f434d00a9\', \'multiverseId\': 513842}, \'multiverseid\': 513842}, {\'name\': \'Restallido de malicia\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los hechizos sombríos más poderosos provienen de un desprecio hacia alguien, no de una frustración con uno mismo".\\n—Embrose, decano de Plumargéntum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e2e1bf4-0f4c-4474-a23e-b1a2f4662413\', \'multiverseId\': 514133}, \'multiverseid\': 514133}, {\'name\': \'Cinglement de malice\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Les sorts d\'ombre les plus puissants sont issus du dédain envers autrui, pas de votre propre frustration. »\\nEmbrose, doyen de Plumargent", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514424&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'001db858-9952-4c00-b810-1b14d05428aa\', \'multiverseId\': 514424}, \'multiverseid\': 514424}, {\'name\': \'Sferzata di Malizia\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le magie d\\\'ombra più potenti nascono dal disdegno per il prossimo, non dalla frustrazione con te stesso."\\n—Embrose, decano di Pennargento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0f5f75c-2eff-42f3-abba-de31777094ba\', \'multiverseId\': 514715}, \'multiverseid\': 514715}, {\'name\': \'悪意の打ちつけ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「最も強力な影の呪文は他人への軽蔑から生まれる。自分への不満からではない。」\\n――シルバークイルの学部長、エムブローズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b32af9a1-317e-41b2-8024-1ae21540d273\', \'multiverseId\': 515006}, \'multiverseid\': 515006}, {\'name\': \'악의의 채찍질\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/-2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"가장 강력한 그림자 주문은 자신에 대한 좌절감이 아니라 다른 사람에 대한 경멸에서 오지."\\n—실버퀼 학장, 엠브로즈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d85fe6-879a-4d14-8b5e-b62891cf7a07\', \'multiverseId\': 515297}, \'multiverseid\': 515297}, {\'name\': \'Açoite da Malícia\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"As mais fortes mágicas de sombras vêm do desdém por outro alguém, e não da frustração consigo mesmo."\\n— Embrose, decano de Platinopena\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'598c2dc9-9d9a-413c-8137-a9ceb1678dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 515588}, \'multiverseid\': 515588}, {\'name\': \'Плеть Злобы\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +2/-2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Самые сильные заклинания тени рождаются от презрения к кому-то другому, а не от разочарования в себе».\\n— Эмброз, декан Сильверквилла\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6526d004-c437-409e-8b93-ec6d81b3289a\', \'multiverseId\': 515879}, \'multiverseid\': 515879}, {\'name\': \'恶意鞭击\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「最强大的黯影咒语源自蔑视他人，而非自我悔恨。」\\n～银毫院长安博斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e5f2d82-caa0-4774-868a-7d1f4a9cda6b\', \'multiverseId\': 516170}, \'multiverseid\': 516170}, {\'name\': \'惡意鞭擊\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+2/-2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「最強大的黯影咒語源自蔑視他人，而非自我悔恨。」\\n～銀毫院長安博斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'010478f3-52ac-48bf-9ea4-03d05c64113b\', \'multiverseId\': 516461}, \'multiverseid\': 516461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bücherwurm\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Bücherwurm ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\\n{2}{G}: Lege den Bücherwurm aus deinem Friedhof als dritte Karte von oben in deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Die Phrase „ein Buch verschlingen" bekommt eine neue, furchterregende Bedeutung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513891&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'192fb090-26d1-4b3a-8a9a-2c5a8bdff95a\', \'multiverseId\': 513891}, \'multiverseid\': 513891}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe de biblioteca\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando la Sierpe de biblioteca entre al campo de batalla, ganas 3 vidas y robas una carta.\\n{2}{G}: Pon la Sierpe de biblioteca de tu cementerio en tu biblioteca en tercer lugar desde la parte superior.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': \'Lleva a un extremo aterrador lo de "devorar libros".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f057ac-133f-4684-a77d-6616a31d4b08\', \'multiverseId\': 514182}, \'multiverseid\': 514182}, {\'name\': \'Guivre de bibliothèque\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nQuand la Guivre de bibliothèque arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 3 points de vie et vous piochez une carte.\\n{2}{G} : Mettez la Guivre de bibliothèque dans votre bibliothèque en troisième position à partir du dessus depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': "« Dévorer un livre d\'un seul coup » prend une signification terriblement extrême.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bef7cb9-3811-49db-9df2-e006cba8654d\', \'multiverseId\': 514473}, \'multiverseid\': 514473}, {\'name\': \'Wurm di Biblioteca\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando il Wurm di Biblioteca entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 3 punti vita e peschi una carta.\\n{2}{G}: Metti il Wurm di Biblioteca dal tuo cimitero nel tuo grimorio come terza carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'La rappresentazione più estrema di "divorare un libro tutto d\\\'un fiato".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b87e46a8-c429-457a-9d0c-40b89844850f\', \'multiverseId\': 514764}, \'multiverseid\': 514764}, {\'name\': \'本のワーム\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n本のワームが戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得てカード１枚を引く。\\n{2}{G}：あなたの墓地から本のワームをあなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚目に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': \'それは驚くほど極端な「一気に本を貪る」をやってみせた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ef87035-6c41-4bbe-be74-839712849c5c\', \'multiverseId\': 515055}, \'multiverseid\': 515055}, {\'name\': \'책벌레\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n책벌레가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 3점을 얻고 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n{2}{G}: 책벌레를 당신의 무덤에서 당신의 서고 맨 위에서 세 번째에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 웜\', \'flavor\': \'"앉아서 책 한 개를 해치운다."는 말을 섬뜩할 정도로 극한까지 수행한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0184c5b-dfc3-486f-b250-6b7df52952c3\', \'multiverseId\': 515346}, \'multiverseid\': 515346}, {\'name\': \'Traça-vorme\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Traça-vorme entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 3 pontos de vida e compra um card.\\n{2}{G}: Coloque Traça-vorme do seu cemitério em seu grimório como o terceiro card a partir do topo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': \'Ela leva "devorar um livro em uma sentada" a um extremo assustador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39933045-f055-4c88-80a7-80f29d997436\', \'multiverseId\': 515637}, \'multiverseid\': 515637}, {\'name\': \'Книжный Вурм\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Книжный Вурм выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 3 жизни и берете карту.\\n{2}{G}: положите Книжного Вурма из вашего кладбища в вашу библиотеку третьим сверху.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вурм\', \'flavor\': \'Он доводит выражение «проглотить книгу за один присест» до пугающей крайности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4609b796-c962-476c-8c8c-b93ae64582cf\', \'multiverseId\': 515928}, \'multiverseid\': 515928}, {\'name\': \'噬书亚龙\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当噬书亚龙进战场时，你获得3点生命且抓一张牌。\\n{2}{G}：将噬书亚龙从你的坟墓场置于你牌库顶数来第三张的位置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～亚龙\', \'flavor\': \'它把「一口气消化一本书」演绎到了惊人的极端。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1a7d143-f703-452d-b94f-7bb938b757a4\', \'multiverseId\': 516219}, \'multiverseid\': 516219}, {\'name\': \'噬書亞龍\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n當噬書亞龍進戰場時，你獲得3點生命且抽一張牌。\\n{2}{G}：將噬書亞龍從你的墳墓場置於你牌庫頂數來第三張的位置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～亞龍\', \'flavor\': \'牠把「一口氣消化一本書」演繹到了驚人的極端。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be6e0cab-fd78-40fb-a774-0ebb98f6ee27\', \'multiverseId\': 516510}, \'multiverseid\': 516510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Campusführer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Campusführer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, danach mischen und jene Karte oben darauf legen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt keinen Ort in Strixhaven, den ich nicht finden kann. Wo müsst ihr hin?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514035&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a965f6d-fd79-412e-8559-bbb29bb4772b\', \'multiverseId\': 514035}, \'multiverseid\': 514035}, {\'name\': \'Guía del campus\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Guía del campus entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla y luego barajar y poner esa carta en la parte superior.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay sitio en Strixhaven que no pueda encontrar. ¿Dónde quieres ir?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1147f343-b8ab-4d7c-9e84-9bd42d6c547c\', \'multiverseId\': 514326}, \'multiverseid\': 514326}, {\'name\': \'Guide du campus\', \'text\': \'Quand le Guide du campus arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, puis mélanger et mettre cette carte au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a nulle part à Strixhaven que je ne connaisse pas. Où souhaitez-vous aller ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514617&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a6e8e69-22cc-4fcc-99e6-c36df7453763\', \'multiverseId\': 514617}, \'multiverseid\': 514617}, {\'name\': \'Guida del Campus\', \'text\': \'Quando la Guida del Campus entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla, poi rimescolare e mettere quella carta in cima.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'"Non c\\\'è luogo a Strixhaven che io non conosca. Dove devi andare?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af6e4e33-812b-48f6-a832-45626fc3ce05\', \'multiverseId\': 514908}, \'multiverseid\': 514908}, {\'name\': \'構内ガイド\', \'text\': \'構内ガイドが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開する。その後、ライブラリーを切り直し、そのカードを一番上に置く。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'「ストリクスヘイヴンには私が知らない場所はありません。どこへ行きたいのですか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'636a8190-c957-451f-b6d2-5c4f3ede849d\', \'multiverseId\': 515199}, \'multiverseid\': 515199}, {\'name\': \'캠퍼스 안내인\', \'text\': \'캠퍼스 안내인이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드를 찾아, 그 카드를 공개하고, 서고를 섞은 후 그 카드를 맨 위에 올려놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 골렘\', \'flavor\': \'"스트릭스헤이븐에서 제가 찾을 수 없는 곳은 없습니다. 어디로 가시겠습니까?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd60609b-496a-4a1f-998d-8b30bff75abb\', \'multiverseId\': 515490}, \'multiverseid\': 515490}, {\'name\': \'Guia do Campus\', \'text\': \'Quando Guia do Campus entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, revelá-lo. Depois, embaralhe e coloque aquele card no topo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'"Não há lugar em Strixhaven que eu não possa encontrar. Onde você precisa ir?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e373a7-c856-4d75-b034-3499f466217f\', \'multiverseId\': 515781}, \'multiverseid\': 515781}, {\'name\': \'Проводник по Кампусу\', \'text\': \'Когда Проводник по Кампусу выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, показать ее, затем перетасовать библиотеку и положить ту карту на верх.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': \'«В Стриксхейвене нет такого места, которого бы я не знал. Куда вы хотите отправиться?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba7d149e-a1e0-4b3c-aa54-3a9dd6d87b6a\', \'multiverseId\': 516072}, \'multiverseid\': 516072}, {\'name\': \'校区向导\', \'text\': \'当校区向导进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，然后洗牌，并将该牌置于牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'「斯翠海文没有我不知道的地方。你们要去哪？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0185bce8-2f6f-45d8-8144-7f9c31b23aec\', \'multiverseId\': 516363}, \'multiverseid\': 516363}, {\'name\': \'校區嚮導\', \'text\': \'當校區嚮導進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，然後洗牌，並將該牌置於牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'「斯翠海文沒有我不知道的地方。你們要去哪？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26e3f501-1d0b-41ff-824d-a58a5b6d03d8\', \'multiverseId\': 516654}, \'multiverseid\': 516654}]', '[{\'name\': \'Clevere Lumimantin\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, erhält die Clevere Lumimantin +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Du bist zu dumm, um es zu merken, aber du hast schon verloren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513778&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c314da3e-1bcd-4970-bde9-b1b2bcfd23e5\', \'multiverseId\': 513778}, \'multiverseid\': 513778}, {\'name\': \'Lumimante astuta\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, la Lumimante astuta obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Eres demasiado tonto como para darte cuenta de que ya perdiste".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dea14325-5acc-44c9-baea-6b2480f2fdac\', \'multiverseId\': 514069}, \'multiverseid\': 514069}, {\'name\': \'Lumimancienne rusée\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, la Lumimancienne rusée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu es trop éteint pour le comprendre, mais tu as déjà perdu. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514360&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46eb54ea-c7f7-48ad-8f9d-6fccdc3db377\', \'multiverseId\': 514360}, \'multiverseid\': 514360}, {\'name\': \'Luminomante Scaltra\', \'text\': \'Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, la Luminomante Scaltra prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La tua mente è troppo offuscata per capirlo, ma hai già perso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d42fc2e-0839-4576-bae6-484b2a063ae6\', \'multiverseId\': 514651}, \'multiverseid\': 514651}, {\'name\': \'賢い光術師\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、ターン終了時まで、賢い光術師は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「あんたは鈍くて分かんないだろうけど、もうあんたの負けだよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b2a3846-8348-4d5d-9022-6087e456c6cf\', \'multiverseId\': 514942}, \'multiverseid\': 514942}, {\'name\': \'영리한 빛술사\', \'text\': \'마도제작술 — 당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동하거나 복사할 때마다, 영리한 빛술사는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"잘 안 보일 테니 모르겠지만, 넌 이미 졌어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'134ace51-ddcb-4e4c-abb9-6d6e30051f72\', \'multiverseId\': 515233}, \'multiverseid\': 515233}, {\'name\': \'Lumimante Esperta\', \'text\': \'Magifício — Toda vez que você conjura ou copia uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, Lumimante Esperta recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua mente está muito ofuscada para perceber, mas você já foi derrotado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd76f5fd-5788-4477-b28e-d1ac344ef90e\', \'multiverseId\': 515524}, \'multiverseid\': 515524}, {\'name\': \'Мудрая Светомантка\', \'text\': \'Чародейство — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете или копируете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, Мудрая Светомантка получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты слишком темный, чтобы это осознать, но ты уже проиграл».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd58a9d9-f084-4288-b2bd-620653d81877\', \'multiverseId\': 515815}, \'multiverseid\': 515815}, {\'name\': \'机敏辉光术士\', \'text\': \'魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，机敏辉光术士得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「以你的愚蠢可能还没意识到：你已经输了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12c43fb2-579e-446e-b5c7-4d011c34ddf7\', \'multiverseId\': 516106}, \'multiverseid\': 516106}, {\'name\': \'機敏輝光術士\', \'text\': \'魔藝～每當你施放或複製瞬間或巫術咒語時，機敏輝光術士得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「以你的愚蠢可能還沒意識到：你已經輸了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3edfd6b0-0202-48bb-b0a6-db0f27baf104\', \'multiverseId\': 516397}, \'multiverseid\': 516397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Codie, der polternde Codex\', \'text\': \'Du kannst keine Bleibende-Karte-Zaubersprüche wirken.\\n{4}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}. Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke so lange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte mit niedrigerem Manabetrag ins Exil schickst. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du jene Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514036&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b57db0f0-8c65-4b16-b1ae-491e5451668c\', \'multiverseId\': 514036}, \'multiverseid\': 514036}, {\'name\': \'Codi, códice vociferante\', \'text\': \'No puedes lanzar hechizos de permanente.\\n{4}, {T}: Agrega {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}. Cuando lances tu siguiente hechizo este turno, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro con menor valor de maná. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon cada otra carta exiliada de esta manera en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'559f16ec-cd3e-4014-a761-62dec6b6f081\', \'multiverseId\': 514327}, \'multiverseid\': 514327}, {\'name\': \'Codie, codex vociférateur\', \'text\': "Vous ne pouvez pas lancer de sorts de permanent.\\n{4}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}. Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort ce tour-ci, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez chaque autre carte exilée de cette manière au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514618&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ecfdeac-0499-4f2c-a5d4-33baad5077b7\', \'multiverseId\': 514618}, \'multiverseid\': 514618}, {\'name\': \'Cody, Codice Parlante\', \'text\': \'Non puoi lanciare magie permanente.\\n{4}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}. Quando lanci la tua prossima magia in questo turno, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta istantaneo o stregoneria con valore di mana inferiore. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi lanciare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti ogni altra carta esiliata in questo modo in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5ef8ced-db01-4c45-b934-2a8806566c12\', \'multiverseId\': 514909}, \'multiverseid\': 514909}, {\'name\': \'騒々しい写本、コーディ\', \'text\': \'あなたはパーマネント・呪文を唱えられない。\\n{4}, {T}：{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}を加える。このターンにあなたが次に呪文を唱えたとき、マナ総量がそれより小さくインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。これにより追放された、他のすべてのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f56c4a5-b133-4360-a809-0efa12a4cf22\', \'multiverseId\': 515200}, \'multiverseid\': 515200}, {\'name\': \'목소리 큰 고문서, 코디\', \'text\': \'당신은 지속물 주문을 발동할 수 없다.\\n{4}, {T}: {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}를 추가한다. 당신이 이 턴에 다음 주문을 발동할 때, 더 적은 마나 값을 가진 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문이 추방될 때까지 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 추방한다. 턴종료까지, 당신은 그 카드의 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 그 카드를 발동할 수 있다. 이런 식으로 추방된 다른 각 카드는 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 무작위로 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7c2bda2-f832-4a37-a4bc-89a1fbf79193\', \'multiverseId\': 515491}, \'multiverseid\': 515491}, {\'name\': \'Codie, Códice Vocífero\', \'text\': \'Você não pode conjurar mágicas de permanente.\\n{4}, {T}: Adicione {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}. Quando você conjurar sua próxima mágica neste turno, exile cards do topo de seu grimório até exilar um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço com valor de mana inferior. Até o final do turno, você pode conjurar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque cada outro card exilado dessa forma no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d461758-1e57-4d2d-bd6d-f245264394d2\', \'multiverseId\': 515782}, \'multiverseid\': 515782}, {\'name\': \'Коди, Громогласный Кодекс\', \'text\': \'Вы не можете разыгрывать заклинания перманентов.\\n{4}, {T}: добавьте {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}. Когда вы разыгрываете ваше следующее заклинание в этом ходу, изгоняйте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не изгоните карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства с меньшей мановой ценностью. До конца хода вы можете разыграть ту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Положите каждую другую карту, изгнанную таким образом, в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dde661b-2837-48e6-aee2-43c299b9dcfe\', \'multiverseId\': 516073}, \'multiverseid\': 516073}, {\'name\': \'絮聒抄本阿典\', \'text\': \'你不能施放永久物咒语。\\n{4}，{T}：加{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}。本回合中，当你施放你的下一个咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张法术力值小于前述咒语的瞬间或法术牌为止。直到回合结束，你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所有以此法放逐的其他牌依随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d0800d8-f7d7-4b62-a00e-a1bb21d7f827\', \'multiverseId\': 516364}, \'multiverseid\': 516364}, {\'name\': \'絮聒抄本阿典\', \'text\': \'你不能施放永久物咒語。\\n{4}，{T}：加{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}。本回合中，當你施放你的下一個咒語時，從你的牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到放逐一張魔法力值小於前述咒語的瞬間或巫術牌為止。直到回合結束，你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。將所有以此法放逐的其他牌依隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器生物 ～組構體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a800743d-3e02-4e02-806c-efed0a904bed\', \'multiverseId\': 516655}, \'multiverseid\': 516655}]', '[{\'name\': \'Codie, der polternde Codex\', \'text\': \'Du kannst keine Bleibende-Karte-Zaubersprüche wirken.\\n{4}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}. Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke so lange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte mit niedrigerem Manabetrag ins Exil schickst. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du jene Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517052&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e214883-453d-4a46-990f-d2d96c0433d5\', \'multiverseId\': 517052}, \'multiverseid\': 517052}, {\'name\': \'Codi, códice vociferante\', \'text\': \'No puedes lanzar hechizos de permanente.\\n{4}, {T}: Agrega {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}. Cuando lances tu siguiente hechizo este turno, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro con menor valor de maná. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon cada otra carta exiliada de esta manera en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ddc91e-846d-4cf6-ab3b-a8fd5eaedca0\', \'multiverseId\': 517147}, \'multiverseid\': 517147}, {\'name\': \'Codie, codex vociférateur\', \'text\': "Vous ne pouvez pas lancer de sorts de permanent.\\n{4}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}. Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort ce tour-ci, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez chaque autre carte exilée de cette manière au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517242&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'512072b0-304b-43ab-a3cf-899707aebb82\', \'multiverseId\': 517242}, \'multiverseid\': 517242}, {\'name\': \'Cody, Codice Parlante\', \'text\': \'Non puoi lanciare magie permanente.\\n{4}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}. Quando lanci la tua prossima magia in questo turno, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta istantaneo o stregoneria con valore di mana inferiore. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi lanciare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti ogni altra carta esiliata in questo modo in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f4c117d-e9ba-49e1-8ac8-3bcbc0e811e1\', \'multiverseId\': 517337}, \'multiverseid\': 517337}, {\'name\': \'騒々しい写本、コーディ\', \'text\': \'あなたはパーマネント・呪文を唱えられない。\\n{4}, {T}：{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}を加える。このターンにあなたが次に呪文を唱えたとき、マナ総量がそれより小さくインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。これにより追放された、他のすべてのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'968b19d9-24bb-4363-86dc-00dfb68d480c\', \'multiverseId\': 517432}, \'multiverseid\': 517432}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demonstration von Selbstvertrauen\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden anderen Spontanzauber und jede andere Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug gewirkt hast. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.\\nLege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie erhält Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513796&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede5c699-0549-4bd7-9ef7-216fea361255\', \'multiverseId\': 513796}, \'multiverseid\': 513796}, {\'name\': \'Muestra de confianza\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada otro hechizo de instantáneo y de conjuro que lanzaste este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.\\nPon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Gana la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c316206-e8d3-49ef-a96f-64a6a47d90e1\', \'multiverseId\': 514087}, \'multiverseid\': 514087}, {\'name\': "Démonstration d\'assurance", \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque autre sort d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous avez lancé ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.\\nMettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée. Elle acquiert la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514378&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ca60bd7-f282-4e66-85a6-16970dc2311d\', \'multiverseId\': 514378}, \'multiverseid\': 514378}, {\'name\': \'Dimostrazione di Sicurezza\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni altra magia istantaneo e stregoneria che hai lanciato in questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie.\\nMetti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. Ha cautela fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23daa163-38a7-4483-8271-531bdf550883\', \'multiverseId\': 514669}, \'multiverseid\': 514669}, {\'name\': \'自身の誇示\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにあなたが唱えた、これ以外でインスタントやソーサリーである呪文の数に等しい回数これをコピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a7beba-633b-4dd8-b4e1-df4d8aa174bb\', \'multiverseId\': 514960}, \'multiverseid\': 514960}, {\'name\': \'자신감 표출\', \'text\': \'당신이 이 주문을 발동할 때, 당신이 이 턴에 발동한 다른 순간마법과 집중마법 주문의 수만큼 이 주문을 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본들의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.\\n생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 경계를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5413dcae-593a-4f85-adc3-f67c8838d9b4\', \'multiverseId\': 515251}, \'multiverseid\': 515251}, {\'name\': \'Demonstração de Confiança\', \'text\': \'Quando você conjurar esta mágica, copie-a para cada outra mágica instantânea e outro feitiço que você conjurou neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.\\nColoque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo. Ela ganha vigilância até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9808f69c-47f7-4f79-8766-2b165b828604\', \'multiverseId\': 515542}, \'multiverseid\': 515542}, {\'name\': \'Демонстрация Уверенности\', \'text\': \'Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, скопируйте его за каждое другое мгновенное заклинание и заклинание волшебства, которое вы разыграли в этом ходу. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для тех копий.\\nПоложите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо. Оно получает Бдительность до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e03fd5c0-7b50-4b7a-a9bf-2f1dc7ec382b\', \'multiverseId\': 515833}, \'multiverseid\': 515833}, {\'name\': \'展现信心\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，你本回合中每施放过一个其他的瞬间和法术咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。你可以为每个复制品选择新的目标。\\n在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得警戒异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92065217-7bea-4def-9897-2839df7aa506\', \'multiverseId\': 516124}, \'multiverseid\': 516124}, {\'name\': \'展現信心\', \'text\': \'當你施放此咒語時，你本回合中每施放過一個其他的瞬間和巫術咒語，便將此咒語複製一次。你可以為每個複製品選擇新的目標。\\n在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。它獲得警戒異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'140c73e1-a590-434e-876e-dd4e25c54a3a\', \'multiverseId\': 516415}, \'multiverseid\': 516415}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demütigen\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Du bestimmst davon eine Nichtland-Karte. Der Spieler wirft die bestimmte Karte ab. Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Oh, was denn? Keine schlagfertige Erwiderung?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513976&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'172f91b5-a40c-46c9-a625-bb056989737b\', \'multiverseId\': 513976}, \'multiverseid\': 513976}, {\'name\': \'Denigrar\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo muestra su mano. Tú eliges de ahí una carta que no sea tierra. Ese jugador descarta esa carta. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Oh, ¿qué pasa? ¿No me vas a replicar?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e8c4bb-0f96-413c-9dd2-2ec3aa24cb92\', \'multiverseId\': 514267}, \'multiverseid\': 514267}, {\'name\': \'Humilier\', \'text\': \'Un adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Vous y choisissez une carte non-terrain. Ce joueur se défausse de cette carte. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Oh, qu\'est-ce qui vous arrive ? On n\'a rien à répondre ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514558&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6fba68-54d5-4d53-8a37-d3f1c41ca466\', \'multiverseId\': 514558}, \'multiverseid\': 514558}, {\'name\': \'Avvilire\', \'text\': \'Un avversario bersaglio rivela la sua mano. Scegli una carta non terra da quella mano. Quel giocatore scarta quella carta. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Oh, che c\\\'è? Non ribatti?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b3af21-c036-4006-802c-fe99bb9a890f\', \'multiverseId\': 514849}, \'multiverseid\': 514849}, {\'name\': \'侮辱\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中から土地でないカード１枚を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーはそのカードを捨てる。あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「あら、何なの？反論はなし？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'547735f7-c20b-4114-a74d-b6272eb1600c\', \'multiverseId\': 515140}, \'multiverseid\': 515140}, {\'name\': \'망신주기\', \'text\': \'상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 손을 공개한다. 그중 대지가 아닌 카드 한 장을 선택한다. 그 플레이어는 그 카드를 버린다. 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"오, 왜 이래? 받아칠 말도 없어?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d89b9fe6-3538-404e-8f3d-f4b476dc26f2\', \'multiverseId\': 515431}, \'multiverseid\': 515431}, {\'name\': \'Humilhar\', \'text\': \'O oponente alvo revela a própria mão. Você escolhe um card não de terreno da mão dele. Aquele jogador descarta aquele card. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em uma criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Ué, não vai responder?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a212964-4c66-4520-9d9b-818284485898\', \'multiverseId\': 515722}, \'multiverseid\': 515722}, {\'name\': \'Уничижение\', \'text\': \'Целевой оппонент показывает свою руку. Вы выбираете из нее карту, не являющуюся землей. Тот игрок сбрасывает ту карту. Положите один жетон +1/+1 на существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«О-о, что такое? Ответа не будет?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ca2de9c-9347-4e22-b1c4-30b133591375\', \'multiverseId\': 516013}, \'multiverseid\': 516013}, {\'name\': \'恣意羞辱\', \'text\': \'目标对手展示其手牌。你选择其中一张非地牌。该牌手弃掉该牌。在一个由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「喔，就这样？你不还嘴吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75733d05-a4e4-469f-a646-43d8b19bc0e2\', \'multiverseId\': 516304}, \'multiverseid\': 516304}, {\'name\': \'恣意羞辱\', \'text\': \'目標對手展示其手牌。你選擇其中一張非地牌。該玩家棄掉該牌。在一個由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「喔，就這樣？你不還嘴嗎？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89993c59-bedf-4605-b956-2ad7a7bb4b34\', \'multiverseId\': 516595}, \'multiverseid\': 516595}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Biblioplex\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte ist, kannst du sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du die Karte nicht auf deine Hand nimmst, kannst du sie auf deinen Friedhof legen. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du genau null oder sieben Karten auf der Hand hast.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514047&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'044e5047-cac3-4135-8f38-9cb991287e7e\', \'multiverseId\': 514047}, \'multiverseid\': 514047}, {\'name\': \'La Biblioplex\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro, puedes mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si no pones la carta en tu mano, puedes ponerla en tu cementerio. Activa esto solo si tienes exactamente cero o siete cartas en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'431d0f82-1441-4f16-abe8-86ee83c93ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 514338}, \'multiverseid\': 514338}, {\'name\': \'Le Biblioplexe\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel, vous pouvez la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous ne mettez pas la carte dans votre main, vous pouvez la mettre dans votre cimetière. N\'activez que si vous avez exactement zéro ou sept cartes en main.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514629&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b89e05c8-0f77-4f76-9a28-4be28e3943a2\', \'multiverseId\': 514629}, \'multiverseid\': 514629}, {\'name\': \'Il Biblioplex\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta istantaneo o stregoneria, puoi rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se non aggiungi la carta alla tua mano, puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero. Attiva solo se hai esattamente zero o sette carte in mano.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43be5eac-2c4a-4090-82ad-e88e7735e11c\', \'multiverseId\': 514920}, \'multiverseid\': 514920}, {\'name\': \'大図書棟\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。それがインスタントかソーサリーであるカードなら、あなたは「それを公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。あなたがそのカードをあなたの手札に加えなかったなら、あなたはそれをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。あなたの手札にちょうど０枚か７枚のカードがあるのでなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85724b95-5a3a-4d7b-bdac-fc14c35a23b1\', \'multiverseId\': 515211}, \'multiverseid\': 515211}, {\'name\': \'비블리오플렉스\', \'text\': \'{T}: {C}를 추가한다.\\n{2}, {T}: 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 본다. 그 카드가 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드라면, 당신은 그 카드를 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 그 카드를 손으로 가져가지 않으면, 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 이 능력은 당신의 손에 카드가 정확하게 영 장 또는 일곱 장 있을 때에만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09bc1242-38bb-4899-8f1c-294aa61d12df\', \'multiverseId\': 515502}, \'multiverseid\': 515502}, {\'name\': \'O Biblioplexo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço, você poderá revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se não colocar o card em sua mão, você poderá colocá-lo em seu cemitério. Ative somente se você tiver exatamente zero ou sete cards na mão.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b99db1a9-e2a7-4cdf-88ba-608024f9cf79\', \'multiverseId\': 515793}, \'multiverseid\': 515793}, {\'name\': \'Библиоплекс\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта мгновенного заклинания или волшебства, вы можете показать ее и положить ее в вашу руку. Если вы не кладете ту карту в вашу руку, вы можете положить ее на ваше кладбище. Активируйте, только если у вас в руке ровно ноль или семь карт.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f7f47e-b7a5-4d10-831a-ecc35c2a226f\', \'multiverseId\': 516084}, \'multiverseid\': 516084}, {\'name\': \'茂典阁\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}：检视你的牌库顶牌。如果它是瞬间或法术牌，则你可以展示该牌并置于你手上。如果你未将该牌置于你手上，则你可以将它置入你的坟墓场。只能于你有正好零张或七张手牌时起动。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb34819-b5b0-4f5b-a773-8d6d8a42cfbd\', \'multiverseId\': 516375}, \'multiverseid\': 516375}, {\'name\': \'茂典閣\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}：檢視你的牌庫頂牌。如果它是瞬間或巫術牌，則你可以展示該牌並置於你手上。如果你未將該牌置於你手上，則你可以將它置入你的墳墓場。只能於你有正好零張或七張手牌時起動。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb7f643e-7da1-4241-a791-c0a9deae2b16\', \'multiverseId\': 516666}, \'multiverseid\': 516666}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Biblioplex\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte ist, kannst du sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du die Karte nicht auf deine Hand nimmst, kannst du sie auf deinen Friedhof legen. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du genau null oder sieben Karten auf der Hand hast.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517054&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e18c8c34-91b9-493a-967a-6606a4ae0195\', \'multiverseId\': 517054}, \'multiverseid\': 517054}, {\'name\': \'La Biblioplex\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro, puedes mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si no pones la carta en tu mano, puedes ponerla en tu cementerio. Activa esto solo si tienes exactamente cero o siete cartas en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aa20c2c-13ff-4383-8a97-15107d670369\', \'multiverseId\': 517149}, \'multiverseid\': 517149}, {\'name\': \'Le Biblioplexe\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel, vous pouvez la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous ne mettez pas la carte dans votre main, vous pouvez la mettre dans votre cimetière. N\'activez que si vous avez exactement zéro ou sept cartes en main.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517244&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc0f0d32-d901-49f7-b075-cd776ac274f7\', \'multiverseId\': 517244}, \'multiverseid\': 517244}, {\'name\': \'Il Biblioplex\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta istantaneo o stregoneria, puoi rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se non aggiungi la carta alla tua mano, puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero. Attiva solo se hai esattamente zero o sette carte in mano.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d3b76c4-5cab-4d16-b8fa-75f96edb1b8d\', \'multiverseId\': 517339}, \'multiverseid\': 517339}, {\'name\': \'大図書棟\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。それがインスタントかソーサリーであるカードなら、あなたは「それを公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。あなたがそのカードをあなたの手札に加えなかったなら、あなたはそれをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。あなたの手札にちょうど０枚か７枚のカードがあるのでなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70197a30-3e35-476a-a204-315e8cc264e6\', \'multiverseId\': 517434}, \'multiverseid\': 517434}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Gleichung lösen\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Zimones Brillanz erregte viel Aufmerksamkeit, auch bei den finsteren Magiern, die als Oriq bekannt sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513822&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c5e734c-6824-4f9c-8bfa-aa41d2539248\', \'multiverseId\': 513822}, \'multiverseid\': 513822}, {\'name\': \'Resolver la ecuación\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La genialidad de Zimone llamó la atención de muchos, incluida la de los magos siniestros conocidos como los Oriq.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba428d5-6c55-467a-af56-e2057999056d\', \'multiverseId\': 514113}, \'multiverseid\': 514113}, {\'name\': "Résoudre l\'équation", \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La brillance de Zimone attira beaucoup l\'attention, y compris celle du groupe de mages sinistres appelé l\'Oriq.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514404&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9407fb7e-9073-478a-810b-1a6e44ca47a2\', \'multiverseId\': 514404}, \'multiverseid\': 514404}, {\'name\': "Risolvere l\'Equazione", \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta istantaneo o stregoneria, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La genialità di Zimone attirava molte attenzioni, inclusi gli sguardi sinistri dei maghi noti come Oriq.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e61bc95-7bb0-43ea-a49d-35b2bb08bf05\', \'multiverseId\': 514695}, \'multiverseid\': 514695}, {\'name\': \'方程式の求解\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーからインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ジモーンの才気は大勢の注目を集めたが、その中にはオリークという邪悪な魔道士集団も含まれていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50f1137e-09b4-4876-b65b-3f4c86f0caff\', \'multiverseId\': 514986}, \'multiverseid\': 514986}, {\'name\': \'방정식 해결\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고에서 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드 한 장을 찾아, 공개하고, 당신의 손으로 가져간 후, 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'지몬의 뛰어난 재능은 많은 사람들의 이목을 집중시켰으며, 여기에는 오리크라고 알려져 있는 사악한 마도사들도 포함되어 있었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdee0e53-1242-4398-8e61-a89648cad315\', \'multiverseId\': 515277}, \'multiverseid\': 515277}, {\'name\': \'Resolver a Equação\', \'text\': \'Procure um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O brilhantismo de Zimone atraiu a atenção de muitos, até mesmo dos magos sinistros conhecidos como os Oriq.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f4c595-e1dd-465e-b388-ecb0c97cd6b8\', \'multiverseId\': 515568}, \'multiverseid\': 515568}, {\'name\': \'Решение Уравнения\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Прослышав о таланте Зимоны, многие обратили на нее внимание — в том числе и Орик, зловещее общество магов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c8fd57-2f7a-4a1d-85b1-66d9fda96279\', \'multiverseId\': 515859}, \'multiverseid\': 515859}, {\'name\': \'解出算式\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张瞬间或法术牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'琦梦的横溢才华引起诸方关注，包括欧理可那群恶法师。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f260081-849a-4f18-b4e1-79b9af8d40e8\', \'multiverseId\': 516150}, \'multiverseid\': 516150}, {\'name\': \'解出算式\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋一張瞬間或巫術牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'琦夢的橫溢才華引起諸方關注，包括歐理可那群惡法師。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b7f2d7-f8ed-42ed-8c29-1f3a1597fbd1\', \'multiverseId\': 516441}, \'multiverseid\': 516441}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dina die Seelentränkerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\\n{1}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Dina die Seelentränkerin erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Stärke der geopferten Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dryade, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'184b6de6-ba20-4ae0-b661-d794e6f09f00\', \'multiverseId\': 513961}, \'multiverseid\': 513961}, {\'name\': \'Dina, infusionista de almas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\\n{1}, sacrificar otra criatura: Dina, infusionista de almas obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Druida dríada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e852234b-aa91-41e2-b6be-e0a9bd678cf2\', \'multiverseId\': 514252}, \'multiverseid\': 514252}, {\'name\': "Dina, macéreuse d\'âmes", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.\\n{1}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Dina, macéreuse d\'âmes gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la force de la créature sacrifiée.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dryade et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514543&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54036968-395c-499c-a108-66e84984a233\', \'multiverseId\': 514543}, \'multiverseid\': 514543}, {\'name\': \'Dina, Distillatrice di Anime\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\\n{1}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Dina, Distillatrice di Anime prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è la forza della creatura sacrificata.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Driade\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe3fb5f5-82eb-441d-a541-7147844e3cf7\', \'multiverseId\': 514834}, \'multiverseid\': 514834}, {\'name\': \'魂浸し、ダイナ\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\\n{1}, これ以外のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、魂浸し、ダイナは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはその生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドライアド・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af98eff4-52f5-4ef7-8db3-2e8cd692c62b\', \'multiverseId\': 515125}, \'multiverseid\': 515125}, {\'name\': \'영혼의 그릇, 디나\', \'text\': \'당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\\n{1}, 다른 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 영혼의 그릇, 디나는 턴종료까지 +X/+0을 받는다. X는 희생된 생물의 공격력이다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 드라이어드 드루이드\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d1d5a44-0018-4a94-827e-8bd451e66502\', \'multiverseId\': 515416}, \'multiverseid\': 515416}, {\'name\': \'Dina, Imbuidora de Almas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\\n{1}, sacrifique outra criatura: Dina, Imbuidora de Almas, recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno, sendo X o poder da criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dríade Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f0c3f33-fb70-402e-8e36-c172b2956ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 515707}, \'multiverseid\': 515707}, {\'name\': \'Дина, Питающая Души\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизнь(-и), каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь.\\n{1}, пожертвуйте другое существо: Дина, Питающая Души получает +X/+0 до конца хода, где X — сила пожертвованного существа.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дриада Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca937d98-6985-4677-bf7c-069b69727a35\', \'multiverseId\': 515998}, \'multiverseid\': 515998}, {\'name\': \'浸灵迪娜\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\\n{1}，牺牲另一个生物：浸灵迪娜得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为所牺牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～树灵／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f700d9be-ba7a-4ef8-bc02-6a2782867531\', \'multiverseId\': 516289}, \'multiverseid\': 516289}, {\'name\': \'浸靈迪娜\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，每位對手各失去1點生命。\\n{1}，犧牲另一個生物：浸靈迪娜得+X/+0直到回合結束，X為所犧牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～樹靈／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ded5264-1db5-42a0-aabb-029129cb3101\', \'multiverseId\': 516580}, \'multiverseid\': 516580}]', '[{\'name\': \'Division durch Null\', \'text\': \'Bringe einen Zauberspruch oder eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 1 oder mehr auf die Hand seines bzw. ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nLerne eine Lektion. (Du kannst eine Lektion-Karte von außerhalb der Partie, die du besitzt, offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen, oder eine Karte abwerfen und dann eine Karte ziehen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Frustration. Unzulänglichkeit. Scheitern. Der gemeinsame Nenner bist du."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513809&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd658b7f-d90d-46f8-a69e-2ad7e89de88d\', \'multiverseId\': 513809}, \'multiverseid\': 513809}, {\'name\': \'Dividir entre cero\', \'text\': \'Regresa el hechizo o permanente objetivo con valor de maná de 1 o más a la mano de su propietario.\\nAprende. (Puedes mostrar una carta de Lección de la cual eres propietario de fuera del juego y ponerla en tu mano o descartar una carta para robar una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Miseria. Errores. Fracaso. El denominador común eres tú".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac80bb56-7e5c-42b8-a7e7-2df5b9b8fa4b\', \'multiverseId\': 514100}, \'multiverseid\': 514100}, {\'name\': \'Diviser par zéro\', \'text\': "Renvoyez un sort ou un permanent ciblé avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 1 dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nApprenez. (Vous pouvez révéler une carte de leçon que vous possédez en dehors de la partie et la mettre dans votre main, ou vous défausser d\'une carte pour piocher une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Misère. Inefficacité. Échec. Le dénominateur commun, c\'est vous. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514391&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d572a9-db05-4a26-a46f-8388e1fe5695\', \'multiverseId\': 514391}, \'multiverseid\': 514391}, {\'name\': \'Dividere per Zero\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare una magia o un permanente bersaglio con valore di mana pari o superiore a 1 in mano al suo proprietario.\\nApprendi. (Puoi rivelare una carta Lezione che possiedi al di fuori della partita e aggiungerla alla tua mano o scartare una carta per pescare una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Miseria. Inadeguatezza. Fallimento. Il denominatore comune sei tu."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'485f9577-7736-4740-8744-e5d79b57bfee\', \'multiverseId\': 514682}, \'multiverseid\': 514682}, {\'name\': \'ゼロ除算\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が１以上の、呪文１つかパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n履修を行う。（あなたは、ゲームの外部からあなたがオーナーである講義・カード１枚を公開しあなたの手札に加えるか、カード１枚を捨てカード１枚を引くか、どちらかを行ってもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「悲惨。不適切。失敗。その共通項はお前だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fbdf528-40a3-41b4-a9af-363356dbcc62\', \'multiverseId\': 514973}, \'multiverseid\': 514973}, {\'name\': \'영으로 나누기\', \'text\': \'마나 값이 1 이상인 주문 또는 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\\n학습한다. (당신은 게임 밖에서 당신이 소유한 수업 카드 한 장을 공개하고 그 카드를 당신의 손에 넣거나, 카드 한 장을 버린 후 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"비참함. 불충분. 실패. 공통분모는 너야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da0dc52a-f996-4ac2-9a7e-fb45233608c1\', \'multiverseId\': 515264}, \'multiverseid\': 515264}, {\'name\': \'Dividir por Zero\', \'text\': \'Devolva a mágica ou permanente alvo com valor de mana igual ou superior a 1 para a mão de seu dono.\\nAprender. (Você pode revelar um card de Lição seu de fora do jogo e colocá-lo em sua mão, ou descartar um card para comprar um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Desgraça. Incompatibilidade. Fracasso. O denominador comum é você."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61617913-b3e5-4f36-8e98-d1ac0a458fc8\', \'multiverseId\': 515555}, \'multiverseid\': 515555}, {\'name\': \'Деление на Ноль\', \'text\': \'Верните целевое заклинание или перманент с мановой ценностью 1 или больше в руку его владельца.\\nВыучите урок. (Вы можете показать принадлежащую вам карту Урока вне игры и положить ее в вашу руку, или вы можете сбросить карту, чтобы взять карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Убогость. Неадекватность. Провал. Общий знаменатель всего этого — ты».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0d53f2f-1872-4440-9c79-84fadddf57c5\', \'multiverseId\': 515846}, \'multiverseid\': 515846}, {\'name\': \'除数归零\', \'text\': \'将目标法术力值等于或大于1的咒语或永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n温习。（你可以从游戏外展示一张由你拥有的课程牌并置于你手上，或弃一张牌来抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「悲剧。不足。失败。它们的公分母都是你。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f06e905-c151-42d2-bb9a-ed47ca0844f8\', \'multiverseId\': 516137}, \'multiverseid\': 516137}, {\'name\': \'除數歸零\', \'text\': \'將目標魔法力值等於或大於1的咒語或永久物移回其擁有者手上。\\n溫習。（你可以從遊戲外展示一張由你擁有的課程牌並置於你手上，或棄一張牌來抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「悲劇。不足。失敗。它們的公分母都是你。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a0a12a6-154d-4d68-a8f3-f2af3725ba92\', \'multiverseId\': 516428}, \'multiverseid\': 516428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnernder Redner\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn der Donnernde Redner angreift, erhält er Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges, falls du eine fliegende Kreatur kontrollierst. Das Gleiche gilt für Bedrohlichkeit, Erstschlag, Doppelschlag, Lebensverknüpfung, Todesberührung, Unzerstörbarkeit sowie das Verursachen von Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513803&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81e2920a-3a98-47e5-81a2-f615ad439c86\', \'multiverseId\': 513803}, \'multiverseid\': 513803}, {\'name\': \'Orador estruendoso\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que el Orador estruendoso ataque, gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno si controlas una criatura con la habilidad de volar. Lo mismo sucede con las habilidades de dañar primero, dañar dos veces, toque mortal, indestructible, vínculo vital, amenaza y arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero kor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1eca26c-2aa6-413e-a15c-77442351b7b9\', \'multiverseId\': 514094}, \'multiverseid\': 514094}, {\'name\': \'Orateur tonitruant\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Orateur tonitruant attaque, il acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour si vous contrôlez une créature avec le vol. C\'est vrai aussi pour l\'initiative, la double initiative, le contact mortel, l\'indestructible, le lien de vie, la menace et le piétinement.", \'type\': \'Créature : kor et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514385&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2758b403-a258-474e-84d3-b78a27c3a723\', \'multiverseId\': 514385}, \'multiverseid\': 514385}, {\'name\': \'Oratore Tonante\', \'text\': "Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Oratore Tonante attacca, ha volare fino alla fine del turno se controlli una creatura con volare. Lo stesso vale per attacco improvviso, doppio attacco, tocco letale, indistruttibile, legame vitale, minacciare e travolgere.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Kor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fbba2b8-937a-418b-a03c-b5dded1ed3f8\', \'multiverseId\': 514676}, \'multiverseid\': 514676}, {\'name\': \'轟く語り部\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n轟く語り部が攻撃するたび、あなたが飛行を持つクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、ターン終了時まで、これは飛行を得る。先制攻撃、二段攻撃、接死、破壊不能、絆魂、威迫、トランプルについても同様である。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15278508-ae26-40ee-9f8b-e6127435783f\', \'multiverseId\': 514967}, \'multiverseid\': 514967}, {\'name\': \'천둥소리 웅변가\', \'text\': \'경계\\n천둥소리 웅변가가 공격할 때마다, 당신이 비행을 가진 생물을 조종한다면 천둥소리 웅변가는 턴종료까지 비행을 얻는다. 선제공격, 이단공격, 치명타, 무적, 생명연결, 호전적, 돌진에 대해서도 이와 같이 취급한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코르 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'979c9ce9-9d9e-4d8d-9d9c-368486ecc0ce\', \'multiverseId\': 515258}, \'multiverseid\': 515258}, {\'name\': \'Orador Trovejante\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nToda vez que Orador Trovejante ataca, ele ganha voar até o final do turno se você controla uma criatura com voar. O mesmo vale para iniciativa, golpe duplo, toque mortífero, indestrutível, vínculo com a vida, ameaçar e atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kor Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8a98acb-4514-43e0-8c26-48b28b77b113\', \'multiverseId\': 515549}, \'multiverseid\': 515549}, {\'name\': \'Громогласный Оратор\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nКаждый раз, когда Громогласный Оратор атакует, он получает Полет до конца хода, если вы контролируете существо с Полетом. То же самое относится к Двойному удару, Неразрушимости, Первому удару, Пробивному удару, Смертельному касанию, Угрозе и Цепи жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кор Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'150a1cae-252b-4d02-96be-6938cf4692cd\', \'multiverseId\': 515840}, \'multiverseid\': 515840}, {\'name\': \'雷霆雄辩家\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当雷霆雄辩家攻击时，如果你操控具飞行异能的生物，则雷霆雄辩家获得飞行异能直到回合结束。且先攻、连击、死触、不灭、系命、威慑与践踏异能亦比照办理。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～寇族／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f4d37a5-0adb-4e93-b0c3-a01be092f7c7\', \'multiverseId\': 516131}, \'multiverseid\': 516131}, {\'name\': \'雷霆雄辯家\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每當雷霆雄辯家攻擊時，如果你操控具飛行異能的生物，則雷霆雄辯家獲得飛行異能直到回合結束。且先攻、連擊、死觸、不滅、繫命、威懾與踐踏異能亦比照辦理。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～寇族／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e26f838b-68f8-43d8-8743-a8f37058149b\', \'multiverseId\': 516422}, \'multiverseid\': 516422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Doppelband-Schamane\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Möge dein elender Name nie in den Annalen der Geschichte auftauchen, du ignoranter Witzbold!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513886&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c87ea653-ca3f-42b9-8f6c-82f2cf474888\', \'multiverseId\': 513886}, \'multiverseid\': 513886}, {\'name\': \'Chamán del pergamino doble\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán enano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Que tu miserable nombre jamás adorne los anales de la historia, payaso ignorante!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'678ee20c-e68d-4066-a7be-1416cfa72109\', \'multiverseId\': 514177}, \'multiverseid\': 514177}, {\'name\': \'Shamane aux deux parchemins\', \'text\': \'Double initiative\', \'type\': \'Créature : nain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Puisse ton nom maudit ne jamais figurer dans les annales de l\'histoire, espèce de bouffon ignorant ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cfd1c04-d7b5-4bf1-ab90-1e100e957fd5\', \'multiverseId\': 514468}, \'multiverseid\': 514468}, {\'name\': \'Sciamano delle Pergamene Gemelle\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Che gli annali di storia rifuggano il tuo miserabile nome, buffone ignorante!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2d8ca3d-ad4a-42df-900a-aad7d2214963\', \'multiverseId\': 514759}, \'multiverseid\': 514759}, {\'name\': \'双巻物のシャーマン\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「汝の哀れな名が決して歴史の記録に現れることのないよう。この戯け者め！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13caedf2-103b-4aae-9ddb-25758aa8e29a\', \'multiverseId\': 515050}, \'multiverseid\': 515050}, {\'name\': \'이중두루마리 주술사\', \'text\': \'이단공격\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"이 무식한 얼간이 자식, 네 비참한 이름이 결코 역사 속에서 빛나지 않기를!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10b56149-9fa2-4c0e-ab99-99419175c5b5\', \'multiverseId\': 515341}, \'multiverseid\': 515341}, {\'name\': \'Xamã dos Pergaminhos Gêmeos\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Que seu nome miserável nunca agracie os anais da história, seu bufão ignorante!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c26ab26b-f8e8-475e-8c77-89cc87877ec3\', \'multiverseId\': 515632}, \'multiverseid\': 515632}, {\'name\': \'Шаман Двоесвитков\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Да не осквернит твое жалкое имя летопись истории, ты, невежественный шут!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa4dcdd8-8e70-4121-adf0-415d59b56be7\', \'multiverseId\': 515923}, \'multiverseid\': 515923}, {\'name\': \'双轴焰祭师\', \'text\': \'连击\', \'type\': \'生物 ～矮人／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「祝你的丑陋名字永无法登诸年志之端，你个无知蠢货！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e0f1a06-03f0-4e7a-8a94-efdcd6fd256e\', \'multiverseId\': 516214}, \'multiverseid\': 516214}, {\'name\': \'雙軸焰祭師\', \'text\': \'連擊\', \'type\': \'生物 ～矮人／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「祝你的醜陋名字永無法登諸年誌之端，你個無知蠢貨！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5a65ff1-6200-4472-a3d4-92540e2fcd6e\', \'multiverseId\': 516505}, \'multiverseid\': 516505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Doppelstudium\', \'text\': \'Kopiere einen Kreaturenzauber deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst, außer dass die Kopie nicht legendär ist, falls der Zauberspruch legendär ist. (Eine Kopie eines Kreaturenzaubers wird zu einem Spielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Jetzt kann ich mich ganz der Zoetomagie und der Leeretheorie widmen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65ef9298-88a1-4c39-9432-d93a42dbacab\', \'multiverseId\': 513962}, \'multiverseid\': 513962}, {\'name\': \'Doble grado\', \'text\': \'Copia el hechizo de criatura objetivo que controlas, excepto que no es legendario si el hechizo es legendario. (Una copia de un hechizo de criatura se convierte en una ficha.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Por fin podré dedicar todo mi tiempo a la zoetimancia y a la teoría de vacíos!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb460873-2507-4d5d-9fe7-7db18ff530e5\', \'multiverseId\': 514253}, \'multiverseid\': 514253}, {\'name\': \'Double spécialisation\', \'text\': "Copiez un sort de créature ciblé que vous contrôlez, excepté qu\'il n\'est pas légendaire si le sort est légendaire. (Une copie d\'un sort de créature devient un jeton.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Maintenant, je peux me concentrer pleinement sur la zoétimancie et la théorie du vide ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514544&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ab25562-f8dd-42fa-b453-838069bb21ac\', \'multiverseId\': 514544}, \'multiverseid\': 514544}, {\'name\': \'Doppia Specializzazione\', \'text\': \'Copia una magia creatura bersaglio che controlli, tranne che non è leggendaria se la magia è leggendaria. (Una copia di una magia creatura diventa una pedina.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ora posso dedicarmi totalmente alla zoetimanzia e alla teoria del nulla!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39043940-a8b6-4708-9754-f49effac88ab\', \'multiverseId\': 514835}, \'multiverseid\': 514835}, {\'name\': \'二科目専攻\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー・呪文１つを対象とする。その呪文が伝説であってもコピーは伝説でないことを除き、それをコピーする。（クリーチャー・呪文のコピーはトークンになる。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「これで生魔術と虚空理論の両方に専念できるわ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1d04719-262b-403f-958d-4e0f828f434a\', \'multiverseId\': 515126}, \'multiverseid\': 515126}, {\'name\': \'복수 전공\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 복사한다. 그 주문이 전설적인 경우 복사본은 전설적이 아니다. (생물 주문의 복사본은 토큰이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이제 생물술과 공허 이론에 완전히 전념할 수 있겠군!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60578bbe-d401-47a3-a5af-09c307e52866\', \'multiverseId\': 515417}, \'multiverseid\': 515417}, {\'name\': \'Duas Habilitações\', \'text\': \'Copie a mágica de criatura alvo que você controla, exceto que ela não será lendária se a mágica for lendária. (Uma cópia de uma mágica de criatura torna-se uma ficha.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Agora posso me dedicar completamente a zoetimancia e teoria do vazio!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'201f5ec6-741e-414a-8278-9b2a03ae6687\', \'multiverseId\': 515708}, \'multiverseid\': 515708}, {\'name\': \'Двойная Специализация\', \'text\': \'Скопируйте целевое заклинание существа под вашим контролем, но при этом оно не является легендарным, если заклинание легендарное. (Копия заклинания существа становится фишкой.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Теперь я могу полностью посвятить себя жизнемантии и теории пустоты!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4972b85-9185-4d73-bd25-2a34071f995a\', \'multiverseId\': 515999}, \'multiverseid\': 515999}, {\'name\': \'双重主修\', \'text\': \'复制目标由你操控的生物咒语，但如果该咒语是传奇，则复制品不是传奇。（生物咒语的复制品会成为衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「现在我就能专心研究雄生术和虚空理论了！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8a7e5cb-2d58-4e2b-9f35-aad45184583c\', \'multiverseId\': 516290}, \'multiverseid\': 516290}, {\'name\': \'雙重主修\', \'text\': \'複製目標由你操控的生物咒語，但如果該咒語是傳奇，則複製品不是傳奇。（生物咒語的複製品會成為衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「現在我就能專心研究雄生術和虛空理論了！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'160f7e08-78d6-4ad0-9a2c-130087c630ca\', \'multiverseId\': 516581}, \'multiverseid\': 516581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Doppelstudium\', \'text\': \'Kopiere einen Kreaturenzauber deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst, außer dass die Kopie nicht legendär ist, falls der Zauberspruch legendär ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517035&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb197872-965c-4965-b5d7-987ee97633a8\', \'multiverseId\': 517035}, \'multiverseid\': 517035}, {\'name\': \'Doble grado\', \'text\': \'Copia el hechizo de criatura objetivo que controlas, excepto que no es legendario si el hechizo es legendario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d50760b0-3a03-4ef6-8a81-cf72b122624c\', \'multiverseId\': 517130}, \'multiverseid\': 517130}, {\'name\': \'Double spécialisation\', \'text\': "Copiez un sort de créature ciblé que vous contrôlez, excepté qu\'il n\'est pas légendaire si le sort est légendaire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'672f4281-1adc-45bb-b43c-396826c64e87\', \'multiverseId\': 517225}, \'multiverseid\': 517225}, {\'name\': \'Doppia Specializzazione\', \'text\': \'Copia una magia creatura bersaglio che controlli, tranne che non è leggendaria se la magia è leggendaria.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f92413a-10c4-45c7-9d46-be993d51e120\', \'multiverseId\': 517320}, \'multiverseid\': 517320}, {\'name\': \'二科目専攻\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー・呪文１つを対象とする。その呪文が伝説であってもコピーは伝説でないことを除き、それをコピーする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5d2a4fa-ed54-48ee-86a0-94cea2ba9a84\', \'multiverseId\': 517415}, \'multiverseid\': 517415}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachengarde-Elite\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Drachengarde-Elite.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Verdopple die Anzahl der +1/+1-Marken auf der Drachengarde-Elite.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Gründerdrachen beendeten das Zeitalter des Blutes ein Ende. Es ist eine Ehre, ihnen zu dienen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516861&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57dddd2a-d6f6-428b-964b-8ecb94842ae6\', \'multiverseId\': 516861}, \'multiverseid\': 516861}, {\'name\': \'Élite de la Guardia dracónica\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Élite de la Guardia dracónica.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Duplica la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la Élite de la Guardia dracónica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los dragones fundadores pusieron fin a la Edad de Sangre. Es un honor servirlos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69ccb3be-8d3f-4c87-a130-097db88b9201\', \'multiverseId\': 516862}, \'multiverseid\': 516862}, {\'name\': \'Élite de la garde des dragons\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Élite de la garde des dragons.\\n{4}{G}{G} : Doublez le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Élite de la garde des dragons.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Les Dragons fondateurs ont mis fin à l\'Ère sanglante. Les servir est un honneur. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516863&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fade5de3-566f-4c07-a4b7-fdd810c834e5\', \'multiverseId\': 516863}, \'multiverseid\': 516863}, {\'name\': "Guardiana dei Draghi d\'Élite", \'text\': "Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Guardiana dei Draghi d\'Élite.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Raddoppia il numero di segnalini +1/+1 sulla Guardiana dei Draghi d\'Élite.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I Draghi Fondatori hanno messo fine all\\\'Era del Sangue. È un onore servirli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a54c65c-293d-42c1-89be-bf84ce2c7552\', \'multiverseId\': 516864}, \'multiverseid\': 516864}, {\'name\': \'龍護りの精鋭\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、龍護りの精鋭の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{4}{G}{G}：龍護りの精鋭の上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンターの数を２倍にする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「創始ドラゴンが血の時代に終わりをもたらしたのよ。その方々に仕えるのは名誉なことだわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6a2ffb7-bfef-4dc0-a385-3d6960ca3a11\', \'multiverseId\': 516865}, \'multiverseid\': 516865}, {\'name\': \'용수호자 정예병\', \'text\': \'마도제작술 — 당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동하거나 복사할 때마다, 용수호자 정예병에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n{4}{G}{G}: 용수호자 정예병에 놓인 +1/+1 카운터의 수를 두 배로 늘린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"설립자 용들이 피의 시대를 끝냈어. 그분들을 섬기는 것은 영광스러운 일이야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c068f804-f151-44da-8ebf-814c1e772f61\', \'multiverseId\': 516866}, \'multiverseid\': 516866}, {\'name\': \'Elite da Guarda Dragônica\', \'text\': \'Magifício — Toda vez que você conjurar ou copiar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Elite da Guarda Dragônica.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Duplique o número de marcadores +1/+1 em Elite da Guarda Dragônica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Os Dragões Fundadores deram fim à Idade do Sangue. É uma honra servir a eles."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982b66ee-ee7a-4cee-b10d-31138beec314\', \'multiverseId\': 516867}, \'multiverseid\': 516867}, {\'name\': \'Элита Драконьей Гвардии\', \'text\': \'Чародейство — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете или копируете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Элиту Драконьей Гвардии.\\n{4}{G}{G}: удвойте количество жетонов +1/+1 на Элите Драконьей Гвардии.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Драконы-основатели положили конец Кровавому веку. Служить им — великая честь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e5d9082-ee27-4747-9267-df7fb385ff22\', \'multiverseId\': 516868}, \'multiverseid\': 516868}, {\'name\': \'菁英护龙卫\', \'text\': \'魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，在菁英护龙卫上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}{G}{G}：将菁英护龙卫上的+1/+1指示物数量加倍。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「创院巨龙终结了血腥时代。能够侍奉他们是我的荣幸。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc2140c3-6cf4-4b52-85f0-bb09ec759e7e\', \'multiverseId\': 516869}, \'multiverseid\': 516869}, {\'name\': \'菁英護龍衛\', \'text\': \'魔藝～每當你施放或複製瞬間或巫術咒語時，在菁英護龍衛上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}{G}{G}：將菁英護龍衛上的+1/+1指示物數量加倍。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「創院巨龍終結了血腥時代。能夠侍奉他們是我的榮幸。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'304632c5-afa7-453c-9015-8df04d8175bc\', \'multiverseId\': 516870}, \'multiverseid\': 516870}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachengarde-Elite\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Drachengarde-Elite.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Verdopple die Anzahl der +1/+1-Marken auf der Drachengarde-Elite.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Gründerdrachen beendeten das Zeitalter des Blutes. Es ist eine Ehre, ihnen zu dienen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513895&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26881140-ce30-4ac9-890a-3c2498839a06\', \'multiverseId\': 513895}, \'multiverseid\': 513895}, {\'name\': \'Élite de la Guardia dracónica\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Élite de la Guardia dracónica.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Duplica la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la Élite de la Guardia dracónica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los dragones fundadores pusieron fin a la Edad de Sangre. Es un honor servirlos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57ebdbf2-c004-47f7-8726-679e4ab939ee\', \'multiverseId\': 514186}, \'multiverseid\': 514186}, {\'name\': \'Élite de la garde des dragons\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Élite de la garde des dragons.\\n{4}{G}{G} : Doublez le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Élite de la garde des dragons.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Les Dragons fondateurs ont mis fin à l\'Ère sanglante. Les servir est un honneur. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dc53db7-0498-4918-a19a-7e2af2e04732\', \'multiverseId\': 514477}, \'multiverseid\': 514477}, {\'name\': "Guardiana dei Draghi d\'Élite", \'text\': "Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Guardiana dei Draghi d\'Élite.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Raddoppia il numero di segnalini +1/+1 sulla Guardiana dei Draghi d\'Élite.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I Draghi Fondatori hanno messo fine all\\\'Era del Sangue. È un onore servirli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d6e3faa-2040-4724-b2f4-d7ae56fcd5ad\', \'multiverseId\': 514768}, \'multiverseid\': 514768}, {\'name\': \'龍護りの精鋭\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、龍護りの精鋭の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{4}{G}{G}：龍護りの精鋭の上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンターの数を２倍にする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「創始ドラゴンが血の時代に終わりをもたらしたのよ。その方々に仕えるのは名誉なことだわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62bdb473-dc60-4919-a449-0f09a2164a23\', \'multiverseId\': 515059}, \'multiverseid\': 515059}, {\'name\': \'용수호자 정예병\', \'text\': \'마도제작술 — 당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동하거나 복사할 때마다, 용수호자 정예병에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n{4}{G}{G}: 용수호자 정예병에 놓인 +1/+1 카운터의 수를 두 배로 늘린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"설립자 용들이 피의 시대를 끝냈어. 그분들을 섬기는 것은 영광스러운 일이야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7506cc3-f860-490a-a50b-a1fa8e928405\', \'multiverseId\': 515350}, \'multiverseid\': 515350}, {\'name\': \'Elite da Guarda Dragônica\', \'text\': \'Magifício — Toda vez que você conjurar ou copiar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Elite da Guarda Dragônica.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Duplique o número de marcadores +1/+1 em Elite da Guarda Dragônica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Os Dragões Fundadores deram fim à Idade do Sangue. É uma honra servir a eles."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccd287f5-c0f2-45e9-bc63-3d05452032c9\', \'multiverseId\': 515641}, \'multiverseid\': 515641}, {\'name\': \'Элита Драконьей Гвардии\', \'text\': \'Чародейство — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете или копируете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Элиту Драконьей Гвардии.\\n{4}{G}{G}: удвойте количество жетонов +1/+1 на Элите Драконьей Гвардии.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Драконы-основатели положили конец Кровавому веку. Служить им — великая честь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb09aa4f-8576-46e2-a036-781291a7d6f6\', \'multiverseId\': 515932}, \'multiverseid\': 515932}, {\'name\': \'菁英护龙卫\', \'text\': \'魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，在菁英护龙卫上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}{G}{G}：将菁英护龙卫上的+1/+1指示物数量加倍。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「创院巨龙终结了血腥时代。能够侍奉他们是我的荣幸。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e16d4cc-14b1-4a27-9511-2e3a30c46d1f\', \'multiverseId\': 516223}, \'multiverseid\': 516223}, {\'name\': \'菁英護龍衛\', \'text\': \'魔藝～每當你施放或複製瞬間或巫術咒語時，在菁英護龍衛上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}{G}{G}：將菁英護龍衛上的+1/+1指示物數量加倍。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「創院巨龍終結了血腥時代。能夠侍奉他們是我的榮幸。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39d31504-388d-4eb3-a1be-4cc129373b31\', \'multiverseId\': 516514}, \'multiverseid\': 516514}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachengarde-Elite\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Drachengarde-Elite.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Verdopple die Anzahl der +1/+1-Marken auf der Drachengarde-Elite.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516998&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f7910c2-3183-4722-bbf2-5e4843b31632\', \'multiverseId\': 516998}, \'multiverseid\': 516998}, {\'name\': \'Élite de la Guardia dracónica\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Élite de la Guardia dracónica.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Duplica la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la Élite de la Guardia dracónica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d457973f-5e25-4614-b06e-42a611326854\', \'multiverseId\': 517093}, \'multiverseid\': 517093}, {\'name\': \'Élite de la garde des dragons\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Élite de la garde des dragons.\\n{4}{G}{G} : Doublez le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Élite de la garde des dragons.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517188&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee67886-8984-4011-b125-f8424b97147e\', \'multiverseId\': 517188}, \'multiverseid\': 517188}, {\'name\': "Guardiana dei Draghi d\'Élite", \'text\': "Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Guardiana dei Draghi d\'Élite.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Raddoppia il numero di segnalini +1/+1 sulla Guardiana dei Draghi d\'Élite.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ea9cd83-5ee5-4f60-95e8-b112ee33faa7\', \'multiverseId\': 517283}, \'multiverseid\': 517283}, {\'name\': \'龍護りの精鋭\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、龍護りの精鋭の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{4}{G}{G}：龍護りの精鋭の上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンターの数を２倍にする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe21ad0f-4def-448b-a08e-d8955217876a\', \'multiverseId\': 517378}, \'multiverseid\': 517378}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drakonisches Eingreifen\', \'text\': \'Schicke als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\\nDas Drakonische Eingreifen fügt jeder Nicht-Drache-Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag der ins Exil geschickten Karte ist. Falls eine Kreatur, der auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wurde, in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\\nSchicke das Drakonisches Eingreifen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513864&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e47c70-ad45-453c-bf1a-2ccd0dc02707\', \'multiverseId\': 513864}, \'multiverseid\': 513864}, {\'name\': \'Intervención dracónica\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, exilia una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro de tu cementerio.\\nLa Intervención dracónica hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura que no sea Dragón, donde X es el valor de maná de la carta exiliada. Si una criatura que recibió daño de esta manera fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\\nExilia la Intervención dracónica.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db61e5c0-a437-4f2a-ac0e-146598f42be7\', \'multiverseId\': 514155}, \'multiverseid\': 514155}, {\'name\': \'Intervention draconique\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel depuis votre cimetière.\\nL\'Intervention draconique inflige X blessures à chaque créature non-Dragon, X étant la valeur de mana de la carte exilée. Si une créature ayant subi des blessures de cette manière devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.\\nExilez l\'Intervention draconique.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98aa787f-1ebb-495d-95d3-4540d9d01336\', \'multiverseId\': 514446}, \'multiverseid\': 514446}, {\'name\': \'Intervento Draconico\', \'text\': "Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria dal tuo cimitero.\\nL\'Intervento Draconico infligge X danni a ogni creatura non Drago, dove X è il valore di mana della carta esiliata. Se una creatura a cui è stato inflitto danno in questo modo sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\\nEsilia l\'Intervento Draconico.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66e961cd-19de-4447-acf7-4b6dbcbddc18\', \'multiverseId\': 514737}, \'multiverseid\': 514737}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの介入\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を追放する。\\nドラゴンの介入は、ドラゴンでない各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘは、その追放されたカードのマナ総量に等しい。このターン、これによりダメージを受けたクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\\nドラゴンの介入を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc6a4ca-9504-479e-8b35-f4ee81d6a625\', \'multiverseId\': 515028}, \'multiverseid\': 515028}, {\'name\': \'용의 개입\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 당신의 무덤에서 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드 한 장을 추방한다.\\n용의 개입은 용이 아닌 각 생물에게 피해 X점을 입힌다. X는 추방된 카드의 마나 값이다. 이 턴에 이렇게 피해를 입은 생물이 죽으려고 하면, 대신에 그 생물을 추방한다.\\n용의 개입을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b74e5a8-08d5-4637-96fb-ba1794ec38d2\', \'multiverseId\': 515319}, \'multiverseid\': 515319}, {\'name\': \'Intervenção Dragônica\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, exile um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço de seu cemitério.\\nIntervenção Dragônica causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura não Dragão, sendo X o valor de mana do card exilado. Se uma criatura que sofreu dano dessa maneira morreria neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\\nExile Intervenção Dragônica.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb0ec8d9-142b-426a-8842-da19fcb53b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 515610}, \'multiverseid\': 515610}, {\'name\': \'Драконье Вмешательство\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания изгоните карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища.\\nДраконье Вмешательство наносит X повреждений каждому не являющемуся Драконом существу, где X — мановая ценность той изгнанной карты. Если существо, которому таким образом были нанесены повреждения, должно умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\\nИзгоните Драконье Вмешательство.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f62c99e0-850a-4736-a7c9-a0adee500bbc\', \'multiverseId\': 515901}, \'multiverseid\': 515901}, {\'name\': \'龙族干预\', \'text\': \'从你的坟墓场放逐一张瞬间或法术牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n龙族干预对每个非龙生物各造成X点伤害，X为所放逐之牌的法术力值。如果本回合中曾以此法受到伤害的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\\n放逐龙族干预。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2f10bf-eb48-49bb-bc71-5c43bb6be398\', \'multiverseId\': 516192}, \'multiverseid\': 516192}, {\'name\': \'龍族干預\', \'text\': \'從你的墳墓場放逐一張瞬間或巫術牌，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n龍族干預對每個非龍生物各造成X點傷害，X為所放逐之牌的魔法力值。如果本回合中曾以此法受到傷害的生物將死去，則改為將它放逐。\\n放逐龍族干預。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dc466e2-526a-448d-95ab-3898bd2ebb68\', \'multiverseId\': 516483}, \'multiverseid\': 516483}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drakonisches Eingreifen\', \'text\': \'Schicke als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\\nDas Drakonische Eingreifen fügt jeder Nicht-Drache-Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag der ins Exil geschickten Karte ist. Falls eine Kreatur, der auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wurde, in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\\nSchicke das Drakonisches Eingreifen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516991&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fe91e97-b6f3-4028-9bc0-48aaf9cf9601\', \'multiverseId\': 516991}, \'multiverseid\': 516991}, {\'name\': \'Intervención dracónica\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, exilia una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro de tu cementerio.\\nLa Intervención dracónica hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura que no sea Dragón, donde X es el valor de maná de la carta exiliada. Si una criatura que recibió daño de esta manera fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\\nExilia la Intervención dracónica.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473e1edf-ce79-4e3c-9101-a378784f535f\', \'multiverseId\': 517086}, \'multiverseid\': 517086}, {\'name\': \'Intervention draconique\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel depuis votre cimetière.\\nL\'Intervention draconique inflige X blessures à chaque créature non-Dragon, X étant la valeur de mana de la carte exilée. Si une créature ayant subi des blessures de cette manière devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.\\nExilez l\'Intervention draconique.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517181&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dda33046-f6df-4dea-a114-aff7b43b5359\', \'multiverseId\': 517181}, \'multiverseid\': 517181}, {\'name\': \'Intervento Draconico\', \'text\': "Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria dal tuo cimitero.\\nL\'Intervento Draconico infligge X danni a ogni creatura non Drago, dove X è il valore di mana della carta esiliata. Se una creatura a cui è stato inflitto danno in questo modo sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\\nEsilia l\'Intervento Draconico.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47f9522a-50aa-4b4e-8b1f-629161468609\', \'multiverseId\': 517276}, \'multiverseid\': 517276}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの介入\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を追放する。\\nドラゴンの介入は、ドラゴンでない各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘは、その追放されたカードのマナ総量に等しい。このターン、これによりダメージを受けたクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\\nドラゴンの介入を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'257e13eb-db8e-4613-8103-8234b51c06ee\', \'multiverseId\': 517371}, \'multiverseid\': 517371}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dramatisches Finale\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Nichtspielsteinkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, sterben, erzeuge einen 2/1 weißen und schwarzen Tintling-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Das entzückte Publikum bemerkte kaum, dass die Programmhefte plötzlich leer waren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c1f2a01-1502-4409-8a75-469ea98387e8\', \'multiverseId\': 513963}, \'multiverseid\': 513963}, {\'name\': \'Final dramático\', \'text\': \'Las fichas de criatura que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que no sean ficha que controlas mueran, crea una ficha de criatura Tintícola blanca y negra 2/1 con la habilidad de volar. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La audiencia, cautivada, apenas se dio cuenta de que sus programas de repente estaban en blanco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5344a236-f824-40d8-8ec0-750ff4387a8b\', \'multiverseId\': 514254}, \'multiverseid\': 514254}, {\'name\': \'Final dramatique\', \'text\': "Les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, créez un jeton de créature 2/1 blanche et noire Encrelin avec le vol. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Le public captivé remarqua à peine que tous les programmes étaient soudain devenus vides.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514545&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da84f102-1600-4d5f-aaa9-2aa65f71a2ca\', \'multiverseId\': 514545}, \'multiverseid\': 514545}, {\'name\': \'Finale Drammatico\', \'text\': \'Le pedine creatura che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature non pedina che controlli muoiono, crea una pedina creatura Scarabocchio 2/1 bianca e nera con volare. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli spettatori erano così affascinati da notare appena che i loro programmi erano diventati improvvisamente bianchi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'875c0b0a-eb62-41c1-b32c-2e2c4505ddf9\', \'multiverseId\': 514836}, \'multiverseid\': 514836}, {\'name\': \'劇的な終焉\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・トークンは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでない１体以上のクリーチャーが死亡するたび、飛行を持つ白黒の２/１の墨獣・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'夢中になっていた観客は自分のプログラムが突然真っ白になったことに気づかなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09aa692a-d188-476b-9287-e3a7ed923efc\', \'multiverseId\': 515127}, \'multiverseid\': 515127}, {\'name\': \'극적인 결말\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물 토큰들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n당신이 조종하는 토큰이 아닌 생물이 한 개 이상 죽을 때마다, 비행을 가진 2/1 백색 및 흑색 잉클링 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 이 능력은 한 턴에 한 번만 격발한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'넋을 잃은 관객들은 공연장이 갑자기 텅 빈 것을 거의 알아차리지 못했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c795dbf-d0c6-46f7-a250-127d054facd9\', \'multiverseId\': 515418}, \'multiverseid\': 515418}, {\'name\': \'Final Dramático\', \'text\': \'As fichas de criatura que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas não ficha que você controla morrerem, crie uma ficha de criatura Nanquíneo branca e preta 2/1 com voar. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'O público extasiado mal percebeu que de repente seus programas ficaram em branco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a3ac42c-d03a-410d-9191-21b562470032\', \'multiverseId\': 515709}, \'multiverseid\': 515709}, {\'name\': \'Драматический Финал\', \'text\': \'Фишки существ под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда одно или несколько не являющихся фишками существ под вашим контролем умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 2/1 белый и черный Чернильник с Полетом. Эта способность срабатывает только один раз в каждом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Восхищенные зрители даже не заметили, что их программки вдруг стали пустыми.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f53eb59-2973-42ce-8ee2-8b08a463b3e3\', \'multiverseId\': 516000}, \'multiverseid\': 516000}, {\'name\': \'绚烂终曲\', \'text\': \'由你操控的衍生生物得+1/+1。\\n每当一个或数个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，派出一个2/1，白黑双色，具飞行异能的墨灵衍生生物。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'观众看得入神，根本没注意到他们的节目单瞬间变作空白。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31b95186-3405-4ee4-949c-74bf287f5bd8\', \'multiverseId\': 516291}, \'multiverseid\': 516291}, {\'name\': \'絢爛終曲\', \'text\': \'由你操控的衍生生物得+1/+1。\\n每當一個或數個由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去時，派出一個2/1，白黑雙色，具飛行異能的墨靈衍生生物。此異能每回合只會觸發一次。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'觀眾看得入神，根本沒注意到他們的節目單瞬間變作空白。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a22eab12-01a3-4584-9e6a-04615f2be8cb\', \'multiverseId\': 516582}, \'multiverseid\': 516582}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dramatisches Finale\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Nichtspielsteinkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, sterben, erzeuge einen 2/1 weißen und schwarzen Tintling-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517036&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f1e44d5-b52d-4b47-a9e9-dcbcfec29668\', \'multiverseId\': 517036}, \'multiverseid\': 517036}, {\'name\': \'Final dramático\', \'text\': \'Las fichas de criatura que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que no sean ficha que controlas mueran, crea una ficha de criatura Tintícola blanca y negra 2/1 con la habilidad de volar. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dd95a96-d1f6-473a-b6d4-5b1f6d394686\', \'multiverseId\': 517131}, \'multiverseid\': 517131}, {\'name\': \'Final dramatique\', \'text\': "Les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, créez un jeton de créature 2/1 blanche et noire Encrelin avec le vol. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517226&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2145c952-9ed8-44e2-af2f-f3f5b7a255c3\', \'multiverseId\': 517226}, \'multiverseid\': 517226}, {\'name\': \'Finale Drammatico\', \'text\': \'Le pedine creatura che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature non pedina che controlli muoiono, crea una pedina creatura Scarabocchio 2/1 bianca e nera con volare. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abb7794c-2f99-4164-9a3e-32ae4bf09edf\', \'multiverseId\': 517321}, \'multiverseid\': 517321}, {\'name\': \'劇的な終焉\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・トークンは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャーが死亡するたび、飛行を持つ白黒の２/１の墨獣・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2068b1d9-daea-425c-9f57-33454980f1cd\', \'multiverseId\': 517416}, \'multiverseid\': 517416}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durchfallen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges -X/-X, wobei X gleich 7 minus der Anzahl an Karten auf der Hand des Beherrschers jener Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich versichere dir, in meinem Kurs fällt niemand mehr als einmal durch."\\n—Embrose, Dekan der Silberkiel-Fakultät\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513839&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9fc9d79-1695-482e-9cba-e06f59f1a4d0\', \'multiverseId\': 513839}, \'multiverseid\': 513839}, {\'name\': \'Reprobar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno, donde X es 7 menos la cantidad de cartas en la mano del controlador de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le aseguro que nadie reprueba mi curso más de una vez".\\n—Embrose, decano de Plumargéntum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf3e1633-d9e6-48cc-a53c-2c5254b9b1b7\', \'multiverseId\': 514130}, \'multiverseid\': 514130}, {\'name\': \'Recalage\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant 7 moins le nombre de cartes dans la main du contrôleur de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je vous assure que personne n\'est recalé de mon cours plus d\'une fois. »\\nEmbrose, doyen de Plumargent", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514421&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbbc93b6-80b2-4f89-8cab-fc23fd28be77\', \'multiverseId\': 514421}, \'multiverseid\': 514421}, {\'name\': \'Fallire\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è 7 meno il numero di carte nella mano del controllore di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Posso assicurartelo, nessuno viene bocciato al mio esame più di una volta."\\n—Embrose, decano di Pennargento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3ac929d-8017-4aa4-ac77-dd932b21e588\', \'multiverseId\': 514712}, \'multiverseid\': 514712}, {\'name\': \'落第\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘは、７からそれのコントローラーの手札にあるカードの枚数を引いた値に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「保証しよう。俺の単位を二度落とす奴はいない。」\\n――シルバークイルの学部長、エムブローズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d262b8d-f4ba-462f-9b3d-07971795d696\', \'multiverseId\': 515003}, \'multiverseid\': 515003}, {\'name\': \'낙제\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -X/-X를 받는다. X는 7에서 그 생물의 조종자의 손에 있는 카드 수를 뺀 수이다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"장담하지만, 내 수업에서 두 번 낙제하는 사람은 없어."\\n—실버퀼 학장, 엠브로즈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'877a4029-f0b8-4881-94a8-4508c00be296\', \'multiverseId\': 515294}, \'multiverseid\': 515294}, {\'name\': \'Ser Reprovado\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -X/-X até o final do turno, sendo X 7 menos o número de cards na mão do controlador daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu lhes asseguro que ninguém é reprovado em meu curso mais de uma vez."\\n— Embrose, decano de Platinopena\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c98e4bf-b526-49e1-8eb3-2adf6862b089\', \'multiverseId\': 515585}, \'multiverseid\': 515585}, {\'name\': \'Провал на Экзамене\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -X/-X до конца хода, где Х — 7 минус количество карт в руке контролирующего то существо игрока.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Уверяю тебя, больше одного раза у меня никто экзамен не проваливает».\\n— Эмброз, декан Сильверквилла\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5f2b3f7-90ef-4689-90c2-9e839881c84c\', \'multiverseId\': 515876}, \'multiverseid\': 515876}, {\'name\': \'成绩砸锅\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-X/-X直到回合结束，X为7减去该生物操控者的手牌数量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我向你保证，我的课最多只会不及格一次。」\\n～银毫院长安博斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f513545-7693-4878-ad00-7eb3c2e0ee75\', \'multiverseId\': 516167}, \'multiverseid\': 516167}, {\'name\': \'成績砸鍋\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-X/-X直到回合結束，X為7減去該生物操控者的手牌數量。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我向你保證，我的課最多只會不及格一次。」\\n～銀毫院長安博斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0370b188-4b8f-4d2a-b211-41eab2a9e8d5\', \'multiverseId\': 516458}, \'multiverseid\': 516458}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durchpreschen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Genial ausmanövriert! Kundhort wird auf dem falschen Fuß erwischt und Blütenwelk stürmt nach vorne."\\n—Cremik, Magierturm-Kommentator\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513892&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f6bedee-dea3-4082-ba88-ac4f09e18455\', \'multiverseId\': 513892}, \'multiverseid\': 513892}, {\'name\': \'Adelantar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Qué movimiento! Pillan desprevenido a Sapiéntium y Flosmarcitus avanza a toda velocidad".\\n—Crémik, comentarista de torres mágicas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb0f2c8b-2192-4071-98c7-e28374e8fd82\', \'multiverseId\': 514183}, \'multiverseid\': 514183}, {\'name\': \'Percée\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Quelle percée ! Forsapience se fait surprendre et Flestrefleur passe à la charge. »\\n—Cremik, commentateur de Tour-polo des mages\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514474&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4133770d-9c8a-4cf9-91a8-e8f99a683a2b\', \'multiverseId\': 514474}, \'multiverseid\': 514474}, {\'name\': \'Carica Filtrante\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Che mossa! Archeorocca si è fatta cogliere di sorpresa e Germoglioscuro sfreccia in avanti."\\n—Cremik, commentatore di Torre del mago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b5d6013-ccad-41ee-a33c-662b743779ed\', \'multiverseId\': 514765}, \'multiverseid\': 514765}, {\'name\': \'突っ走り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはトランプルを得る。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「なんという展開でしょうか！ロアホールドが油断して捕らえられ、ウィザーブルームが突進しています。」\\n――メイジタワーの解説者、クレミク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd812c25-b099-4858-ae1c-3028d0c3871e\', \'multiverseId\': 515056}, \'multiverseid\': 515056}, {\'name\': \'정면 돌파\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"엄청나네요! 로어홀드가 무방비한 채로 붙잡혔고, 위더블룸이 치고 나갑니다."\\n—마도사의 탑 해설자, 크레믹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c67a07e-88c6-44e2-9720-83438a1e6a21\', \'multiverseId\': 515347}, \'multiverseid\': 515347}, {\'name\': \'Disparar em Ataque\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Que jogada! Sapioforte é pega de surpresa e Murchaflor arranca na frente."\\n— Cremik, comentarista de Torre do Mago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6898dc3-021d-4c44-ae82-9942d2dea2a9\', \'multiverseId\': 515638}, \'multiverseid\': 515638}, {\'name\': \'Мощный Рывок\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает Пробивной удар до конца хода.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Какой прием! Визерблум сумел застать Лорхолд врасплох и вырывается вперед».\\n— Креймик, комментатор башни магов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd381dc-2e99-4647-bb4e-1cdfcf010de1\', \'multiverseId\': 515929}, \'multiverseid\': 515929}, {\'name\': \'奋力突破\', \'text\': \'目标生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「精彩突破！衡鉴队显得有点不知所措，靡华队趁机拉开距离。」\\n～斗法塔赛评夸米克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b27ea2e8-1daf-47fe-922b-081ae472c519\', \'multiverseId\': 516220}, \'multiverseid\': 516220}, {\'name\': \'奮力突破\', \'text\': \'目標生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「精彩突破！衡鑑隊顯得有點不知所措，靡華隊趁機拉開距離。」\\n～鬥法塔賽評夸米克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2cdb63-c3ce-4fbc-96e0-779340a4b548\', \'multiverseId\': 516511}, \'multiverseid\': 516511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämogoth-Leidfresser\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments opferst du eine Kreatur.\\nWenn du den Dämogoth-Leidfresser opferst, wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte ab. Du ziehst eine Karte und erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'„Schmerz für Weisheit. Ein besseres Angebot bekommst du nicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7073664d-2afd-4e3a-8138-1f8efa31b980\', \'multiverseId\': 513958}, \'multiverseid\': 513958}, {\'name\': \'Devoramiserias demogodo\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, sacrifica una criatura.\\nCuando sacrifiques el Devoramiserias demogodo, cada oponente descarta una carta, tú robas una carta y ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu dolor por mi sabiduría. No conseguirás un trato mejor".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b1252ab-03b0-453f-a822-1377a3cef832\', \'multiverseId\': 514249}, \'multiverseid\': 514249}, {\'name\': \'Dévore-malheur daemogoth\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, sacrifiez une créature.\\nQuand vous sacrifiez le Dévore-malheur daemogoth, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte, vous piochez une carte et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': \'« Ta souffrance en échange de ma sagesse. Tu ne trouveras pas meilleure offre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514540&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e990c9-126f-496c-90ef-b684a757f3de\', \'multiverseId\': 514540}, \'multiverseid\': 514540}, {\'name\': \'Daemogoth Mangiangoscia\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, sacrifica una creatura.\\nQuando sacrifichi il Daemogoth Mangiangoscia, ogni avversario scarta una carta, tu peschi una carta e guadagni 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tuo dolore per la mia conoscenza. Non c\\\'è offerta migliore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e9ac0b-8ce9-4e30-b75b-077b5594dc41\', \'multiverseId\': 514831}, \'multiverseid\': 514831}, {\'name\': \'デーモゴスの悲哀喰らい\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nあなたがデーモゴスの悲哀喰らいを生け贄に捧げたとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を捨て、あなたはカード１枚を引き、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'「汝の痛みで我の知恵を購うのだ。これ以上の取引は無いぞ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2055026-b66e-405c-82e4-85ff3b5a1e24\', \'multiverseId\': 515122}, \'multiverseid\': 515122}, {\'name\': \'대모고스 슬픔포식자\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n당신이 대모고스 슬픔포식자를 희생할 때, 각 상대는 카드 한 장을 버리고, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑으며, 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'"내 지혜를 얻으려면 네 고통을 내놔라. 이보다 더 좋은 조건은 없을 거야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ca0524-ede1-404f-b8b3-e1ce67d2e6ef\', \'multiverseId\': 515413}, \'multiverseid\': 515413}, {\'name\': \'Devorador de Aflições Demogodo\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nQuando você sacrifica Devorador de Aflições Demogodo, cada oponente descarta um card e você compra um card e ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua dor em troca de minha sabedoria. Você não vai conseguir uma oferta melhor."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb98115e-70b8-40fb-9452-34dce2794fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 515704}, \'multiverseid\': 515704}, {\'name\': \'Демогот, Пожиратель Горестей\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки пожертвуйте существо.\\nКогда вы жертвуете Демогота, Пожирателя Горестей, каждый оппонент сбрасывает карту, а вы берете карту и получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'«Твоя боль за мою мудрость. Лучшей сделки не будет».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dae7de82-8ca8-49ab-ac79-29ae9bc2d33b\', \'multiverseId\': 515995}, \'multiverseid\': 515995}, {\'name\': \'噬悲无丈魔\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，牺牲一个生物。\\n当你牺牲噬悲无丈魔时，每位对手各弃一张牌，你抓一张牌，且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'「用你的痛苦换取我的智慧。你找不到更合算的交易了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef306dde-4f47-4743-aa5f-1da4b5e212cb\', \'multiverseId\': 516286}, \'multiverseid\': 516286}, {\'name\': \'噬悲無丈魔\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，犧牲一個生物。\\n當你犧牲噬悲無丈魔時，每位對手各棄一張牌，你抽一張牌，且你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'「用你的痛苦換取我的智慧。你找不到更合算的交易了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33959ff2-c308-4bc1-824a-bb0652d0fc91\', \'multiverseId\': 516577}, \'multiverseid\': 516577}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämogoth-Titan\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Dämogoth-Titan angreift oder blockt, opfere eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'„Natürlich hat er dir Macht angeboten. Das tun Dämonen immer. Aber glaub mir — je süßer die Belohnung, desto ruinöser der Preis."\\n—Professorin Onyx\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513957&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0c4de33-87cf-44e1-be98-8206ab62e2be\', \'multiverseId\': 513957}, \'multiverseid\': 513957}, {\'name\': \'Titán demogodo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Titán demogodo ataque o bloquee, sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'"Claro que te prometió poder. Los demonios siempre lo ofrecen. Pero créeme: cuanto mejor sea el premio, más en la ruina te dejará el pago".\\n—Profesora Ónix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'400beac0-c768-4434-acdb-812b6c11f4e1\', \'multiverseId\': 514248}, \'multiverseid\': 514248}, {\'name\': \'Titan daemogoth\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Titan daemogoth attaque ou bloque, sacrifiez une créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "« Bien sûr qu\'il vous a offert la puissance. C\'est ce que font les démons. Mais faites-moi confiance ; plus l\'offre est alléchante, plus le prix à payer est exorbitant. »\\n—Professeur Onyx", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514539&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f78abae-5207-412e-af50-7dd0485c5b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 514539}, \'multiverseid\': 514539}, {\'name\': \'Daemogoth Titano\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Daemogoth Titano attacca o blocca, sacrifica una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'"Certo che ti ha offerto il potere. Tutti i demoni lo fanno. Ma credimi, più dolce è il premio, più caro è il prezzo."\\n—Professoressa Onyx\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9264dff-8460-4da1-af40-4868e4cd262a\', \'multiverseId\': 514830}, \'multiverseid\': 514830}, {\'name\': \'デーモゴスのタイタン\', \'text\': \'デーモゴスのタイタンが攻撃するかブロックするたび、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'「もちろんあれは力をくれるでしょう。悪魔はいつでもそう。でも、手に入るものが魅力的であればあるほど、代償は破滅的なものになるのよ。」\\n――オニキス教授\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70b730cb-24c7-4c52-b60f-83eca2edd200\', \'multiverseId\': 515121}, \'multiverseid\': 515121}, {\'name\': \'대모고스 거신\', \'text\': \'대모고스 거신이 공격 또는 방어할 때마다, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'"당연히 네게 힘을 제안했겠지. 악마들은 항상 그러니까. 하지만 날 믿어. 보상이 더 달콤할수록, 비용은 더 위험하니까."\\n—오닉스 교수\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c4b18a-4b7a-4b84-badf-042a592c4c7b\', \'multiverseId\': 515412}, \'multiverseid\': 515412}, {\'name\': \'Titã Demogodo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Titã Demogodo atacar ou bloquear, sacrifique uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'"É óbvio que ele lhe ofereceu poder. Demônios sempre fazem isso. Mas, acredite em mim. Quanto mais doce for o prêmio, mais terrível será o preço."\\n— Professora Ônix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a75c0d3-17cd-4616-bcb9-23a4dc4179d0\', \'multiverseId\': 515703}, \'multiverseid\': 515703}, {\'name\': \'Демогот-Титан\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Демогот-Титан атакует или блокирует, пожертвуйте существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'«Само собой, он пообещал тебе могущество. Демоны всегда так делают. Но поверь мне: чем слаще награда, тем губительнее цена».\\n— профессор Оникс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'572b63c6-eeed-4539-a063-df1a787217bb\', \'multiverseId\': 515994}, \'multiverseid\': 515994}, {\'name\': \'无丈魔泰坦\', \'text\': \'每当无丈魔泰坦进行攻击或阻挡时，牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'「它当然会赐予你力量。恶魔都如此。不过请听我一言～奖赏越甜美，代价越惨痛。」\\n～黑玉教授\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9b0b45-e823-4b0c-aab3-21eb2e238802\', \'multiverseId\': 516285}, \'multiverseid\': 516285}, {\'name\': \'無丈魔泰坦\', \'text\': \'每當無丈魔泰坦進行攻擊或阻擋時，犧牲一個生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'「他當然會賜予你力量。惡魔都如此。不過請聽我一言～獎賞越甜美，代價越慘痛。」\\n～黑玉教授\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a44b4e2-b3d5-49cd-851d-51ae89ebf820\', \'multiverseId\': 516576}, \'multiverseid\': 516576}]', "[{'name': 'Dämogoth-Titan', 'text': 'Immer wenn der Dämogoth-Titan angreift oder blockt, opfere eine Kreatur.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dämon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517034&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0af3b310-c9f3-4004-922d-0903edd6eed5', 'multiverseId': 517034}, 'multiverseid': 517034}, {'name': 'Titán demogodo', 'text': 'Siempre que el Titán demogodo ataque o bloquee, sacrifica una criatura.', 'type': 'Criatura — Demonio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517129&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0665a007-6b0c-499f-8635-859f9df30850', 'multiverseId': 517129}, 'multiverseid': 517129}, {'name': 'Titan daemogoth', 'text': 'À chaque fois que le Titan daemogoth attaque ou bloque, sacrifiez une créature.', 'type': 'Créature : démon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517224&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3de4bd77-26b7-4fa4-8aa6-b60963b2007c', 'multiverseId': 517224}, 'multiverseid': 517224}, {'name': 'Daemogoth Titano', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta il Daemogoth Titano attacca o blocca, sacrifica una creatura.', 'type': 'Creatura — Demone', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517319&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '228f3f9d-18ae-4415-b794-361f035045c9', 'multiverseId': 517319}, 'multiverseid': 517319}, {'name': 'デーモゴスのタイタン', 'text': 'デーモゴスのタイタンが攻撃するかブロックするたび、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517414&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62a982e5-6a84-42b8-b07e-1a5efe655a73', 'multiverseId': 517414}, 'multiverseid': 517414}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516688&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82715563-4baa-4469-bdff-53a5197c11e6', 'multiverseId': 516688}, 'multiverseid': 516688}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516698&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4148791d-903e-49be-86bc-6efb1a0b713a', 'multiverseId': 516698}, 'multiverseid': 516698}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516708&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9249f26a-b123-4785-9de2-8ec12d3a2d17', 'multiverseId': 516708}, 'multiverseid': 516708}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516718&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c0f14db-4fc3-42dc-83f4-5529f8a6f4b7', 'multiverseId': 516718}, 'multiverseid': 516718}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516728&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a68a436-ce83-4804-984f-35a223da3043', 'multiverseId': 516728}, 'multiverseid': 516728}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516738&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f67f7c2a-f7ab-4cc9-8e5b-ed0bcd60bd9d', 'multiverseId': 516738}, 'multiverseid': 516738}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516748&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd40975c9-c42d-4130-a671-1c17eeb2933f', 'multiverseId': 516748}, 'multiverseid': 516748}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516758&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21799b60-51a4-48a2-80fd-ed4f24f62e51', 'multiverseId': 516758}, 'multiverseid': 516758}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516768&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37fc429d-ff69-46e2-aed0-d0fbfeef0b61', 'multiverseId': 516768}, 'multiverseid': 516768}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516778&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2149a262-994b-44e5-abbd-bea6ea8486a2', 'multiverseId': 516778}, 'multiverseid': 516778}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516689&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6c20142-0722-45d8-a5a7-9a4835841081', 'multiverseId': 516689}, 'multiverseid': 516689}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516699&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea18eb11-79b6-4f21-b1eb-6d5b1fd7b0c0', 'multiverseId': 516699}, 'multiverseid': 516699}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516709&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf805e26-c86d-4ca8-9c3c-778f21765c7e', 'multiverseId': 516709}, 'multiverseid': 516709}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516719&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2c31d1f-0363-43cb-abdb-d8fea8a1d748', 'multiverseId': 516719}, 'multiverseid': 516719}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516729&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6de9e1e3-9803-4925-8ecc-96efd65bef3a', 'multiverseId': 516729}, 'multiverseid': 516729}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516739&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ede9e6f3-5480-4552-8c25-f1cc0e7e0ded', 'multiverseId': 516739}, 'multiverseid': 516739}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516749&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9564bd3-6382-4c3d-9c86-4d3b967a70bc', 'multiverseId': 516749}, 'multiverseid': 516749}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516759&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eab66ab4-f0d4-4a97-ace7-f103fe724bdb', 'multiverseId': 516759}, 'multiverseid': 516759}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516769&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9ab501f-9c92-4666-8f8a-6ec96c633655', 'multiverseId': 516769}, 'multiverseid': 516769}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516779&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1868c4a-2610-413e-9f55-833413a5937c', 'multiverseId': 516779}, 'multiverseid': 516779}]", '[{\'name\': \'Egel-Fanatikerin\', \'text\': \'Solange es dein Zug ist, hat die Egel-Fanatikerin Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'„Alle glauben, dass Egel sich ausschließlich von Blut ernähren, aber tatsächlich sind die meisten Süßwasser-Egel Fleischfresser. Warte, wo willst du hin?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513843&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e99c277-dd96-4d7e-aab3-536785343129\', \'multiverseId\': 513843}, \'multiverseid\': 513843}, {\'name\': \'Fanática sanguijuela\', \'text\': \'Mientras sea tu turno, la Fanática sanguijuela tiene la habilidad de vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos creen que las sanguijuelas siguen una dieta sanguívora estricta, pero en realidad las de agua dulce son carnívoras. Eh, ¿a dónde vas?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a04340bd-747b-47b3-82d4-ba4d2854a909\', \'multiverseId\': 514134}, \'multiverseid\': 514134}, {\'name\': \'Fanatique des sangsues\', \'text\': "Tant que c\'est votre tour, la Fanatique des sangsues a le lien de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': "« Tout le monde pense que les sangsues ont un régime strictement sanguinovore, mais en fait, la plupart des sangsues d\'eau douce sont carnivores. Attends, où vas-tu ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514425&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27a73bd6-ba95-45c6-9713-289dc9e80548\', \'multiverseId\': 514425}, \'multiverseid\': 514425}, {\'name\': \'Fanatica Sanguisuga\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che è il tuo turno, la Fanatica Sanguisuga ha legame vitale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutti pensano che le sanguisughe abbiano una dieta strettamente sanguivora, ma in effetti quelle d\\\'acqua dolce sono per lo più carnivore. Aspetta, dove stai andando?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc740d1e-45c5-462d-b037-1f8265e646cf\', \'multiverseId\': 514716}, \'multiverseid\': 514716}, {\'name\': \'ヒルの狂信者\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンであるかぎり、ヒルの狂信者は絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「ヒルの食餌は吸血だけだと思われているけれど、淡水生のヒルは大抵肉食なのよ。待って、どこへ行くの？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0de4a3ea-231e-49df-8485-cb75a971c7be\', \'multiverseId\': 515007}, \'multiverseid\': 515007}, {\'name\': \'거머리 광신자\', \'text\': \'당신의 턴인 한, 거머리 광신자는 생명연결을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 흑마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"모두들 거머리가 엄격하게 흡혈성 식단을 유지한다고 생각하지만, 사실 대부분의 민물 거머리는 육식동물이야. 잠깐만, 어딜 가는 거지?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcd38c5d-b070-4eac-9f64-df634dba6578\', \'multiverseId\': 515298}, \'multiverseid\': 515298}, {\'name\': \'Fanática das Sanguessugas\', \'text\': \'Enquanto for o seu turno, Fanática das Sanguessugas terá vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Bruxo\', \'flavor\': \'"Todo mundo pensa que as sanguessugas se alimentam apenas de sangue, mas, na verdade, a maioria das sanguessugas de água doce é carnívora. Espere, onde você está indo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8a1bace-2278-488d-b8e2-20c4683b4938\', \'multiverseId\': 515589}, \'multiverseid\': 515589}, {\'name\': \'Неистовая Иссушительница\', \'text\': \'Пока длится ваш ход, Неистовая Иссушительница имеет Цепь жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Колдун\', \'flavor\': \'«Все думают, что пиявки питаются исключительно кровью, но на самом деле большинство пресноводных пиявок — плотоядные. Погоди, куда же ты?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'299ba655-e9ee-4cef-b2f6-631c1ca9bc44\', \'multiverseId\': 515880}, \'multiverseid\': 515880}, {\'name\': \'弄蛭狂徒\', \'text\': \'只要是在你的回合中，弄蛭狂徒便具有系命异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'「所有人都以为蚂蟥仅摄食血液，但实际上大多数的淡水水蛭也具有肉食习性。等等，你们怎么都走了？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac8ea181-90af-4759-b682-4367e3f87466\', \'multiverseId\': 516171}, \'multiverseid\': 516171}, {\'name\': \'弄蛭狂徒\', \'text\': \'只要是在你的回合中，弄蛭狂徒便具有繫命異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「所有人都以為螞蟥僅攝食血液，但實際上大多數的淡水水蛭也具有肉食習性。等等，你們怎麼都走了？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d8f5f9f-f0f9-431f-9ca6-270b617f3349\', \'multiverseId\': 516462}, \'multiverseid\': 516462}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ehrentroll\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nFalls du Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten würdest, erhältst du stattdessen so viele Lebenspunkte plus 1 dazu.\\nDer Ehrentroll erhält +2/+1, solange du 25 oder mehr Lebenspunkte hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Troll, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Er ist der erste seines Stammes in Strixhaven, und gleich Jahrgangsbester.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddcb0f77-b4ce-4075-974d-89c2557887eb\', \'multiverseId\': 513902}, \'multiverseid\': 513902}, {\'name\': \'Trol sobresaliente\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSi fueras a ganar vidas, en vez de eso, ganas esa cantidad de vidas más 1.\\nEl Trol sobresaliente obtiene +2/+1 mientras tengas 25 o más vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida trol\', \'flavor\': \'El primero de su clan en ir a Strixhaven y ahora el primero de su clase.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2b291b-ed14-4b80-b925-95ec9098caf3\', \'multiverseId\': 514193}, \'multiverseid\': 514193}, {\'name\': \'Troll diplômé\', \'text\': \'Vigilance\\nSi vous deviez gagner des points de vie, vous gagnez ce nombre de points de vie plus 1 à la place.\\nLe Troll diplômé gagne +2/+1 tant que vous avez au moins 25 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : troll et druide\', \'flavor\': "Premier de son clan à étudier à Strixhaven, et aujourd\'hui le premier de sa classe.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514484&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc894f02-418e-48da-9e25-5f7b21ffea55\', \'multiverseId\': 514484}, \'multiverseid\': 514484}, {\'name\': "Troll d\'Onore", \'text\': "Cautela\\nSe stai per guadagnare punti vita, ne guadagni invece altrettanti più 1.\\nIl Troll d\'Onore prende +2/+1 fintanto che hai 25 o più punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Troll\', \'flavor\': \'Primo del suo clan a frequentare Strixhaven, ora primo della sua classe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e9a7d42-1c26-407f-933a-67413eee49f8\', \'multiverseId\': 514775}, \'multiverseid\': 514775}, {\'name\': \'優等生トロール\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nあなたがライフを得るなら、代わりにあなたはその点数に１を足した点数のライフを得る。\\nあなたのライフが25点以上であるかぎり、優等生トロールは＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トロール・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'部族で初めてストリクスヘイヴンに入学し、今はクラスで主席になった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5c71b54-11dc-48d7-8901-a4367575e066\', \'multiverseId\': 515066}, \'multiverseid\': 515066}, {\'name\': \'명예로운 트롤\', \'text\': \'경계\\n당신이 생명점을 얻으려 한다면, 대신 그 수에 1을 더한 만큼 생명점을 얻는다.\\n당신의 생명점이 25점 이상인 한, 명예로운 트롤은 +2/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 트롤 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'그의 부족에서 스트릭스헤이븐에 온 최초의 인물이자, 지금은 반에서 일등이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34aed7e2-a8d1-4ae7-919e-e0e1cf000a91\', \'multiverseId\': 515357}, \'multiverseid\': 515357}, {\'name\': \'Trol de Honra\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nSe você ganharia pontos de vida, em vez disso, você ganha aquela quantidade de pontos de vida mais 1.\\nTrol de Honra receberá +2/+1 enquanto você tiver 25 ou mais pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trol Druida\', \'flavor\': \'O primeiro de seu clã a entrar em Strixhaven e agora o primeiro de sua turma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df955601-d625-4224-9eaa-d066336a9aa0\', \'multiverseId\': 515648}, \'multiverseid\': 515648}, {\'name\': \'Тролль с Отличием\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nЕсли вы должны получить жизнь(-и), вы получаете такое же количество жизней плюс 1 вместо этого.\\nТролль с Отличием получает +2/+1, пока у вас 25 или больше жизней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тролль Друид\', \'flavor\': \'Он первым в своем клане попал в Стриксхейвен, а теперь стал первым учеником в классе.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aabdfff-bfff-4c15-a4fd-0c4011596674\', \'multiverseId\': 515939}, \'multiverseid\': 515939}, {\'name\': \'求誉巨魔\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n如果你将获得生命，则改为你获得原数量加1点生命。\\n只要你的总生命为25或更多，荣誉巨魔便得+2/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨魔／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'他是曾是该部落第一位入学斯翠海文的巨魔，如今更是班上第一名。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'784d61f5-6c16-42f5-b25a-446b6d979a13\', \'multiverseId\': 516230}, \'multiverseid\': 516230}, {\'name\': \'求譽巨魔\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n如果你將獲得生命，則改為你獲得原數量加1點生命。\\n只要你的總生命為25或更多，求譽巨魔便得+2/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨魔／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'他曾是該部落第一位入學斯翠海文的巨魔，如今更是班上第一名。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e485f93-887e-4973-8030-00f97382911b\', \'multiverseId\': 516521}, \'multiverseid\': 516521}]', "[{'name': 'Ehrwürdige Kriegssängerin', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn die Ehrwürdige Kriegssängerin einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Schadenspunkten ist, die die Ehrwürdige Kriegssängerin jenem Spieler zugefügt hat.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Geist, Kleriker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514029&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b37b72b1-3022-4bd1-ab76-3db21232d56e', 'multiverseId': 514029}, 'multiverseid': 514029}, {'name': 'Cantaguerras venerada', 'text': 'Vigilancia, arrolla.\\nSiempre que la Cantaguerras venerada haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes regresar la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de X o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla, donde X es la cantidad de daño que la Cantaguerras venerada hizo a ese jugador.', 'type': 'Criatura — Clérigo espíritu', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514320&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d19587d-ccf1-4997-b977-6b3e462817c6', 'multiverseId': 514320}, 'multiverseid': 514320}, {'name': 'Vénérable chanteguerre', 'text': 'Vigilance, piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que le Vénérable chanteguerre inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X depuis votre cimetière, X étant le nombre de blessures que le Vénérable chanteguerre a infligé à ce joueur.', 'type': 'Créature : esprit et clerc', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514611&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05432f8b-6682-4ce0-9e7d-ca8ed015f47b', 'multiverseId': 514611}, 'multiverseid': 514611}, {'name': 'Cantaguerra Venerabile', 'text': 'Cautela, travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta la Cantaguerra Venerabile infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X, dove X sono i danni che la Cantaguerra Venerabile ha inflitto a quel giocatore.', 'type': 'Creatura — Chierico Spirito', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514902&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25e05e1a-7f89-458e-a506-50bf2966a639', 'multiverseId': 514902}, 'multiverseid': 514902}, {'name': '尊い戦歌い', 'text': '警戒、トランプル\\n尊い戦歌いがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたの墓地からマナ総量がＸ以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。Ｘは、尊い戦歌いがそのプレイヤーに与えたダメージの点数に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット・クレリック', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515193&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34a2ca9b-ab56-4108-94a0-208cf4937726', 'multiverseId': 515193}, 'multiverseid': 515193}, {'name': '덕망 있는 전쟁기원사', 'text': '경계, 돌진\\n덕망 있는 전쟁기원사가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신의 무덤에 있는 마나 값이 X이하인 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌릴 수 있다. X는 덕망 있는 전쟁기원사가 그 플레이어에게 입힌 피해의 양이다.', 'type': '생물 — 신령 성직자', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515484&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24d97385-009e-4607-bcfa-7378d881da23', 'multiverseId': 515484}, 'multiverseid': 515484}, {'name': 'Belicantora Venerável', 'text': 'Vigilância, atropelar\\nToda vez que Belicantora Venerável causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode devolver o card de criatura alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X de seu cemitério ao campo de batalha, sendo X a quantidade de dano que Belicantora Venerável causou àquele jogador.', 'type': 'Criatura — Espírito Clérigo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515775&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95417c66-f046-401a-ac65-97ecda6be797', 'multiverseId': 515775}, 'multiverseid': 515775}, {'name': 'Почтенная Певица Войны', 'text': 'Бдительность, Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Почтенная Певица Войны наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы можете вернуть целевую карту существа с мановой ценностью не более X из вашего кладбища на поле битвы, где X — количество повреждений, нанесенных Почтенной Певицей Войны тому игроку.', 'type': 'Существо — Дух Священник', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516066&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd74a6f4-5d22-427b-baa7-ad08c8d5145c', 'multiverseId': 516066}, 'multiverseid': 516066}, {'name': '可敬颂战僧', 'text': '警戒，践踏\\n每当可敬颂战僧对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以将目标法术力值等于或小于X的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，X为可敬颂战僧对该牌手造成的伤害数量。', 'type': '生物 ～精怪／僧侣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516357&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3117a95-377e-4e50-893c-10192d800f44', 'multiverseId': 516357}, 'multiverseid': 516357}, {'name': '可敬頌戰僧', 'text': '警戒，踐踏\\n每當可敬頌戰僧對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，你可以將目標魔法力值等於或小於X的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場，X為可敬頌戰僧對該玩家造成的傷害數量。', 'type': '生物 ～精靈／僧侶', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516648&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38a2e865-e207-455a-aa60-e102b4ffdc11', 'multiverseId': 516648}, 'multiverseid': 516648}]", "[{'name': 'Ehrwürdige Kriegssängerin', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn die Ehrwürdige Kriegssängerin einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Schadenspunkten ist, die die Ehrwürdige Kriegssängerin jenem Spieler zugefügt hat.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Geist, Kleriker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517050&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79549899-5bf9-491f-ab23-2dbe285aa023', 'multiverseId': 517050}, 'multiverseid': 517050}, {'name': 'Cantaguerras venerada', 'text': 'Vigilancia, arrolla.\\nSiempre que la Cantaguerras venerada haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes regresar la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de X o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla, donde X es la cantidad de daño que la Cantaguerras venerada hizo a ese jugador.', 'type': 'Criatura — Clérigo espíritu', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517145&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34b9456f-1935-4dda-a6c2-4e7cd114dbe4', 'multiverseId': 517145}, 'multiverseid': 517145}, {'name': 'Vénérable chanteguerre', 'text': 'Vigilance, piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que le Vénérable chanteguerre inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X depuis votre cimetière, X étant le nombre de blessures que le Vénérable chanteguerre a infligé à ce joueur.', 'type': 'Créature : esprit et clerc', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517240&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c502de8f-5740-40ea-97f2-c2070b5457f6', 'multiverseId': 517240}, 'multiverseid': 517240}, {'name': 'Cantaguerra Venerabile', 'text': 'Cautela, travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta la Cantaguerra Venerabile infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X, dove X sono i danni che la Cantaguerra Venerabile ha inflitto a quel giocatore.', 'type': 'Creatura — Chierico Spirito', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517335&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0c58177-8e37-4134-a3d9-fea8408751e6', 'multiverseId': 517335}, 'multiverseid': 517335}, {'name': '尊い戦歌い', 'text': '警戒、トランプル\\n尊い戦歌いがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたの墓地からマナ総量がＸ以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。Ｘは、尊い戦歌いがそのプレイヤーに与えたダメージの点数に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット・クレリック', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517430&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6643b3c-3510-4ae9-839e-8c445549ac73', 'multiverseId': 517430}, 'multiverseid': 517430}]", '[{\'name\': \'Einführung in die Vernichtung\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher zieht eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei — Lektion\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe noch nie eine Studentin so spektakulär scheitern sehen. Das hat Potenzial."\\n—Hostram, Professor für Arkanochemie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513770&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91417896-3e13-420b-8851-1a5ba01d570d\', \'multiverseId\': 513770}, \'multiverseid\': 513770}, {\'name\': \'Fundamentos de aniquilación\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Su controlador roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro — Lección\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca vi a un estudiante fracasar de forma tan estrepitosa. Tiene potencial".\\n—Hóstram, profesor de arcanoquímica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89bf1b7f-fca8-4d82-b0df-e77fde07569e\', \'multiverseId\': 514061}, \'multiverseid\': 514061}, {\'name\': "Introduction à l\'annihilation", \'text\': \'Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé. Son contrôleur pioche une carte.\', \'type\': \'Rituel : leçon\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'ai jamais vu un étudiant échouer d\'une façon aussi spectaculaire. Un véritable potentiel à exploiter. »\\n—Hostram, professeur d\'arcanochimie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514352&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ab8d98f-13c3-4269-aa6d-73580e453200\', \'multiverseId\': 514352}, \'multiverseid\': 514352}, {\'name\': \'Introduzione allo Sterminio\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio. Il suo controllore pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria — Lezione\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ho mai visto uno studente fallire in modo così spettacolare. Ha del potenziale."\\n—Hostram, professore di arcanochimica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb01e37-6c88-4d41-984c-842ce6d34fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 514643}, \'multiverseid\': 514643}, {\'name\': \'殲滅学入門\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。それのコントローラーはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー — 講義\', \'flavor\': \'「これほど驚天動地な失敗をする生徒は見たことがない。素晴らしい才能を感じるよ。」\\n――秘儀化学の教授、ホストラム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0f1c03a-58d5-4700-a666-b8a6e0e6a11f\', \'multiverseId\': 514934}, \'multiverseid\': 514934}, {\'name\': \'절멸 개론\', \'text\': \'대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방한다. 그 지속물의 조종자는 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법 — 수업\', \'flavor\': \'"이렇도록 멋지게 실패하는 학생은 본 적이 없군. 바로 거기에서 잠재력이 보여."\\n—비전화학 교수, 호스트람\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f037ac6a-b24a-4514-9277-1f06709e430d\', \'multiverseId\': 515225}, \'multiverseid\': 515225}, {\'name\': \'Introdução à Aniquilação\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo não de terreno. Seu controlador compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço — Lição\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca vi um aluno falhar de forma tão estrondosa. Vejo potencial nisso."\\n— Hostram, professor de arcanoquímica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef18aaf8-23ba-41ca-9168-b7554b985802\', \'multiverseId\': 515516}, \'multiverseid\': 515516}, {\'name\': \'Введение в Изничтожение\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент. Контролирующий его игрок берет карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство — Урок\', \'flavor\': \'«В первый раз вижу у студента такой грандиозный провал. В этом есть большой потенциал».\\n— Хострам, профессор чарохимии\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41198ce8-31da-4f41-ad40-29543bbcce4d\', \'multiverseId\': 515807}, \'multiverseid\': 515807}, {\'name\': \'毁灭学导论\', \'text\': \'放逐目标非地永久物。其操控者抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术 ～课程\', \'flavor\': \'「我从没见过哪个学生就连失败也如此壮观。但有潜力暗藏其间。」\\n～神奥化学教授霍斯东\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebbb64a0-75d0-4189-a0ed-2b452139ebbc\', \'multiverseId\': 516098}, \'multiverseid\': 516098}, {\'name\': \'毀滅學導論\', \'text\': \'放逐目標非地永久物。其操控者抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術 ～課程\', \'flavor\': \'「我從沒見過哪個學生就連失敗也如此壯觀。但有潛力暗藏其間。」\\n～神奧化學教授霍斯東\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df8219f8-f634-4e26-b7cd-57ec2fceaa72\', \'multiverseId\': 516389}, \'multiverseid\': 516389}]', "[{'name': 'Einführung in die Wahrsagerei', 'text': 'Hellsicht 2, ziehe dann eine Karte.', 'type': 'Hexerei — Lektion', 'flavor': 'Die Abschlussnoten werden am ersten Unterrichtstag veröffentlicht.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513771&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e127a544-9f35-419d-bfc9-b5480e68941c', 'multiverseId': 513771}, 'multiverseid': 513771}, {'name': 'Fundamentos de profecía', 'text': 'Adivina 2, luego roba una carta.', 'type': 'Conjuro — Lección', 'flavor': 'Las notas finales se publican el primer día de clase.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514062&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd96e4345-730e-4c80-938c-d36640c4ee6f', 'multiverseId': 514062}, 'multiverseid': 514062}, {'name': 'Introduction à la prophétie', 'text': 'Regard 2, puis piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Rituel : leçon', 'flavor': 'Les résultats des examens sont affichés le premier jour de cours.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514353&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c7cd81a-0e29-4582-8750-78b590295e64', 'multiverseId': 514353}, 'multiverseid': 514353}, {'name': 'Introduzione alla Profezia', 'text': 'Profetizza 2, poi pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Stregoneria — Lezione', 'flavor': 'I voti finali vengono inviati il primo giorno di lezione.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514644&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddbfdbb1-85f7-4b8f-86a2-cea6b26fb9d5', 'multiverseId': 514644}, 'multiverseid': 514644}, {'name': '予言学入門', 'text': '占術２を行い、その後カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー — 講義', 'flavor': '最終成績は授業の初日に張り出される。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514935&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cda86ec9-0c5a-4381-8d91-10b38ab207e9', 'multiverseId': 514935}, 'multiverseid': 514935}, {'name': '예언 개론', 'text': '점술 2를 한 후, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '집중마법 — 수업', 'flavor': '최종 성적이 수업 첫날에 게시된다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515226&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b550b83b-bc32-4306-b653-b8f17e216517', 'multiverseId': 515226}, 'multiverseid': 515226}, {'name': 'Introdução à Profecia', 'text': 'Use vidência 2 e depois compre um card.', 'type': 'Feitiço — Lição', 'flavor': 'As notas finais são divulgadas no primeiro dia de aula.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515517&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f97aa038-2cd1-41f4-997f-13e7a46169e8', 'multiverseId': 515517}, 'multiverseid': 515517}, {'name': 'Введение в Пророчества', 'text': 'Предскажите 2, затем возьмите карту.', 'type': 'Волшебство — Урок', 'flavor': 'Итоговые оценки вывешиваются в первый день занятий.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515808&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31ce2322-945c-400f-b2ac-14ce36f5adff', 'multiverseId': 515808}, 'multiverseid': 515808}, {'name': '预言学导论', 'text': '占卜2，然后抓一张牌。', 'type': '法术 ～课程', 'flavor': '在开学第一天，就张榜公布了所有学生的期末成绩。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516099&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16720fbd-b1b3-4772-b359-a9295c42bd37', 'multiverseId': 516099}, 'multiverseid': 516099}, {'name': '預言學導論', 'text': '占卜2，然後抽一張牌。', 'type': '巫術 ～課程', 'flavor': '在開學第一天，就張榜公佈了所有學生的期末成績。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516390&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4688621c-9d41-4fdf-86b0-2d1761d54e36', 'multiverseId': 516390}, 'multiverseid': 516390}]", '[{\'name\': \'Elementarbeschwörung\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 4/4 blauen und roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei — Lektion\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast Wellen geschlagen. Jetzt will ich eine Sintflut sehen."\\n—Uvilda, Dekanin der Prismari-Fakultät\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513966&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1548461-675c-4cf8-912d-8117e4b0fc9f\', \'multiverseId\': 513966}, \'multiverseid\': 513966}, {\'name\': \'Invocación elemental\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Elemental azul y roja 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro — Lección\', \'flavor\': \'"Recibió un mar de aplausos, pero ahora quiero un mar de verdad".\\n—Uvilda, decana de Prismari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5f6394f-40dd-4a4f-a123-c758e67049f9\', \'multiverseId\': 514257}, \'multiverseid\': 514257}, {\'name\': \'Invocation élémentaire\', \'text\': \'Créez un jeton de créature 4/4 bleue et rouge Élémental.\', \'type\': \'Rituel : leçon\', \'flavor\': \'« Belle éclaboussure. Maintenant, je veux voir un torrent. »\\n—Uvilda, doyenne de Prismari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514548&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb06868f-3669-46a4-a456-0f1274306bf8\', \'multiverseId\': 514548}, \'multiverseid\': 514548}, {\'name\': "Evocazione dell\'Elementale", \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Elementale 4/4 blu e rossa.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria — Lezione\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo era uno schizzo. Ora mostrami un fiume."\\n—Uvilda, decana di Prismari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb8eb56d-e991-4273-aeb1-a19a153186e8\', \'multiverseId\': 514839}, \'multiverseid\': 514839}, {\'name\': \'精霊召喚学\', \'text\': \'青赤の４/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー — 講義\', \'flavor\': \'「飛沫はもう見ました。今度は奔流を見せてください。」\\n――プリズマリの学部長、ユヴィルダ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8ad9fc9-c1f7-4d03-b70d-93538c202a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 515130}, \'multiverseid\': 515130}, {\'name\': \'정령 소환\', \'text\': \'4/4 청색 및 적색 정령 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법 — 수업\', \'flavor\': \'"파문은 만들어냈군. 이번에는 격류를 보여 줘."\\n—프리즈마리 학장, 우빌다\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b720b33-b757-4dd3-bf99-0002fcb36661\', \'multiverseId\': 515421}, \'multiverseid\': 515421}, {\'name\': \'Invocação Elemental\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura Elemental azul e vermelha 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço — Lição\', \'flavor\': \'"Você fez um borrifo. Agora mostre-me uma torrente."\\n— Uvilda, decana de Prismari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'029ffbc2-d263-42d9-9de3-512b41ae1e12\', \'multiverseId\': 515712}, \'multiverseid\': 515712}, {\'name\': \'Призыв Элементаля\', \'text\': \'Создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 синий и красный Элементаль.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство — Урок\', \'flavor\': \'«У тебя получился всплеск. А теперь покажи мне поток».\\n— Увильда, декан Призмари\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9438b42f-da66-44da-a46d-b284fe6e946d\', \'multiverseId\': 516003}, \'multiverseid\': 516003}, {\'name\': \'元素召唤术\', \'text\': \'派出一个4/4，蓝红双色的元素衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术 ～课程\', \'flavor\': \'「你已能溅起水花。现在让我看看水流。」\\n～粹丽院长乌薇妲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25e4b072-ce49-41b6-9901-cda32f065cad\', \'multiverseId\': 516294}, \'multiverseid\': 516294}, {\'name\': \'元素召喚術\', \'text\': \'派出一個4/4，藍紅雙色的元素衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術 ～課程\', \'flavor\': \'「你已能濺起水花。現在讓我看看水流。」\\n～粹麗院長烏薇妲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a564aa2a-b464-4cca-8948-d953656c0f8b\', \'multiverseId\': 516585}, \'multiverseid\': 516585}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elementarer Expressionist\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält sie „Falls diese Kreatur das Spiel verlassen würde, schicke sie ins Exil, anstatt sie irgendwo anders hinzulegen" und „Wenn du diese Kreatur ins Exil schickst, erzeuge einen 4/4 blauen und roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein." (Jedes Vorkommen der Fähigkeit wird einzeln ausgelöst.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7f8f56-657b-40d6-982b-5c8e0de908e3\', \'multiverseId\': 513964}, \'multiverseid\': 513964}, {\'name\': \'Expresionista elemental\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, elige una criatura objetivo que controlas. Hasta el final del turno, gana "Si esta criatura fuera a dejar el campo de batalla, exíliala en vez de ponerla en cualquier otro lado" y "Cuando exilies esta criatura, crea una ficha de criatura Elemental azul y roja 4/4". (Cada copia de esa habilidad se dispara por separado.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58028d8b-6fd6-4921-ad08-64d6099c6ff4\', \'multiverseId\': 514255}, \'multiverseid\': 514255}, {\'name\': \'Expressionniste élémentaire\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, choisissez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, elle acquiert « Si cette créature devait quitter le champ de bataille, exilez-la à la place de la mettre autre part » et « Quand vous exilez cette créature, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 bleue et rouge Élémental ». (Chaque occurrence de cette capacité se déclenche séparément.)", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514546&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f92d1f-e002-4fc4-9b22-8b301640b004\', \'multiverseId\': 514546}, \'multiverseid\': 514546}, {\'name\': \'Espressionista Elementale\', \'text\': \'Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, scegli una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Fino alla fine del turno, ha "Se questa creatura sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia, esiliala invece di metterla in qualsiasi altra zona" e "Quando esili questa creatura, crea una pedina creatura Elementale 4/4 blu e rossa". (Ogni istanza di quella abilità si innesca separatamente.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c623337e-fd8f-44c1-9fda-3276a6511e77\', \'multiverseId\': 514837}, \'multiverseid\': 514837}, {\'name\': \'精霊表現者\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは「このクリーチャーが戦場を離れるなら、これを戦場以外に置く代わりに追放する。」と「あなたがこのクリーチャーを追放したとき、青赤の４/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。」を得る。（その能力はそれぞれに誘発する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'772b83e2-8ab5-459c-8b3e-3c33c2aac5bb\', \'multiverseId\': 515128}, \'multiverseid\': 515128}, {\'name\': \'정령 표현주의자\', \'text\': \'마도제작술 — 당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동하거나 복사할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지, 그 생물은 "이 생물이 전장을 떠나려 하면, 대신 이 생물을 다른 곳에 놓는 대신 추방한다." 및 "당신이 이 생물을 추방할 때, 4/4 청색 및 적색 정령 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다."를 얻는다. (그 능력은 개별적으로 격발된다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 오크 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1c1aace-b245-4176-8b4d-f0fc0fe422da\', \'multiverseId\': 515419}, \'multiverseid\': 515419}, {\'name\': \'Expressionista Elemental\', \'text\': \'Magifício — Toda vez que você conjurar ou copiar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, escolha a criatura alvo que você controla. Até o final do turno, ela ganha "Se esta criatura for deixar o campo de batalha, exile-a em vez de colocá-la em qualquer outro lugar" e "Quando você exilar esta criatura, crie uma ficha de criatura Elemental azul e vermelha 4/4." (Cada ocorrência daquela habilidade é desencadeada separadamente.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Orc Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53a28617-f616-42a4-b362-fdcf3b71076b\', \'multiverseId\': 515710}, \'multiverseid\': 515710}, {\'name\': \'Выразитель Стихий\', \'text\': \'Чародейство — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете или копируете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, выберите целевое существо под вашим контролем. До конца хода оно получает способности «Если это существо должно покинуть поле битвы, изгоните его вместо того, чтобы поместить в какую-либо другую зону» и «Когда вы изгоняете это существо, создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 синий и красный Элементаль». (Каждый экземпляр той способности срабатывает отдельно.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Орк Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08a0d38c-e2f1-4d97-bf07-d0ce65df5476\', \'multiverseId\': 516001}, \'multiverseid\': 516001}, {\'name\': \'元素展现家\', \'text\': \'魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，选择目标由你操控的生物。直到回合结束，它获得「如果此生物将离开战场，则改为将它放逐，而非置入其他区域」与「当你放逐此生物时，派出一个4/4，蓝红双色的元素衍生生物。」（每个该异能都会分别触发。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半兽人／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c89ca611-1a1b-46d6-81d2-9b9bbd640ad6\', \'multiverseId\': 516292}, \'multiverseid\': 516292}, {\'name\': \'元素展現家\', \'text\': \'魔藝～每當你施放或複製瞬間或巫術咒語時，選擇目標由你操控的生物。直到回合結束，它獲得「如果此生物將離開戰場，則改為將它放逐，而非置入其他區域」與「當你放逐此生物時，派出一個4/4，藍紅雙色的元素衍生生物。」（每個該異能都會分別觸發。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半獸人／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'994bb201-5dca-4aac-bd8a-1ea0a93809c8\', \'multiverseId\': 516583}, \'multiverseid\': 516583}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elementarer Expressionist\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält sie „Falls diese Kreatur das Spiel verlassen würde, schicke sie ins Exil, anstatt sie irgendwo anders hinzulegen" und „Wenn du diese Kreatur ins Exil schickst, erzeuge einen 4/4 blauen und roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517037&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14418ad2-6db3-41fd-b25e-717ecbfae44c\', \'multiverseId\': 517037}, \'multiverseid\': 517037}, {\'name\': \'Expresionista elemental\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, elige una criatura objetivo que controlas. Hasta el final del turno, gana "Si esta criatura fuera a dejar el campo de batalla, exíliala en vez de ponerla en cualquier otro lado" y "Cuando exilies esta criatura, crea una ficha de criatura Elemental azul y roja 4/4".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b688348-c480-4814-a3bb-9bd687b1dad9\', \'multiverseId\': 517132}, \'multiverseid\': 517132}, {\'name\': \'Expressionniste élémentaire\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, choisissez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, elle acquiert « Si cette créature devait quitter le champ de bataille, exilez-la à la place de la mettre autre part » et « Quand vous exilez cette créature, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 bleue et rouge Élémental ».", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517227&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'420e4721-039e-4b15-a2a7-5e4d87c04a90\', \'multiverseId\': 517227}, \'multiverseid\': 517227}, {\'name\': \'Espressionista Elementale\', \'text\': \'Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, scegli una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Fino alla fine del turno, ha "Se questa creatura sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia, esiliala invece di metterla in qualsiasi altra zona" e "Quando esili questa creatura, crea una pedina creatura Elementale 4/4 blu e rossa".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88297936-e7e1-4ca0-88d7-9b7332453d69\', \'multiverseId\': 517322}, \'multiverseid\': 517322}, {\'name\': \'精霊表現者\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは「このクリーチャーが戦場を離れるなら、これを戦場以外に置く代わりに追放する。」と「あなたがこのクリーチャーを追放したとき、青赤の４/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45af74c0-1a0c-483e-bb5f-2d31efdcca78\', \'multiverseId\': 517417}, \'multiverseid\': 517417}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elementares Meisterwerk\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge zwei 4/4 blaue und rote Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n{U/R}{U/R}, wirf das Elementare Meisterwerk ab: Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Rootha war ganz in ihrem Element.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbdc6c80-2c47-49a2-8523-477948ea0cd2\', \'multiverseId\': 513965}, \'multiverseid\': 513965}, {\'name\': \'Obra maestra elemental\', \'text\': \'Crea dos fichas de criatura Elemental azules y rojas 4/4.\\n{U/R}{U/R}, descartar la Obra maestra elemental: Crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las notas de Rootha estaban por las nubes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'303efd6e-7ea3-4b3f-909d-2d80aa88da46\', \'multiverseId\': 514256}, \'multiverseid\': 514256}, {\'name\': "Chef d\'œuvre élémentaire", \'text\': "Créez deux jetons de créature 4/4 bleue et rouge Élémental.\\n{U/R}{U/R}, défaussez-vous du Chef d\'œuvre élémentaire : Créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Rootha réussit très haut la main.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514547&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8893fbeb-e740-47c1-875d-42ce0bc06c64\', \'multiverseId\': 514547}, \'multiverseid\': 514547}, {\'name\': \'Capolavoro Elementale\', \'text\': \'Crea due pedine creatura Elementale 4/4 blu e rosse.\\n{U/R}{U/R}, Scarta il Capolavoro Elementale: Crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I voti di Rootha erano alti come i salti delle sue evocazioni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05301c1d-1dc9-4bb5-995d-9c8fd5217b4a\', \'multiverseId\': 514838}, \'multiverseid\': 514838}, {\'name\': \'精霊の傑作\', \'text\': \'青赤の４/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\n{U/R}{U/R}, 精霊の傑作を捨てる：宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ルーサはついにやり遂げた。命ある色彩が宙を舞った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2870342-0e69-46e0-92b3-fcb7633d8645\', \'multiverseId\': 515129}, \'multiverseid\': 515129}, {\'name\': \'정령 대작\', \'text\': \'4/4 청색 및 적색 정령 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\\n{U/R}{U/R}, 정령 대작을 버린다: 보물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. (보물 토큰은 "{T}, 이 마법물체를 희생한다: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다."를 가진 마법물체이다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'루타는 날아다니며 생동감 넘치는 색채들과 함께 지나갔다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d7e90b5-a638-4bb3-bf80-c203032693b8\', \'multiverseId\': 515420}, \'multiverseid\': 515420}, {\'name\': \'Obra-prima Elemental\', \'text\': \'Crie duas fichas de criatura Elemental azul e vermelha 4/4.\\n{U/R}{U/R}, descarte Obra-prima Elemental: Crie uma ficha de Tesouro. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Rootha foi aprovada com distinção e louvor eletrizantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de6594d8-7d8f-44c1-9105-ac39f0e384c7\', \'multiverseId\': 515711}, \'multiverseid\': 515711}, {\'name\': \'Стихийный Шедевр\', \'text\': \'Создайте две фишки существа 4/4 синий и красный Элементаль.\\n{U/R}{U/R}, сбросьте Стихийный Шедевр: создайте одну фишку Клада. (Это артефакт со способностью «{T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: добавьте одну ману любого цвета».)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Контрольная работы Руты была яркой, цветной — живой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb07818-f303-4397-a556-94e49ece6e13\', \'multiverseId\': 516002}, \'multiverseid\': 516002}, {\'name\': \'元素杰作\', \'text\': \'派出两个4/4，蓝红双色的元素衍生生物。\\n{U/R}{U/R}，弃掉元素杰作：派出一个珍宝衍生物。（珍宝衍生物是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'如莎以出色的优异成绩高分过关。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'316f4561-2057-41b0-a5f0-4456a0f47c4a\', \'multiverseId\': 516293}, \'multiverseid\': 516293}, {\'name\': \'元素傑作\', \'text\': \'派出兩個4/4，藍紅雙色的元素衍生生物。\\n{U/R}{U/R}，棄掉元素傑作：派出一個珍寶衍生物。（珍寶衍生物是具有「{T}，犧牲此神器：加一點任意顏色的魔法力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'如莎以出色的優異成績高分過關。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'586ed0b9-c842-4220-9022-e912884185a3\', \'multiverseId\': 516584}, \'multiverseid\': 516584}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elite-Spruchblocker\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Elite-Spruchblocker ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die Karten auf der Hand eines Gegners deiner Wahl an. Du kannst davon eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schicken. Solange die Karte im Exil ist, kann ihr Besitzer sie spielen. Ein Zauberspruch, der auf diese Weise gewirkt wird, kostet beim Wirken {2} mehr.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa, World Champion XXVI\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513785&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba6345b-de5f-48dd-95cd-e96945b9a7fd\', \'multiverseId\': 513785}, \'multiverseid\': 513785}, {\'name\': \'Atrapahechizos de élite\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Atrapahechizos de élite entre al campo de batalla, mira la mano del oponente objetivo. Puedes exiliar de ahí una carta que no sea tierra. Mientras esa carta permanezca exiliada, su propietario puede jugarla. Cuesta {2} más lanzar un hechizo lanzado de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa, campeón mundial XXVI\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'089bd012-e4a8-47e1-808f-5566272c3a00\', \'multiverseId\': 514076}, \'multiverseid\': 514076}, {\'name\': "Entrave-sort d\'élite", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Entrave-sort d\'élite arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez la main d\'un adversaire ciblé. Vous pouvez en exiler une carte non-terrain. Tant que cette carte reste exilée, son propriétaire peut la jouer. Un sort lancé de cette manière coûte {2} de plus à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa, Champion du Monde XXVI\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514367&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a715423d-a6d9-4819-a279-230c11e81ad9\', \'multiverseId\': 514367}, \'multiverseid\': 514367}, {\'name\': "Vincolamagie d\'Élite", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Vincolamagie d\'Élite entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda la mano di un avversario bersaglio. Puoi esiliare una carta non terra da quella mano. Fintanto che quella carta rimane esiliata, il suo proprietario può giocarla. Una magia lanciata in questo modo costa {2} in più per essere lanciata.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa, Campione del Mondo XXVI\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d687877-bcb4-40ca-ae34-193d135e0937\', \'multiverseId\': 514658}, \'multiverseid\': 514658}, {\'name\': \'精鋭呪文縛り\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n精鋭呪文縛りが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの手札を見る。あなたはその中から土地でないカード１枚を追放してもよい。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、それのオーナーはそれをプレイしてもよい。これにより呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}多くなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'第26回世界選手権王者、パウロ・ヴィター・ダモ・ダ・ロサ/Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b54b343-ee5c-4214-bd11-db4c48f7acab\', \'multiverseId\': 514949}, \'multiverseid\': 514949}, {\'name\': \'정예 주문구속자\', \'text\': \'비행\\n정예 주문구속자가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어의 손을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 대지가 아닌 카드 한 장을 추방할 수 있다. 그 카드가 추방된 채로 있는 한, 그 카드의 소유자는 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다. 이런 식으로 발동되는 주문은 발동하는 데 {2}가 더 든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa, World Champion XXVI\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa3cfd1e-473c-4be6-818f-a9367f06ac19\', \'multiverseId\': 515240}, \'multiverseid\': 515240}, {\'name\': \'Magilaçador de Elite\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Magilaçador de Elite entrar no campo de batalha, olhe a mão do oponente alvo. Você pode exilar um card não de terreno da mão dele. Enquanto aquele card permanecer exilado, seu dono poderá jogá-lo. Uma mágica conjurada desta forma custa {2} a mais para ser conjurada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa, XXVI Campeão Mundial\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc9c42e5-5571-4b55-83d5-9b22b6c0def5\', \'multiverseId\': 515531}, \'multiverseid\': 515531}, {\'name\': \'Элитный Связыватель Заклинаний\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Элитный Связыватель Заклинаний выходит на поле битвы, посмотрите руку целевого оппонента. Вы можете изгнать из нее не являющуюся землей карту. Пока та карта остается в изгнании, ее владелец может разыграть ее. Разыгрывание таким образом заклинаний стоит на {2} больше.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'Паулу Витор Даму-да-Росса, победитель XXVI Чемпионата мира\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f92fe15-480b-4da2-8f5a-06c5512c1838\', \'multiverseId\': 515822}, \'multiverseid\': 515822}, {\'name\': \'精英锁咒僧\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当精英锁咒僧进战场时，检视目标对手的手牌。你可以放逐其中一张非地牌。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，其拥有者可以使用之。以此法施放的咒语增加{2}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'第二十六届世界冠军Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a82aa236-9e30-40bc-b1d9-3472fa4f9f77\', \'multiverseId\': 516113}, \'multiverseid\': 516113}, {\'name\': \'精英鎖咒僧\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當精英鎖咒僧進戰場時，檢視目標對手的手牌。你可以放逐其中一張非地牌。於該牌持續放逐的時段內，其擁有者可以使用之。以此法施放的咒語增加{2}來施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'第二十六屆世界冠軍Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eb3d903-d2ea-460b-a5ba-6ac714dbe680\', \'multiverseId\': 516404}, \'multiverseid\': 516404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elite-Spruchblocker\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Elite-Spruchblocker ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die Karten auf der Hand eines Gegners deiner Wahl an. Du kannst davon eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schicken. Solange die Karte im Exil ist, kann ihr Besitzer sie spielen. Ein Zauberspruch, der auf diese Weise gewirkt wird, kostet beim Wirken {2} mehr.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa, World Champion XXVI\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'902a5c4c-2a64-42d7-b28e-df0114df1be9\', \'multiverseId\': 516971}, \'multiverseid\': 516971}, {\'name\': \'Atrapahechizos de élite\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Atrapahechizos de élite entre al campo de batalla, mira la mano del oponente objetivo. Puedes exiliar de ahí una carta que no sea tierra. Mientras esa carta permanezca exiliada, su propietario puede jugarla. Cuesta {2} más lanzar un hechizo lanzado de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa, campeón mundial XXVI\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcb9c419-8cf8-452c-a0e6-5cd7dfb85d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 517066}, \'multiverseid\': 517066}, {\'name\': "Entrave-sort d\'élite", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Entrave-sort d\'élite arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez la main d\'un adversaire ciblé. Vous pouvez en exiler une carte non-terrain. Tant que cette carte reste exilée, son propriétaire peut la jouer. Un sort lancé de cette manière coûte {2} de plus à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa, Champion du Monde XXVI\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40e1d7f2-bc58-482e-81f8-94673d4834b2\', \'multiverseId\': 517161}, \'multiverseid\': 517161}, {\'name\': "Vincolamagie d\'Élite", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Vincolamagie d\'Élite entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda la mano di un avversario bersaglio. Puoi esiliare una carta non terra da quella mano. Fintanto che quella carta rimane esiliata, il suo proprietario può giocarla. Una magia lanciata in questo modo costa {2} in più per essere lanciata.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa, Campione del Mondo XXVI\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f2d539e-274e-4867-886e-c36031e4388e\', \'multiverseId\': 517256}, \'multiverseid\': 517256}, {\'name\': \'精鋭呪文縛り\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n精鋭呪文縛りが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの手札を見る。あなたはその中から土地でないカード１枚を追放してもよい。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、それのオーナーはそれをプレイしてもよい。これにより呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}多くなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'第26回世界選手権王者、パウロ・ヴィター・ダモ・ダ・ロサ/Paulo Vitor Damo da Rosa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd02f3b-8066-434e-afcd-9a520a20f36e\', \'multiverseId\': 517351}, \'multiverseid\': 517351}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ende des Semesters\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen und/oder Planeswalkern deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil. Bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück. Jede davon kommt mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel, falls es eine Kreatur ist, bzw. mit einer zusätzlichen Loyalitätsmarke, falls es ein Planeswalker ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513795&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'958b1023-4614-4ff0-b202-e820d23de5fb\', \'multiverseId\': 513795}, \'multiverseid\': 513795}, {\'name\': \'Fin del semestre\', \'text\': \'Exilia cualquier cantidad de criaturas y/o planeswalkers objetivo que controlas. Al comienzo del próximo paso final, regresa cada una de ellas al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario. Cada una de ellas entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre ella si es una criatura y un contador de lealtad adicional sobre ella si es un planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc4d743a-bc11-4c8a-abe3-a24505ed7bb2\', \'multiverseId\': 514086}, \'multiverseid\': 514086}, {\'name\': \'Fin de semestre\', \'text\': "Exilez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures et/ou de planeswalkers ciblés que vous contrôlez. Au début de la prochaine étape de fin, renvoyez chacun d\'eux sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Chacun d\'eux arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur lui si c\'est une créature ou un marqueur « loyauté » sur lui si c\'est un planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514377&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'509c475e-1aee-44be-838a-0e80cdb77eca\', \'multiverseId\': 514377}, \'multiverseid\': 514377}, {\'name\': \'Fine del Semestre\', \'text\': "Esilia un qualsiasi numero di creature e/o planeswalker bersaglio che controlli. All\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale, rimetti ognuno di essi sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del rispettivo proprietario. Ognuno di essi entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale se è una creatura e un segnalino fedeltà addizionale se è un planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a001bab4-1921-4bea-b554-e9eecc073388\', \'multiverseId\': 514668}, \'multiverseid\': 514668}, {\'name\': \'学期の終わり\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーを対象とする。それらを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらをそれぞれオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。それらはそれぞれ、それがクリーチャーなら追加で＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で、それがプレインズウォーカーなら追加で忠誠カウンター１個が置かれた状態で、戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e91cd9af-5423-4216-8fee-8b61b65a31dd\', \'multiverseId\': 514959}, \'multiverseid\': 514959}, {\'name\': \'종강\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물 및/또는 플레인즈워커를 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 목표들을 추방한다. 다음 종료단 시작에, 추방된 각 카드들을 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다. 해당 카드들은 생물이면 +1/+1 카운터를 한 개를 추가로 가지고 전장에 들어오고 플레인즈워커면 충성 카운터 한 개를 추가로 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9ddd712-af17-41c6-a7da-c780075f6dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 515250}, \'multiverseid\': 515250}, {\'name\': \'Fim do Semestre\', \'text\': \'Exile qualquer número de criaturas e/ou planeswalkers alvo que você controle. No início da próxima etapa final, devolva cada um deles ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seus donos. Cada um deles entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 adicional se for uma criatura e com um marcador de lealdade adicional se for um planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c471e394-5f25-490b-828d-4961ae553436\', \'multiverseId\': 515541}, \'multiverseid\': 515541}, {\'name\': \'Конец Семестра\', \'text\': "Изгоните любое количество целевых существ и/или planeswalker\'ов под вашим контролем. В начале следующего заключительного шага верните каждую из тех карт на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца. Каждая из них выходит на поле битвы с одним дополнительным жетоном +1/+1 на ней, если это карта существа, и с одним дополнительным жетоном верности на ней, если это карта planeswalker\'а.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed412ab-36dc-402f-be63-5716e51019af\', \'multiverseId\': 515832}, \'multiverseid\': 515832}, {\'name\': \'学期结束\', \'text\': \'放逐任意数量目标由你操控的生物和／或鹏洛客。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它们各在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。于其进战场时，如果是生物，则上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物；如果是鹏洛客，则上面额外有一个忠诚指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa44d2d5-7e0e-46fe-b4f4-8ca369b562db\', \'multiverseId\': 516123}, \'multiverseid\': 516123}, {\'name\': \'學期結束\', \'text\': \'放逐任意數量目標由你操控的生物和／或鵬洛客。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它們各在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。於其進戰場時，如果是生物，則上面額外有一個+1/+1指示物；如果是鵬洛客，則上面額外有一個忠誠指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1756cef-f526-45d8-b46e-9da2c6b46092\', \'multiverseId\': 516414}, \'multiverseid\': 516414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ende des Semesters\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen und/oder Planeswalkern deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil. Bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück. Jede davon kommt mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel, falls es eine Kreatur ist, bzw. mit einer zusätzlichen Loyalitätsmarke, falls es ein Planeswalker ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32a5b49a-f13b-4cf6-81f1-31cae849078f\', \'multiverseId\': 516974}, \'multiverseid\': 516974}, {\'name\': \'Fin del semestre\', \'text\': \'Exilia cualquier cantidad de criaturas y/o planeswalkers objetivo que controlas. Al comienzo del próximo paso final, regresa cada una de ellas al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario. Cada una de ellas entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre ella si es una criatura y un contador de lealtad adicional sobre ella si es un planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b271ed96-22f2-4bed-b984-842316255a7b\', \'multiverseId\': 517069}, \'multiverseid\': 517069}, {\'name\': \'Fin de semestre\', \'text\': "Exilez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures et/ou de planeswalkers ciblés que vous contrôlez. Au début de la prochaine étape de fin, renvoyez chacun d\'eux sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Chacun d\'eux arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur lui si c\'est une créature ou un marqueur « loyauté » sur lui si c\'est un planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f84ee9-341c-4c30-8738-3737b2f62b7b\', \'multiverseId\': 517164}, \'multiverseid\': 517164}, {\'name\': \'Fine del Semestre\', \'text\': "Esilia un qualsiasi numero di creature e/o planeswalker bersaglio che controlli. All\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale, rimetti ognuno di essi sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del rispettivo proprietario. Ognuno di essi entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale se è una creatura e un segnalino fedeltà addizionale se è un planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cb997df-ff9d-4e05-b75f-9f6cc137a660\', \'multiverseId\': 517259}, \'multiverseid\': 517259}, {\'name\': \'学期の終わり\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーを対象とする。それらを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらをそれぞれオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。それらはそれぞれ、それがクリーチャーなら追加で＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で、それがプレインズウォーカーなら追加で忠誠カウンター１個が置かれた状態で、戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0549d527-454f-4cb7-8bb4-b21e40c052d2\', \'multiverseId\': 517354}, \'multiverseid\': 517354}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entschiedene Ablehnung\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\\n• Neutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {3}.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe genug gehört."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1240c2-0319-4363-b652-dc7494ce6b98\', \'multiverseId\': 513960}, \'multiverseid\': 513960}, {\'name\': \'Rechazo decisivo\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura a menos que su controlador pague {3}.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya oí suficiente".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80b49773-f017-4c1b-bb65-6245cac7fc20\', \'multiverseId\': 514251}, \'multiverseid\': 514251}, {\'name\': \'Déni décisif\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)\\n• Contrecarrez un sort non-créature ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {3}.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'en ai entendu assez. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0c220dd-574e-4d11-8b09-acedf1714ad1\', \'multiverseId\': 514542}, \'multiverseid\': 514542}, {\'name\': \'Negazione Decisiva\', \'text\': "Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)\\n• Neutralizza una magia non creatura bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {3}.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho sentito abbastanza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63d3ff37-c40f-4075-95d6-74e420184b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 514833}, \'multiverseid\': 514833}, {\'name\': \'断固たる否定\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体とあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\\n• クリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「もう聞き飽きたわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aab9e621-8ef0-4d9d-9d49-4dee9288d569\', \'multiverseId\': 515124}, \'multiverseid\': 515124}, {\'name\': \'결정적 거부\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 당신이 조종하는 생물 및 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 두 생물은 서로 싸운다. (각 생물은 서로에게 각자의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.)\\n• 생물이 아닌 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문의 조종자가 {3}을 지불하지 않으면 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"충분히 들었어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5fe60ab-9911-4780-828c-2a6fc56b85e7\', \'multiverseId\': 515415}, \'multiverseid\': 515415}, {\'name\': \'Negação Decisiva\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• A criatura alvo que você controla luta com a criatura alvo que você não controla. (Cada uma causa dano igual ao seu poder à outra.)\\n• Anule a mágica alvo não de criatura, a menos que seu controlador pague {3}.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Já ouvi o bastante."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82933c7d-74f5-482f-ae36-5a8cee25f099\', \'multiverseId\': 515706}, \'multiverseid\': 515706}, {\'name\': \'Окончательный Отказ\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Целевое существо под вашим контролем дерется с целевым существом не под вашим контролем. (Они наносят друг другу повреждения, равные своей силе.)\\n• Отмените целевое заклинание, не являющееся заклинанием существа, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {3}.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«С меня достаточно».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51db9189-9927-4d29-bb08-8ade0e919542\', \'multiverseId\': 515997}, \'multiverseid\': 515997}, {\'name\': \'定念拒斥\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•目标由你操控的生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\\n•除非目标非生物咒语的操控者支付{3}，否则反击之。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我听腻了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b118b28-0381-4010-97cd-c0d38bf7b451\', \'multiverseId\': 516288}, \'multiverseid\': 516288}, {\'name\': \'定念拒斥\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•目標由你操控的生物與目標不由你操控的生物互鬥。（它們各向對方造成等同於本身力量的傷害。）\\n•除非目標非生物咒語的操控者支付{3}，否則反擊之。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我聽膩了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a67d5c4e-b2fc-429c-bee5-c6be3ba36b85\', \'multiverseId\': 516579}, \'multiverseid\': 516579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entschiedene Ablehnung\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.\\n• Neutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {3}.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe genug gehört."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517505&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c64f3ec3-ebf7-47ce-a770-6582aa77b787\', \'multiverseId\': 517505}, \'multiverseid\': 517505}, {\'name\': \'Rechazo decisivo\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas.\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura a menos que su controlador pague {3}.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya oí suficiente".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18bba562-d80f-44b1-8787-cd3b04531185\', \'multiverseId\': 517510}, \'multiverseid\': 517510}, {\'name\': \'Déni décisif\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.\\n• Contrecarrez un sort non-créature ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {3}.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'en ai entendu assez. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517515&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77c0826e-9aaf-4468-bb41-2b404fd553f4\', \'multiverseId\': 517515}, \'multiverseid\': 517515}, {\'name\': \'Negazione Decisiva\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\\n• Neutralizza una magia non creatura bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {3}.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho sentito abbastanza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5683745-4903-4ba3-94c2-f7086baa5ae0\', \'multiverseId\': 517520}, \'multiverseid\': 517520}, {\'name\': \'断固たる否定\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体とあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。\\n• クリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「もう聞き飽きたわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e78b1f9e-7a65-4913-a2d0-9dca1d51eb3d\', \'multiverseId\': 517525}, \'multiverseid\': 517525}, {\'name\': \'결정적 거부\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 당신이 조종하는 생물과 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 두 생물은 서로 싸운다.\\n• 생물이 아닌 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문의 조종자가 {3}을 지불하지 않으면 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"충분히 들었어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ba617fa-36d1-4cda-8727-5139e284b453\', \'multiverseId\': 517530}, \'multiverseid\': 517530}, {\'name\': \'Negação Decisiva\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• A criatura alvo que você controla luta com a criatura alvo que você não controla.\\n• Anule a mágica alvo não de criatura, a menos que seu controlador pague {3}.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Já ouvi o bastante."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec1f317e-f5fb-4017-a79f-976640e3404a\', \'multiverseId\': 517535}, \'multiverseid\': 517535}, {\'name\': \'Окончательный Отказ\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Целевое существо под вашим контролем дерется с целевым существом не под вашим контролем.\\n• Отмените целевое заклинание, не являющееся заклинанием существа, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {3}.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«С меня достаточно».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74957b22-9f25-4aa9-b8af-d6acd286d46e\', \'multiverseId\': 517540}, \'multiverseid\': 517540}, {\'name\': \'定念拒斥\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•目标由你操控的生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。\\n•除非目标非生物咒语的操控者支付{3}，否则反击之。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我听腻了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2812245-e4fe-4a4b-ad42-1b9898fb21f5\', \'multiverseId\': 517545}, \'multiverseid\': 517545}, {\'name\': \'定念拒斥\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•目標由你操控的生物與目標不由你操控的生物互鬥。\\n•除非目標非生物咒語的操控者支付{3}，否則反擊之。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我聽膩了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca05518a-ac2d-40d0-9a41-1b5cbbc6e387\', \'multiverseId\': 517550}, \'multiverseid\': 517550}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erdrückende Enttäuschung\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler verliert 2 Lebenspunkte. Du ziehst zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die meisten Studenten konnten dem prüfenden Blick von Dekan Embrose kaum für ein oder zwei Semester ertragen. Kilian war damit aufgewachsen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513836&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'356bb792-fa1d-479b-8541-1e21368ae639\', \'multiverseId\': 513836}, \'multiverseid\': 513836}, {\'name\': \'Enorme decepción\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador pierde 2 vidas. Robas dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La mayoría de estudiantes apenas aguantan el escrutinio del decano Embrose un semestre o dos. Killian llevaba soportándolo toda su vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ee5418d-8ac6-46c7-8450-2d4f54cd5a77\', \'multiverseId\': 514127}, \'multiverseid\': 514127}, {\'name\': \'Déception écrasante\', \'text\': \'Chaque joueur perd 2 points de vie. Vous piochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La plupart des étudiants pouvaient à peine supporter l\'examen minutieux du doyen Embrose pendant un semestre ou deux ; Killian avait dû le supporter toute sa vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514418&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75476455-d1c4-47fb-8082-ea9690648055\', \'multiverseId\': 514418}, \'multiverseid\': 514418}, {\'name\': \'Delusione Devastante\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore perde 2 punti vita. Pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Pochi studenti possono sopportare lo sguardo scrutatore del decano Embrose per più di un semestre o due; Killian ci convisse per una vita intera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3915411f-b465-49b0-bd35-29da042350bb\', \'multiverseId\': 514709}, \'multiverseid\': 514709}, {\'name\': \'激しい落胆\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ２点のライフを失う。あなたはカード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ほとんどの生徒はエムブローズ学部長の監視に半年か一年しか耐えられない。しかしキリアンは一生をそうして過ごしてきたのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f6d1286-d89f-42b9-9072-bff4f4653587\', \'multiverseId\': 515000}, \'multiverseid\': 515000}, {\'name\': \'참담한 실망\', \'text\': \'각 플레이어는 생명 2점을 잃는다. 당신은 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'대부분의 학생들은 엠브로즈 학장의 철저한 검토를 한두 학기 견디는 것이 전부였다. 킬리안은 평생 동안 이를 겪으며 살았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea8b57e-3d68-45c0-b877-8f4b4e3d6019\', \'multiverseId\': 515291}, \'multiverseid\': 515291}, {\'name\': \'Desapontamento Esmagador\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador perde 2 pontos de vida. Você compra dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A maioria dos alunos mal podia suportar o escrutínio do decano Embrose por um ou dois semestres. Killian conviveu com isso por toda sua vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e72e1d9-dd12-417b-8e3c-bed949efc60c\', \'multiverseId\': 515582}, \'multiverseid\': 515582}, {\'name\': \'Сокрушительное Разочарование\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок теряет 2 жизни. Вы берете две карты.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Большинство студентов едва могут выдержать придирки декана Эмброза в течение одного-двух семестров. Киллиан терпит их всю свою жизнь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'105e5766-7d36-4198-8677-9a4882d16957\', \'multiverseId\': 515873}, \'multiverseid\': 515873}, {\'name\': \'极度失望\', \'text\': \'每位牌手各失去2点生命。你抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'面对安博斯院长的百般挑剔，大多数学生连一两个学期都忍不下去；但齐力安却得忍受一辈子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e6a0b8e-9693-46f9-83c9-cd2767beca80\', \'multiverseId\': 516164}, \'multiverseid\': 516164}, {\'name\': \'極度失望\', \'text\': \'每位玩家各失去2點生命。你抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'面對安博斯院長的百般挑剔，大多數學生連一兩個學期都忍不下去；但齊力安卻得忍受一輩子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c295503-4c6f-4b9b-9f9f-881eda016b98\', \'multiverseId\': 516455}, \'multiverseid\': 516455}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfahrener Wahrsager\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Eine der ersten Lektionen, die Studenten der Weissagung lernen, ist, wie man ein Omen von einer einfachen gekräuselten Oberfläche unterscheidet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513823&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fbc8329-3f53-49ac-8074-1ae495c51a90\', \'multiverseId\': 513823}, \'multiverseid\': 513823}, {\'name\': \'Adepto visionario\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, {T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'En una de las primeras lecciones de adivinación, los estudiantes aprenden a diferenciar un augurio de una simple onda en la superficie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd04a942-c8ed-4024-bed0-924d77ef0c1c\', \'multiverseId\': 514114}, \'multiverseid\': 514114}, {\'name\': \'Expert aruspice\', \'text\': "{1}{U}, {T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "L\'une des première leçons apprises par les étudiants en divination est de reconnaître la différence entre un présage et un simple remous.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514405&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd0d09f-b701-410c-ad82-519d3d10099c\', \'multiverseId\': 514405}, \'multiverseid\': 514405}, {\'name\': \'Indovino Esperto\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, {T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Una delle prime lezioni che gli studenti di divinazione imparano è come riconoscere la differenza tra un presagio e una semplice increspatura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52189226-2c3b-497b-8bcb-da53728b3808\', \'multiverseId\': 514696}, \'multiverseid\': 514696}, {\'name\': \'熟練した予言者\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, {T}：カード１枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'予言を学ぶ学生の最初の課題は、予兆と、単なる表面の波の違いを見分けることだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83d433ea-8c15-462f-8325-900cc8f22018\', \'multiverseId\': 514987}, \'multiverseid\': 514987}, {\'name\': \'능숙한 점쟁이\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, {T}: 카드 한 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인어 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'점술학과 학생들이 배우는 첫 번째 수업 중 하나는 단순한 수면의 물결과 징조 사이의 차이를 인식하는 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b58bc66f-befb-46b0-9d8b-63704eec5d97\', \'multiverseId\': 515278}, \'multiverseid\': 515278}, {\'name\': \'Adivinho Adepto\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, {T}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Uma das primeiras lições que os alunos de adivinhação aprendem é como reconhecer a diferença entre um presságio e uma simples ondulação na superfície.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f333463e-a68b-4a99-acb2-1139f4003e03\', \'multiverseId\': 515569}, \'multiverseid\': 515569}, {\'name\': \'Адепт-Предсказатель\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, {T}: возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Один из первых уроков, которые усваивают изучающие прорицание, — это то, как распознать разницу между знамением и простой рябью на поверхности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'659fc3ed-0f9c-4494-bcd6-2a9ae7cf2bf7\', \'multiverseId\': 515860}, \'multiverseid\': 515860}, {\'name\': \'预言专家\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}，{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'在占卜学最初的几堂课上，学生们主要学习如何区分水面涟漪是否含有预示征兆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4ad408-dc99-42c4-8e41-bdab5035fc92\', \'multiverseId\': 516151}, \'multiverseid\': 516151}, {\'name\': \'預言專家\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}，{T}：抽一張牌，然後棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人魚／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'在占卜學最初的幾堂課上，學生們主要學習如何區分水面漣漪是否含有預示徵兆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d156666c-b82b-4069-a470-29786583c6cc\', \'multiverseId\': 516442}, \'multiverseid\': 516442}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfindungsreiches Können\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {2}{U} bezahlen, anstatt die Manakosten dieses Zauberspruchs zu bezahlen.\\nFalls die {2}{U}-Kosten bezahlt wurden, ziehst du drei Karten. Danach erzeugt ein Gegner zwei Schatz-Spielsteine und wendet Hellsicht 2 an. Falls die regulären Kosten bezahlt wurden, ziehst du X Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513812&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1235cd96-0694-46f7-8682-2d52fd938ccb\', \'multiverseId\': 513812}, \'multiverseid\': 513812}, {\'name\': \'Dominio ingenioso\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {2}{U} en vez de pagar el coste de maná de este hechizo.\\nSi se pagó el coste de {2}{U}, robas tres cartas, luego un oponente crea dos fichas de Tesoro y adivina 2. Si no se pagó ese coste, robas X cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd4c6efd-632b-426c-b9e2-64d1fccc02a8\', \'multiverseId\': 514103}, \'multiverseid\': 514103}, {\'name\': \'Maîtrise ingénieuse\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez payer {2}{U} à la place de payer le coût de mana de ce sort.\\nSi le coût de {2}{U} a été payé, vous piochez trois cartes, puis un adversaire crée deux jetons Trésor et il applique regard 2. Si ce coût n\'a pas été payé, vous piochez X cartes.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514394&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'385e76aa-fed2-46af-8a9f-11d3b64fb56a\', \'multiverseId\': 514394}, \'multiverseid\': 514394}, {\'name\': \'Maestria Ingegnosa\', \'text\': \'Puoi pagare {2}{U} invece di pagare il costo di mana di questa magia.\\nSe è stato pagato il costo {2}{U}, pesca tre carte, poi un avversario crea due pedine Tesoro e profetizza 2. Se quel costo non è stato pagato, pesca X carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32d752e6-183f-4fe6-a486-0845da87c56b\', \'multiverseId\': 514685}, \'multiverseid\': 514685}, {\'name\': \'創意の熟達\', \'text\': \'あなたはこの呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、{2}{U}を支払ってもよい。\\nその{2}{U}のコストが支払われていたなら、あなたはカード３枚を引き、その後、対戦相手１人は宝物・トークン２つを生成し、占術２を行う。そのコストが支払われていないなら、あなたはカードＸ枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb5edcfd-8a20-4ccd-9738-ba3963ac1a87\', \'multiverseId\': 514976}, \'multiverseid\': 514976}, {\'name\': \'독창적인 숙련\', \'text\': \'당신은 이 주문의 마나 비용을 지불하는 대신 {2}{U}를 지불할 수 있다.\\n마나 비용 대신 {2}{U}가 지불되었다면, 당신은 카드 세 장을 뽑고, 상대 한 명이 보물 토큰 두 개를 만들고 그 플레이어가 점술 2를 한다. 그 비용이 지불되지 않았다면, 당신은 카드 X장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e3d4182-a817-418d-b650-48faf70d2dc6\', \'multiverseId\': 515267}, \'multiverseid\': 515267}, {\'name\': \'Maestria Engenhosa\', \'text\': \'Você pode pagar {2}{U} em vez de pagar o custo de mana desta mágica.\\nSe o custo de {2}{U} foi pago, você compra três cards e um oponente cria duas fichas de Tesouro e usa vidência 2. Se aquele custo não foi pago, você compra X cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'171d9979-61ae-4c38-ab78-cb253f58cb2f\', \'multiverseId\': 515558}, \'multiverseid\': 515558}, {\'name\': \'Гениальное Мастерство\', \'text\': \'Вы можете заплатить {2}{U} вместо уплаты мана-стоимости этого заклинания.\\nЕсли была уплачена стоимость {2}{U}, то вы берете три карты, затем оппонент создает две фишки Клада и предсказывает 2. Если та стоимость не была уплачена, вы берете X карт.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8449873-bf32-4532-89aa-a728a5ac87f3\', \'multiverseId\': 515849}, \'multiverseid\': 515849}, {\'name\': \'匠心奇技\', \'text\': \'你可以支付{2}{U}，而不支付此咒语的法术力费用。\\n如果曾支付此{2}{U}费用，则你抓三张牌，然后任一对手派出两个珍宝衍生物且其占卜2。如果并非支付此费用，则你抓X张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'497263e7-d95d-4b6e-a5a5-8da5fc4e9a57\', \'multiverseId\': 516140}, \'multiverseid\': 516140}, {\'name\': \'匠心奇技\', \'text\': \'你可以支付{2}{U}，而不支付此咒語的魔法力費用。\\n如果曾支付此{2}{U}費用，則你抽三張牌，然後任一對手派出兩個珍寶衍生物且其占卜2。如果並非支付此費用，則你抽X張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a6ef63d-b90d-43da-aeb8-e1c02cefe792\', \'multiverseId\': 516431}, \'multiverseid\': 516431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfindungsreiches Können\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {2}{U} bezahlen, anstatt die Manakosten dieses Zauberspruchs zu bezahlen.\\nFalls die {2}{U}-Kosten bezahlt wurden, ziehst du drei Karten. Danach erzeugt ein Gegner zwei Schatz-Spielsteine und wendet Hellsicht 2 an. Falls die regulären Kosten bezahlt wurden, ziehst du X Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa4295b7-939e-42a1-9550-d2082b3157ce\', \'multiverseId\': 516979}, \'multiverseid\': 516979}, {\'name\': \'Dominio ingenioso\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {2}{U} en vez de pagar el coste de maná de este hechizo.\\nSi se pagó el coste de {2}{U}, robas tres cartas, luego un oponente crea dos fichas de Tesoro y adivina 2. Si no se pagó ese coste, robas X cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25392dc-9c6c-4808-9184-971cd85b287b\', \'multiverseId\': 517074}, \'multiverseid\': 517074}, {\'name\': \'Maîtrise ingénieuse\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez payer {2}{U} à la place de payer le coût de mana de ce sort.\\nSi le coût de {2}{U} a été payé, vous piochez trois cartes, puis un adversaire crée deux jetons Trésor et il applique regard 2. Si ce coût n\'a pas été payé, vous piochez X cartes.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64074c3a-ed7f-408c-9cac-c0b870e343ec\', \'multiverseId\': 517169}, \'multiverseid\': 517169}, {\'name\': \'Maestria Ingegnosa\', \'text\': \'Puoi pagare {2}{U} invece di pagare il costo di mana di questa magia.\\nSe è stato pagato il costo {2}{U}, pesca tre carte, poi un avversario crea due pedine Tesoro e profetizza 2. Se quel costo non è stato pagato, pesca X carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b429cc82-44f0-4b42-84e0-25415cfa3344\', \'multiverseId\': 517264}, \'multiverseid\': 517264}, {\'name\': \'創意の熟達\', \'text\': \'あなたはこの呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、{2}{U}を支払ってもよい。\\n{2}{U}のコストが支払われていたなら、あなたはカード３枚を引き、その後、対戦相手１人は宝物・トークン２つを生成し、占術２を行う。そのコストが支払われていないなら、あなたはカードＸ枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=517359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9aa68b4-37b7-46fb-a998-4573c8c36529\', \'multiverseId\': 517359}, \'multiverseid\': 517359}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erster Unterrichtstag\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn in diesem Zug eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie und sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nLerne eine Lektion. (Du kannst entweder eine Lektion-Karte von außerhalb der Partie, die du besitzt, offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen oder eine Karte abwerfen, um eine Karte zu ziehen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd631eab-e5ce-4d52-b750-f0763bc4dc44\', \'multiverseId\': 513870}, \'multiverseid\': 513870}, {\'name\': \'Primer día de clase\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella y gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\\nAprende. (Puedes mostrar una carta de Lección de la cual eres propietario de fuera del juego y ponerla en tu mano o descartar una carta para robar una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8378ad7-7755-4821-b24f-1617dc3afd6c\', \'multiverseId\': 514161}, \'multiverseid\': 514161}, {\'name\': \'Rentrée des classes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle et elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nApprenez. (Vous pouvez révéler une carte de leçon que vous possédez en dehors de la partie et la mettre dans votre main, ou vous défausser d\'une carte pour piocher une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76fc0d56-34a4-4967-90c7-43f281dd207b\', \'multiverseId\': 514452}, \'multiverseid\': 514452}, {\'name\': \'Primo Giorno di Lezione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa e ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\\nApprendi. (Puoi rivelare una carta Lezione che possiedi al di fuori della partita e aggiungerla alla tua mano o scartare una carta per pescare una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d99d8e66-8f47-473e-a269-99fd75852fc2\', \'multiverseId\': 514743}, \'multiverseid\': 514743}, {\'name\': \'授業初日\', \'text\': \'このターン、クリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\\n履修を行う。（あなたは、ゲームの外部からあなたがオーナーである講義・カード１枚を公開しあなたの手札に加えるか、カード１枚を捨てカード１枚を引くか、どちらかを行ってもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d9b3d0d-913d-45c9-9743-e0db78aaaa0e\', \'multiverseId\': 515034}, \'multiverseid\': 515034}, {\'name\': \'수업 첫 날\', \'text\': \'이 턴에 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 그 생물은 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\\n학습한다. (당신은 게임 밖에서 당신이 소유한 수업 카드 한 장을 공개하고 그 카드를 당신의 손에 넣거나, 카드 한 장을 버린 후 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc70b917-6d51-42d3-bf4e-baa174af1b04\', \'multiverseId\': 515325}, \'multiverseid\': 515325}, {\'name\': \'Primeiro Dia de Aula\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela e ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\\nAprender. (Você pode revelar um card de Lição seu de fora do jogo e colocá-lo em sua mão, ou descartar um card para comprar um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07135b06-7090-45a6-8548-02ffa82e9f73\', \'multiverseId\': 515616}, \'multiverseid\': 515616}, {\'name\': \'Первый День Занятий\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем в этом ходу, положите на него один жетон +1/+1, и оно получает Ускорение до конца хода.\\nВыучите урок. (Вы можете показать принадлежащую вам карту Урока вне игры и положить ее в вашу руку, или вы можете сбросить карту, чтобы взять карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14899571-89a5-4b5f-b3f5-eb50b3bd0c16\', \'multiverseId\': 515907}, \'multiverseid\': 515907}, {\'name\': \'开学首日\', \'text\': \'本回合中，每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物，且其获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\\n温习。（你可以从游戏外展示一张由你拥有的课程牌并置于你手上，或弃一张牌来抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6a05aca-2c49-4e06-ad67-1e1e65a3cf95\', \'multiverseId\': 516198}, \'multiverseid\': 516198}, {\'name\': \'開學首日\', \'text\': \'本回合中，每當一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物，且其獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\\n溫習。（你可以從遊戲外展示一張由你擁有的課程牌並置於你手上，或棄一張牌來抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'570ac8c3-9c2c-47f6-8c15-63c62e507f7a\', \'multiverseId\': 516489}, \'multiverseid\': 516489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erweiterte Anatomie\', \'text\': \'Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie erhält Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei — Lektion\', \'flavor\': \'„Aus der Inkrementalgleichung eine Exponentialgleichung zu machen war ein Geniestreich von mir."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513769&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcd51d01-ae67-4520-97f5-d154c1e85c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 513769}, \'multiverseid\': 513769}, {\'name\': \'Anatomía expandida\', \'text\': \'Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Gana la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro — Lección\', \'flavor\': \'"Cambiar la ecuación de incremental a exponencial fue una idea brillante".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f30b5a3b-8428-4fbb-ab09-9eea63e48df3\', \'multiverseId\': 514060}, \'multiverseid\': 514060}, {\'name\': \'Anatomie renforcée\', \'text\': "Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée. Elle acquiert la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel : leçon\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai eu un éclair de génie quand j\'ai décidé de passer d\'une équation différentielle à une équation exponentielle. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514351&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7394c111-3f90-468d-8d52-f03d0d13f7c3\', \'multiverseId\': 514351}, \'multiverseid\': 514351}, {\'name\': \'Anatomia Estesa\', \'text\': \'Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. Ha cautela fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria — Lezione\', \'flavor\': \'"Cambiare l\\\'equazione da incrementale a esponenziale è stato un colpo di genio da parte mia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a33e2076-6ba6-45a9-8d13-5ff17165fc53\', \'multiverseId\': 514642}, \'multiverseid\': 514642}, {\'name\': \'拡張解剖学\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー — 講義\', \'flavor\': \'「累加の数式を累乗に変更したのは、まさに天才的なアイディアだったわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'521752f2-88a4-4e2e-a10e-938ad6a336f0\', \'multiverseId\': 514933}, \'multiverseid\': 514933}, {\'name\': \'확장된 해부학\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 경계를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법 — 수업\', \'flavor\': \'"방정식을 단순 증가에서 지수 증가로 바꾼 일은 내 딴에는 천재적인 일이었어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b200deb7-9ead-4d42-a967-aca3981d3d07\', \'multiverseId\': 515224}, \'multiverseid\': 515224}, {\'name\': \'Anatomia Expandida\', \'text\': \'Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo. Ela ganha vigilância até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço — Lição\', \'flavor\': \'"Mudar a equação de incremental para exponencial foi um golpe de gênio de minha parte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad511a8-0fdd-4c49-b07d-b30bc5ed50f9\', \'multiverseId\': 515515}, \'multiverseid\': 515515}, {\'name\': \'Расширенная Анатомия\', \'text\': \'Положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо. Оно получает Бдительность до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство — Урок\', \'flavor\': \'«Изменение уравнения с инкрементального на экспоненциальное было гениальным решением с моей стороны».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a55641-903b-4a20-a0f5-51fd16a928df\', \'multiverseId\': 515806}, \'multiverseid\': 515806}, {\'name\': \'宏展解剖学\', \'text\': \'在目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。它获得警戒异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术 ～课程\', \'flavor\': \'「把原来增量算式改成指数形式，算是我的点睛之笔吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a11ef4a1-dc58-4ae5-9c74-1f56b9290d89\', \'multiverseId\': 516097}, \'multiverseid\': 516097}, {\'name\': \'宏展解剖學\', \'text\': \'在目標生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。它獲得警戒異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術 ～課程\', \'flavor\': \'「把原本增量算式改成指數形式，算是我的點睛之筆吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0080d41f-db18-4ad8-a3fc-2059c3a0c2f5\', \'multiverseId\': 516388}, \'multiverseid\': 516388}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erzmagus-Emeritus\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Einige emeritierte Professoren kehren regelmäßig von ihren Reisen zurück, um Geschichten von den mystischen Wundern von Arcavios zu erzählen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=513805&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5aad1a5-fdaf-4d3b-adc9-b8efad2843a9\', \'multiverseId\': 513805}, \'multiverseid\': 513805}, {\'name\': \'Archimago emérito\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Ciertos profesores eméritos regresan de sus viajes de vez en cuando para compartir historias sobre las maravillas místicas de Arcavios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2a6e083-51b3-4df6-a084-94f89ed19aab\', \'multiverseId\': 514096}, \'multiverseid\': 514096}, {\'name\': \'Archimage émérite\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Certains professeurs émérites reviennent périodiquement de leurs voyages pour partager des récits concernant les merveilles mystiques d\'Arcavios.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514387&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93a97c61-9702-40ea-a8d7-c446f5239b39\', \'multiverseId\': 514387}, \'multiverseid\': 514387}, {\'name\': \'Arcimago Emerito\', \'text\': \'Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni professori emeriti tornano periodicamente dai loro viaggi per raccontare delle meraviglie mistiche di Arcavios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'964646ff-87d4-42b0-8e49-99e3adba6a4b\', \'multiverseId\': 514678}, \'multiverseid\': 514678}, {\'name\': \'大魔導師の名誉教授\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'名誉教授の中には定期的に放浪から戻りアルケヴィオスの神秘的な脅威の物語を共有する者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=514969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3798dc28-74af-40ad-89bf-181419296e54\', \'multiverseId\': 514969}, \'multiverseid\': 514969}, {\'name\': \'대마도사 명예교수\', \'text\': \'마도제작술 — 당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동하거나 복사할 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'몇몇 명예교수들은 방랑 중에 아르카비오스의 신비로운 불가사의에 대한 이야기를 나누기 위해 주기적으로 돌아온다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36418aef-764f-4d38-a5fe-5a70d3e61a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 515260}, \'multiverseid\': 515260}, {\'name\': \'Arquimago Emérito\', \'text\': \'Magifício — Toda vez que você conjurar ou copiar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns professores eméritos retornam de suas andanças periodicamente para compartilhar histórias sobre as maravilhas místicas de Arcávios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c462d563-ace1-4ba7-9f3c-e9bbb5196b32\', \'multiverseId\': 515551}, \'multiverseid\': 515551}, {\'name\': \'Заслуженный Архимаг\', \'text\': \'Чародейство — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете или копируете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые заслуженные профессора время от времени возвращаются из своих странствий, чтобы поделиться рассказами о таинственных чудесах Аркавиоса.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=515842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64a1e60f-49de-4bbe-ba94-d38173911b73\', \'multiverseId\': 515842}, \'multiverseid\': 515842}, {\'name\': \'荣休大法师\', \'text\': \'魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'有些荣休教授会定期回到校园，与学生分享自己漫游阿凯维沃时遇到的奇闻轶事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=516133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'424a9bfe-aef6-471b-b3f4-8ffb86750b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 516133}, \'multiverseid\': 516133}, {\'name\': \'榮休大法師\', \'text\': \'魔藝～每當你施放或複製瞬間或巫術咒語時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'有些榮休教授會定期回到校園，與學生分享自己漫遊阿凱維沃時遇到的奇聞軼事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/